    # lis "Si lo hiciera con un cuchillo me podría hacer... daño."
    lis "If I did it with a knife I could... hurt myself."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:986
translate english c31s002_lisFork_38e752a2:

    # mc "¿Pasa algo, [lis]?"
    mc "Is something wrong, [lis]?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:988
translate english c31s002_lisFork_b4ccaed5:

    # lis "Que mi marido es un idiota y aún no me ha besado."
    lis "My husband is an idiot and hasn't kissed me yet."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:989
translate english c31s002_lisFork_e18c8cee:

    # mc "*Guiño* Mi mujer es una vaga y aún ha dado la vuelta al mostrador."
    mc "*Winks* My wife is lazy and hasn't even walked around the counter yet."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:991
translate english c31s002_lisFork_acb71cac:

    # "Tu mujer deja el tenedor encima de la tabla de cortar y, tras rodear el mostrador, se lanza a tus brazos pidiendo su beso de buenos días."
    "Your wife leaves the fork on the cutting board and, after walking around the counter, throws herself into your arms asking for her good morning kiss."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:992
translate english c31s002_lisFork_8b2ae392:

    # "Sienta bien pensar en ella como tu esposa."
    "It feels good to think of her as your wife."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:994
translate english c31s002_lisFork_cd09a684:

    # mc "Buenos días, mi amor."
    mc "Good morning, my love."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:995
translate english c31s002_lisFork_b9685c7c:

    # lis "Buenos días, cielo."
    lis "Good morning, honey."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:996
translate english c31s002_lisFork_a3f6cd3d:

    # mc "¿A qué venía lo del tenedor?"
    mc "What was the fork thing about?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:998
translate english c31s002_lisFork_6c8e670a:

    # lis "[eva] y [ama] me dijeron una cosa hace unos días y estaba comprobando algo."
    lis "[eva] and [ama] told me something a few days ago and I was checking something."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:999
translate english c31s002_lisFork_8db0a783:

    # mc "No seas tan misteriosa. ¿Qué te dijeron y qué estabas comprobando?"
    mc "Don't be so mysterious. What did they tell you and what were you checking?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1001
translate english c31s002_lisFork_fe28b52a:

    # lis "Creen que es posible que mi mente no funcione bien y que no pueda sentir dolor."
    lis "They think it's possible my mind isn't working right and that I can't feel pain."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1002
translate english c31s002_lisFork_b46fe70e:

    # mc "No puede ser. En Los Angeles te dolían los pies..."
    mc "That can't be. In Los Angeles your feet hurt..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1005
translate english c31s002_lisFork_5a47ebba:

    # "Después de explicarte la teoría de [ama] y [eva]..."
    "After explaining [ama] and [eva]'s theory to you..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1006
translate english c31s002_lisFork_f12ab11d:

    # lis "Pero no tengo forma de comprobarlo. Si me pincho con el tenedor, noto la presión y me... duele."
    lis "But I have no way to prove it. If I poke myself with the fork, I feel the pressure and it... hurts."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1007
translate english c31s002_lisFork_06c76bb5:

    # lis "Como sé que tiene que doler, ya no sé si me duele de verdad o es mi cerebro que me está engañando."
    lis "Since I know it's supposed to hurt, I don't know anymore if it really hurts or if my brain is tricking me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1008
translate english c31s002_lisFork_8e9e7bdd:

    # lis "Por eso estaba probando lo del tenedor. Si me pincho sin darme cuenta, sabré si me duele de verdad."
    lis "That's why I was trying the fork thing. If I poke myself without realizing it, I'll know if it really hurts."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1009
translate english c31s002_lisFork_e9aae98c:

    # mc "No creo que funcione así. Notarías la presión igualmente."
    mc "I don't think it works like that. You'd feel the pressure anyway."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1010
translate english c31s002_lisFork_ac1fef7e:

    # mc "¿Por qué no vas al médico? No sé si eso es algo que se pueda detectar con... no sé... ¿un análisis de sangre?"
    mc "Why don't you go to the doctor? I don't know if that's something that can be detected with... I don't know... a blood test?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1012
translate english c31s002_lisFork_8784877e:

    # lis "Ya he hablado con [sam.nick] y con Tía [bet]."
    lis "I've already talked to [sam.nick] and Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1013
translate english c31s002_lisFork_7ae115fc:

    # lis "Dicen que es muy raro que, si tengo esa condición, nadie lo haya descubierto antes."
    lis "They say it's very weird that, if I have that condition, no one has discovered it before."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1014
translate english c31s002_lisFork_b3805061:

    # lis "Ni mis niñeras, ni mis padres... ni yo."
    lis "Not my nannies, not my parents... not even me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1015
translate english c31s002_lisFork_c7b88d70:

    # mc "Sí, sería raro que no te dieras cuenta al... no sé... rasparte las rodillas al subir a un árbol, o quemarte mientras cocinas..."
    mc "Yeah, it'd be weird if you didn't notice when... I don't know... scraping your knees climbing a tree, or burning yourself while cooking..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1017
translate english c31s002_lisFork_fd821e12:

    # lis "*Risa* ¿Con quién crees que te has casado? No he subido a un árbol en mi vida, y lo de cocinar..."
    lis "*Laugh* Who do you think you married? I've never climbed a tree in my life, and as for cooking..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1018
translate english c31s002_lisFork_ab4e96fb:

    # lis "Cuando me fui a Phoenix, mis amigas me regalaron un libro."
    lis "When I left for Phoenix, my friends gave me a book."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1019
translate english c31s002_lisFork_b29ff2e0:

    # mc "¿Un libro de cocina?"
    mc "A cookbook?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1021
translate english c31s002_lisFork_d1a75dc0:

    # lis "Más o menos. 'El microondas: Ese gran desconocido que puede salvarte la vida'."
    lis "More or less. 'The Microwave: That Great Unknown That Can Save Your Life'."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1022
translate english c31s002_lisFork_f712c22f:

    # mc "*Risa* Jamaal me regaló '¿Cómo tener tu cuarto como un cerdo (Manual del perfecto estudiante)?'"
    mc "*Laugh* Jamaal gave me 'How to Keep Your Room Like a Pigsty (The Perfect Student's Manual)'."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1023
translate english c31s002_lisFork_8a4fab20:

    # mc "Creo que tenemos que cambiar de amigos."
    mc "I think we need new friends."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1025
translate english c31s002_lisFork_a334e72f:

    # lis "Bueno, aquel libro me fue muy bien... En casa siempre había alguien a quien pedirle que cocinara algo."
    lis "Well, that book came in really handy... At home, there was always someone I could ask to cook something."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1026
translate english c31s002_lisFork_780dd5b0:

    # lis "No es que no hubiera usado nunca el microondas... Si me quería calentar un vaso de leche sabía hacerlo..."
    lis "It's not like I had never used a microwave... If I wanted to heat up a glass of milk, I knew how to do it..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1027
translate english c31s002_lisFork_ffb65d6b:

    # mc "No creo que te den una estrella Michelon por calentarte un vaso de leche."
    mc "I don't think they'll give you a Michelin star for heating up a glass of milk."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1028
translate english c31s002_lisFork_c9eaf488:

    # mc "Pero volviendo al tema importante... Aparte de hablar con [sam.nick] y con Tía [bet]..."
    mc "But getting back to the important topic... Besides talking to [sam.nick] and Aunt [bet]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1030
translate english c31s002_lisFork_8bfcb65c:

    # lis "[sam.nick] me ha programado una cita en el hospital la semana que viene."
    lis "[sam.nick] scheduled an appointment for me at the hospital next week."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1031
translate english c31s002_lisFork_f5147d7c:

    # lis "Pero para poder estar seguros me tendrán que hacer un estudio genético. Y odio las agujas."
    lis "But to be sure, they'll have to do a genetic study. And I hate needles."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1032
translate english c31s002_lisFork_3ba687da:

    # mc "*Risa contenida*"
    mc "*Suppressed laughter*"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1034
translate english c31s002_lisFork_f6973553:

    # lis "¿Qué es tan gracioso?"
    lis "What's so funny?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1035
translate english c31s002_lisFork_c816bacf:

    # mc "No, nada..."
    mc "No, nothing..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1037
translate english c31s002_lisFork_9f0e905f:

    # lis "¿QUÉ. ES. TAN. GRACIOSO?"
    lis "WHAT. IS. SO. FUNNY?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1038
translate english c31s002_lisFork_98975e83:

    # mc "No es nada. Una tontería que se me ha pasado por la cabeza. Pero no es el momento de hablar de ello."
    mc "It's nothing. Just something silly that crossed my mind. But this isn't the time to talk about it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1039
translate english c31s002_lisFork_4758f915:

    # lis "Si no me lo explicas ahora, posiblemente no haya otro momento. [eva] me enseñó a disparar..."
    lis "If you don't explain it to me right now, there might not be another time. [eva] taught me how to shoot..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1040
translate english c31s002_lisFork_f31480f0:

    # mc "Vale, vale... Cuando has dicho que odias las agujas... He pensado que, quizás, si al final no sientes dolor, dejarás de odiarlas..."
    mc "Okay, okay... When you said you hate needles... I thought that, maybe, if you end up not feeling pain, you'll stop hating them..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1041
translate english c31s002_lisFork_bbb15be7:

    # mc "Me ha parecido más gracioso cuando lo he pensado que ahora que lo digo en voz alta..."
    mc "It seemed funnier when I thought about it than it does now saying it out loud..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1043
translate english c31s002_lisFork_cdd3ddbe:

    # lis "*Risa* ¡Eres un idiota! ¡Las tonterías que se te ocurren cuando estoy hablando de algo serio!"
    lis "*Laugh* You're an idiot! The nonsense you come up with when I'm talking about something serious!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1044
translate english c31s002_lisFork_a8817eb3:

    # mc "Por eso decía que no era el momento de hablar de ello..."
    mc "That's why I said it wasn't the time to talk about it..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1046
translate english c31s002_lisFork_ccddd40f:

    # "Por alguna razón que no comprendes, te has ganado un beso."
    "For some reason you don't understand, you've earned a kiss."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1047
translate english c31s002_lisFork_8f5aa313:

    # "Prefieres no preguntar qué has hecho para ganártelo."
    "You prefer not to ask what you did to earn it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1049
translate english c31s002_lisFork_4c1d1f3c:

    # lis "Gracias por estar siempre cuando necesito que alguien haga el tonto a mi alrededor."
    lis "Thanks for always being there when I need someone to act like a fool around me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1050
translate english c31s002_lisFork_cb01d8a5:

    # lis "Me estaba comiendo la cabeza innecesariamente con todo esto, cuando a lo mejor no me pasa nada."
    lis "I was overthinking all this unnecessarily, when maybe there's nothing wrong with me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1051
translate english c31s002_lisFork_72272f39:

    # mc "Bueno, hacer el tonto se me da bien. Y actuar inteligentemente también. Me casé contigo, ¿no?"
    mc "Well, I'm good at acting like a fool. And acting smart too. I married you, didn't I?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1053
translate english c31s002_lisFork_ed1f6b24:

    # "[lis] se gira sin mediar palabra y se dirige hacia la tabla de cortar y el tenedor."
    "[lis] turns around without saying a word and heads towards the cutting board and the fork."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1054
translate english c31s002_lisFork_b56df1f2:

    # mc "¿He dicho algo malo?"
    mc "Did I say something wrong?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1057
translate english c31s002_lisFork_17b07106:

    # "La chica no dice nada hasta que no ha terminado de meter todo en el lavavajillas. Como si estuviera midiendo sus próximas palabras."
    "The girl doesn't say anything until she has finished putting everything in the dishwasher. As if she were weighing her next words."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1058
translate english c31s002_lisFork_582dccc0:

    # lis "Me has recordado que no tuvimos noche de bodas. Podemos tener un post-desayuno de bodas."
    lis "You reminded me that we didn't have a wedding night. We can have a 'wedding post-breakfast'."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1059
translate english c31s002_lisFork_627d5989:

    # "Comprendes por qué ha sopesado sus palabras antes de decirlas."
    "You understand why she weighed her words before saying them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1060
translate english c31s002_lisFork_f57e55eb:

    # "No debe ser fácil para una chica que ha perdido la virginidad hace menos de una semana decir '¿follamos?' sin sentirse un poco frívola."
    "It can't be easy for a girl who lost her virginity less than a week ago to say 'want to fuck?' without feeling a bit slutty."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1061
translate english c31s002_lisFork_f22f0125:

    # mc "Pre-desayuno, en mi caso. Pero me parece una idea estupenda."
    mc "'Wedding pre-breakfast', in my case. But it sounds like a great idea."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1063
translate english c31s002_lisFork_6a6ca51b:

    # lis "Pues tendré que ser tu desayuno... Antes de que tenga que irme a la universidad."
    lis "Well, I guess I'll have to be your breakfast... Before I have to leave for college."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1072
translate english c31s002_lisFork_93da06a4:

    # lis "Y antes de que a alguien más se le ocurra la misma idea."
    lis "And before anyone else gets the same idea."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1073
translate english c31s002_lisFork_81749af2:

    # mc "Creo que va a ser el mejor desayuno de la historia."
    mc "I think it's going to be the best breakfast ever."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1076
translate english c31s002_lisFork_50d44e3a:

    # "Al llegar a su habitación, tenéis una tórrida sesión de sexo."
    "Upon reaching your room, you have a steamy sex session."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1088
translate english c31s002_lisFork_2d783fdb:

    # "Es más corta de lo que ninguno de los dos querríais, pero las clases de [lis] no van a esperar."
    "It's shorter than either of you would like, but [lis]'s classes won't wait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1090
translate english c31s002_lisFork_14a5f301:

    # "Cuando La Princesa se va a la universidad, por fin puedes ir a desayunar algo. Las fuerzas empiezan a flaquear."
    "When The Princess leaves for college, you can finally go get some breakfast. Your energy is starting to wane."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1094
translate english c31s002_noLis_4456ea49:

    # "[lis] pasa por tu habitación poco después de que desayunes."
    "[lis] stops by your room shortly after you have breakfast."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1095
translate english c31s002_noLis_0b4c204f:

    # "No habláis de nada en concreto, pero sabes que quería pasar un rato a solas contigo antes de irse a clase."
    "You don't talk about anything in particular, but you know she wanted to spend some time alone with you before leaving for class."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1096
translate english c31s002_noLis_99819790:

    # "Antes de que te vayas a Aruba."
    "Before you leave for Aruba."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1097
translate english c31s002_noLis_7e2d6657:

    # "El día siguiente, el último que vas a estar en casa, va a ser complicado que paséis tiempo juntos, con lo que quiere adelantar la despedida."
    "The next day, your last day at home, it's going to be difficult for you to spend time together, so she wants to say her goodbye early."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1145
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_94e3b881:

    # "[sai] no tuvo su noche de bodas, pero eso no quiere decir que no vaya a recuperar el tiempo perdido."
    "[sai] didn't have her wedding night, but that doesn't mean she isn't going to make up for lost time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1156
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_89accf8e:

    # "[sai] te informará por videoconferencia de su embarazo cuando estés en Aruba."
    "[sai] will let you know about her pregnancy via video call when you're in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1163
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_292e8746:

    # "[sai] te informa de que está embarazada antes de irse. Es una gran noticia que compartís con alegría."
    "[sai] tells you she's pregnant before leaving. It's great news that you joyfully share."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1164
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_daee587b:

    # "No se lo va a decir a sus padres de momento. No quiere que pueda afectar a la llegada de [kal]."
    "She's not going to tell her parents for now. She doesn't want it to affect [kal]'s arrival."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1167
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_b66a506c:

    # "[sai] se asoma por tu habitación para pasar un rato a solas contigo."
    "[sai] stops by your room to spend some alone time with you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1168
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_a503cae4:

    # "El momento, aunque breve, sirve como despedida de la hermosa mujer de ojos oscuros. No vais a tener mucho más tiempo a solas antes de que te vayas."
    "The moment, although brief, serves as a farewell to the beautiful dark-eyed woman. You won't have much more time alone before you leave."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1174
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_30a80c68:

    # "La siguiente en aparecer es [eri], que también quiere un rato a solas contigo."
    "The next one to show up is [eri], who also wants some alone time with you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1176
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_6b0296ac:

    # "[eri] no tuvo su noche de bodas, pero eso no quiere decir que no vaya a recuperar el tiempo perdido."
    "[eri] didn't have her wedding night, but that doesn't mean she isn't going to make up for lost time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1187
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_10746fb2:

    # "[eri] te informará por videoconferencia de su embarazo cuando estés en Aruba."
    "[eri] will let you know about her pregnancy via video call when you're in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1194
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_e0e95aae:

    # "[eri] te informa de que está embarazada antes de irse. Si es niña se llamará Hope. No hacéis planes por si es niño."
    "[eri] informs you that she's pregnant before she leaves. If it's a girl, her name will be Hope. You don't make plans in case it's a boy."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1197
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_9aabac8f:

    # "[eri] pasa un rato contigo antes de irse a trabajar."
    "[eri] spends some time with you before leaving for work."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1198
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_c6da4a17:

    # "Cada momento con [eri] sabe siempre a poco. Esta vez, sabiendo que sirve como despedida, parece incluso más corto."
    "Every moment with [eri] always leaves you wanting more. This time, knowing it serves as a farewell, it feels even shorter."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1204
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_b092fa9d:

    # "Tras un pequeño descanso, [sca] aparece en tu habitación. También quiere su primera ración de sexo como mujer casada."
    "After a short rest, [sca] shows up in your room. She also wants her first helping of sex as a married woman."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1206
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_6b0296ac_1:

    # "[eri] no tuvo su noche de bodas, pero eso no quiere decir que no vaya a recuperar el tiempo perdido."
    "[eri] didn't get her wedding night, but that doesn't mean she won't make up for lost time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1217
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_fe98a28f:

    # "[sca] te informará por videoconferencia de su embarazo cuando estés en Aruba."
    "[sca] will let you know about her pregnancy via video call when you're in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1224
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_5b15e0ca:

    # "[sca] te informa de que está embarazada antes de irse. No habéis decidido ningún nombre todavía, pero hablaréis de ello en las próximas semanas."
    "[sca] informs you that she's pregnant before leaving. You haven't decided on a name yet, but you'll talk about it in the coming weeks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1226
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_d7e2ed36:

    # "En cuanto el embrión esté un poco desarrollado, quiere hacer pruebas genéticas para asegurarse de que no hay ningún problema."
    "As soon as the embryo has developed a bit, she wants to do genetic testing to make sure there are no issues."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1227
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_93e0069c:

    # "Cuando [sca] abandona tu habitación, entiendes perfectamente el dicho de que lo bueno, si breve..."
    "When [sca] leaves your room, you perfectly understand the saying that good things, if brief..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1230
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_a03add41:

    # "[sca] también quiere pasar unos últimos momentos contigo antes de que llegue tu partida."
    "[sca] also wants to spend a few last moments with you before your departure."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1232
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_c7b81ad3:

    # "Haber descubierto que tiene un medio hermano y 'perderlo' durante varios meses le da un punto triste a la despedida."
    "Having discovered that she has a half-brother and 'losing' him for several months gives a sad touch to the goodbye."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1234
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_382faf60:

    # "La despedida tiene un punto triste. Hace poco más de un mes que has vuelto y te vuelves a ir, esta vez por varios meses."
    "The goodbye has a touch of sadness. You've been back for just over a month and you're leaving again, this time for several months."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:1240
translate english c31s002_firstDayWedding_4b9fb8ef:

    # "No pasa mucho tiempo antes de que [eil] llame a tu puerta y tengáis una tórrida sesión de sexo."
