# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2448
translate english c31s002_farewell_698f0ad6:

    # "La despedida es corta y, pese a todo, da tiempo para que haya ojos llorosos y risas."
    "The farewell is short and, despite everything, there's time for teary eyes and some laughter."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2449
translate english c31s002_farewell_0caa64d9:

    # "Algunos abrazos son muy emotivos, como el que [eva] y [ama] comparten. Nunca han estado tanto tiempo separadas como van a estar ahora."
    "Some hugs are very emotional, like the one [eva] and [ama] share. They've never been apart for as long as they're going to be now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2450
translate english c31s002_farewell_f6a810ab:

    # "Incluso Jamaal promete que va a cuidar de las chicas en un momento de debilidad."
    "Even Jamaal promises to take care of the girls in a moment of weakness."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2452
translate english c31s002_farewell_a276e2b4:

    # mom "Deberíamos irnos ya o no podréis cumplir con el plan de vuelo."
    mom "We should leave now or you won't be able to stick to the flight plan."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2453
translate english c31s002_farewell_9f109cde:

    # mc "Tienes razón. Odio las despedidas. ¿Nos vamos?"
    mc "You're right. I hate goodbyes. Shall we go?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2455
translate english c31s002_farewell_66bf5fb1:

    # mom "Os llevo y así traeré tu camioneta de vuelta a casa."
    mom "I'll drive you, and that way I can bring your pick-up back home."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2456
translate english c31s002_farewell_d3bda289:

    # mom "La camioneta de [emm] por unos meses."
    mom "[emm]'s pick-up for a few months."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2457
translate english c31s002_farewell_b8bf7a54:

    # mc "Espero que la camioneta siga siendo negra cuando vuelva."
    mc "I hope the truck is still black when I come back."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2459
translate english c31s002_farewell_508c4647:

    # mom "*Risa* No te preocupes, no le dejaré pintarla de rosa. Y no es que ella YA me lo haya pedido..."
    mom "*Laugh* Don't worry, I won't let her paint it pink. And it's not like she hasn't ALREADY asked me..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2460
translate english c31s002_farewell_44a63719:

    # mc "*Risa* Aún no se ha enfriado mi asiento y ya está haciendo planes para destrozar la camioneta."
    mc "*Laugh* My seat hasn't even cooled down yet and she's already making plans to ruin the pick-up."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2461
translate english c31s002_farewell_92b8c28e:

    # mom "Vámonos."
    mom "Let's go."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2463
translate english c31s002_farewell_4ec17378:

    # "Unos minutos después, en el aeropuerto..."
    "A few minutes later, at the airport..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2464
translate english c31s002_farewell_20cb98ec:

    # mom "Cuídate, Tía [bet]. No dejes que [mc] haga ninguna tontería cuando estéis allí."
    mom "Take care, Aunt [bet]. Don't let [mc] do anything stupid while you're there."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2465
translate english c31s002_farewell_f402f0a1:

    # bet "No te preocupes. Creo que es el más maduro de los dos. Él debería evitar que yo haga alguna tontería."
    bet "Don't worry. I think he's the more mature of the two of us. He should be the one stopping me from doing anything stupid."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2466
translate english c31s002_farewell_25434250:

    # mc "Creo que eso va a ser trabajo de [ama]..."
    mc "I think that's going to be [ama]'s job..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2468
translate english c31s002_farewell_575b07a4:

    # ama "A mí no me metáis en eso. O sí. Al primero que haga alguna tontería lo pondré a correr varias vueltas alrededor de la base."
    ama "Don't drag me into this. Or actually, do. The first one of you two who does anything stupid will be running laps around the base."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2469
translate english c31s002_farewell_0b08c327:

    # ama "Y tendrá prohibida la pizza durante una semana."
    ama "And they'll be banned from having pizza for a week."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2470
translate english c31s002_farewell_f2cda72c:

    # mc "Creo que acabas de dar con la clave para que Tía [bet] se comporte bien."
    mc "I think you just found the key to making Aunt [bet] behave."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2472
translate english c31s002_farewell_603ec3ea:

    # mom "Y tú... Ten cuidado con la gente de allí. Es posible que todo haya cambiado en el tiempo que has estado fuera."
    mom "And you... Be careful with the people there. It's possible everything has changed in the time you've been away."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2473
translate english c31s002_farewell_9fd99c17:

    # mom "Si necesitas cualquier consejo que te pueda dar, estoy a una llamada de distancia."
    mom "If you need any advice, I'm just a phone call away."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2474
translate english c31s002_farewell_a648c9f9:

    # ama "¿Y si lo que necesito es hablar contigo de cualquier cosa que no tenga que ver con la empresa?"
    ama "And what if I just need to talk to you about anything that has nothing to do with the company?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2475
translate english c31s002_farewell_4d41e0a8:

    # mom "Entonces estoy a una videoconferencia de distancia."
    mom "Then I'm just a video call away."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2477
translate english c31s002_farewell_9c377d3b:

    # bet "*Risa* No estoy segura de si [mar] se pondría tan sentimental si fuera [emm] la que se va durante un mes."
    bet "*Laugh* I'm not sure if [mar] would get this sentimental if it were [emm] leaving for a month."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2478
translate english c31s002_farewell_c97a175d:

    # mc "Estoy seguro de que se pondría IGUAL de sentimental."
    mc "I'm sure she'd get JUST as sentimental."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2480
translate english c31s002_farewell_725ca39e:

    # mom "Por supuesto que sí."
    mom "Of course I would."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2482
translate english c31s002_farewell_a61fa941:

    # mom "Y a ti... Creo que no tengo ningún consejo que darte."
    mom "And as for you... I don't think I have any advice to give you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2483
translate english c31s002_farewell_3781362e:

    # mom "Pero te voy a echar mucho de menos."
    mom "But I'm going to miss you so much."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2484
translate english c31s002_farewell_f6391881:

    # mc "Yo también te voy a echar de menos. Hablaremos un montón por videoconferencia, no te preocupes."
    mc "I'm going to miss you too. We'll video call a lot, don't worry."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2489
translate english c31s002_farewell_7882f242:

    # mc "Te quiero."
    mc "I love you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2490
translate english c31s002_farewell_3e867ae5:

    # mom "Yo también te quiero."
    mom "I love you too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2492
translate english c31s002_farewell_5bc42aa0:

    # "La despedida de [mar] se hace demasiado corta. Pero hay un avión esperando."
    "The goodbye with [mar] feels too short. But there's a plane waiting."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2502
translate english c31s004_flight1_5d631bde:

    # "Un tipo del personal del aeropuerto recoge vuestras maletas y os lleva hasta el avión, donde hay una asistente de vuelo esperándoos."
    "A guy from the airport staff takes your bags and leads you to the plane, where a flight attendant is waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2503
translate english c31s004_flight1_06190e71:

    # "Os acercáis a ella mientras el tipo carga vuestro equipaje. [ama] y [bet] llevan relativamente poco."
    "You approach her while the guy loads your luggage. [ama] and [bet] packed relatively light."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2504
translate english c31s004_flight1_e099c1b3:

    # "Se va a ganar el sueldo del día con tu equipaje."
    "But he's going to earn his day's pay with your luggage."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2506
translate english c31s004_flight1_f5b1b9f7:

    # alb "Buenas tardes, Sr. Marks, Srta. Cavendish. Hola, [ama]."
    alb "Good afternoon, Mr. Marks, Miss Cavendish. Hello, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2508
translate english c31s004_flight1_08093088:

    # "[bet] no la saca de su error diciéndole que ya no es 'Srta.'"
    "[bet] doesn't correct her by telling her she's no longer a 'Miss'."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2509
translate english c31s004_flight1_412333a9:

    # alb "Soy [alb], y seré su asistente de vuelo. Espero que tengan un viaje agradable."
    alb "I'm [alb], and I'll be your flight attendant. I hope you have a pleasant trip."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2510
translate english c31s004_flight1_7c16e55c:

    # mc "Gracias, [alb]. Veo que conoces a [ama]. ¿Eres personal de NTR?"
    mc "Thanks, [alb]. I see you know [ama]. Are you NTR staff?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2512
translate english c31s004_flight1_81e5c231:

    # alb "Sí, Sr. Marks. Tanto los pilotos como yo formamos parte del Departamento de Soporte."
    alb "Yes, Mr. Marks. Both the pilots and I are part of the Support Department."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2513
translate english c31s004_flight1_fccbe7c2:

    # alb "Antes de que lo pregunte, los pilotos son... no son clones."
    alb "Before you ask, the pilots are... not clones."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2514
translate english c31s004_flight1_86ac42d1:

    # mc "No lo iba a preguntar. Si hacen bien su trabajo, no creo que tenga importancia."
    mc "I wasn't going to ask. If they do their job well, I don't think it matters."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2516
translate english c31s004_flight1_df590dd6:

    # alb "Si quieren subir a bordo, el plan de vuelo indica que despegaremos en unos minutos."
    alb "If you'd like to board, the flight plan indicates we'll be taking off in a few minutes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2517
translate english c31s004_flight1_e133b440:

    # alb "El vuelo nos llevará alrededor de seis horas, con lo que llegaremos alrededor de las 3:15 AM a Aruba, hora local."
    alb "The flight will take us about six hours, so we'll arrive around 3:15 AM in Aruba, local time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2518
translate english c31s004_flight1_debba945:

    # mc "Perfecto. Subamos"
    mc "Perfect. Let's board."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2521
translate english c31s004_flight1_13da10ce:

    # "Una vez en el avión, [alb] os guía hasta vuestros asientos y os indica que os preparéis para el despegue, que se produce unos minutos después."
    "Once on the plane, [alb] guides you to your seats and tells you to prepare for takeoff, which happens a few minutes later."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2522
translate english c31s004_flight1_26bcab8d:

    # mc "[alb] ha dicho algo... 'los pilotos son...', pero no ha acabado la frase. La ha cambiado a 'no son clones.'"
    mc "[alb] said something... 'the pilots are...', but she didn't finish the sentence. She changed the end mid-sentence to 'not clones.'"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2523
translate english c31s004_flight1_ff922d40:

    # mc "¿Sabes a qué se refería?"
    mc "Do you know what she meant?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2524
translate english c31s004_flight1_97d39f90:

    # ama "Seguramente iba a decir 'humanos' o 'normales'. Habrá cambiado el final de la frase porque no sabe qué piensas de los clones."
    ama "She was probably going to say 'human' or 'normal'. She must have changed the end of the sentence because she doesn't know what you think of clones."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2525
translate english c31s004_flight1_b321445a:

    # ama "Y ahora eres el gran jefe. Acostúmbrate a que la gente vaya con pies de plomo a tu alrededor."
    ama "And now you're the big boss. Get used to people walking on eggshells around you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2527
translate english c31s004_flight1_e59b2a38:

    # mc "¡Eso es inaceptable! [eva] o tú sois tan normales o humanas como ella."
    mc "That's unacceptable! You and [eva] are just as normal or human as she is."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2529
translate english c31s004_flight1_5b8d657d:

    # mc "¡Eso es inaceptable! [eri], [dap], o [emm] son tan normales o humanas como ella."
    mc "That's unacceptable! [eri], [dap], or [emm] are just as normal or human as she is."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2531
translate english c31s004_flight1_e8c48027:

    # ama "*Risa* Espero que no. [alb] es un poco cabeza hueca. Pero no es mala chica."
    ama "*Laugh* I hope not. [alb] is a bit of an airhead. But she's not a bad girl."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2533
translate english c31s004_flight1_b5529fa2:

    # ama "Pero hablando en serio, parte del personal transversal piensa eso de los clones."
    ama "But seriously, some of the cross-departmental staff think that about clones."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2535
translate english c31s004_flight1_fc13afce:

    # ama "Piensan que somos un producto, que no llegamos a ser personas completas."
    ama "They think we're a product, that we aren't complete people."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2537
translate english c31s004_flight1_6dcdd2e6:

    # ama "Piensan que son un producto, que no llegamos a ser personas completas."
    ama "They think they're a product, that they aren't complete people."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2538
translate english c31s004_flight1_5c8035dc:

    # mc "Hablaré con ella después del despegue. Es una de las cosas que tenemos que cambiar."
    mc "I'll talk to her after takeoff. It's one of the things we need to change."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2540
translate english c31s004_flight1_074add6d:

    # bet "Creo que no deberías hacerlo. No es el momento de cambiar la opinión de una persona, porque no lo vas a conseguir."
    bet "I don't think you should. It's not the time to try and change someone's mind, because you won't succeed."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2541
translate english c31s004_flight1_b7312607:

    # bet "Tienes que demostrar que tú ves a los clones como personas, pero lo tienes que demostrar con acciones, no con palabras."
    bet "You have to show that you see clones as people, but you have to show it with actions, not words."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2542
translate english c31s004_flight1_45192528:

    # bet "Y no va a servir de nada que la chica se esté preocupando durante todo el viaje por si la vas a despedir por un desliz que ha corregido a tiempo."
    bet "And it won't do any good to have the girl worrying the whole trip about whether you're going to fire her for a slip-up she corrected in time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2543
translate english c31s004_flight1_cbe66f7a:

    # mc "Tienes razón, no puedo echarle la bronca por algo que no ha dicho."
    mc "You're right, I can't tell her off for something she didn't actually say."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2545
translate english c31s004_flight1_c4422946:

    # ama "Además, no serviría de nada. Las personas que tienen esa opinión no van a cambiarla por lo que puedas decirles."
    ama "Besides, it wouldn't do any good. People who hold that opinion aren't going to change it just because of what you say to them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2546
translate english c31s004_flight1_c864fea1:

    # ama "Si ven a los clones como herramientas de usar y tirar, sólo podrán cambiar de opinión cuando hagas cambios que les demuestren lo contrario."
    ama "If they see clones as disposable tools, they'll only change their minds when you make changes that prove otherwise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2547
translate english c31s004_flight1_d767ced3:

    # mc "Pues habrá que empezar a ver qué medidas podemos tomar en ese sentido."
    mc "Well, we'll have to start looking into what measures we can take in that regard."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2548
translate english c31s004_flight1_898cbc62:

    # mc "Tenemos seis horas por delante para empezar a hacer planes."
    mc "We have six hours ahead of us to start making plans."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2550
translate english c31s004_flight1_bea35b7e:

    # bet "Mientras vosotros trabajáis, yo voy a aprovechar para echar una siesta en ese sofá de ahí atrás."
    bet "While you guys work, I'm going to take the opportunity to take a nap on that couch back there."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2551
translate english c31s004_flight1_ee53125c:

    # bet "Si llegamos a Aruba a las 3, y mañana hay que levantarse temprano, prefiero adelantar un poco de sueño."
    bet "If we get to Aruba at 3 AM, and we have to wake up early tomorrow, I'd rather get some sleep ahead of time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2552
translate english c31s004_flight1_fe3c9d06:

    # mc "No lo había pensado. Vamos a dormir muy poco esta noche."
    mc "I hadn't thought about that. We're going to get very little sleep tonight."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2554
translate english c31s004_flight1_574bd71a:

    # mc "¿Quieres dormir algo tú también?"
    mc "Do you want to get some sleep too?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2555
translate english c31s004_flight1_b61f2ea5:

    # ama "Ahora mismo no tengo nada de sueño. Trabajar un rato me parece una buena idea."
    ama "I'm not sleepy at all right now. Working for a bit sounds like a good idea."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2556
translate english c31s004_flight1_fd576e9e:

    # mc "Entonces, vamos a hacer una lluvia de ideas para lo que podemos hacer en los próximos días."
    mc "Then let's brainstorm on what we can do over the next few days."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2558
translate english c31s004_flight1_b2209ad3:

    # "Mientras [ama] y tú trabajáis durante las siguientes tres horas, [bet] duerme silenciosamente en el sofá de detrás vuestro."
    "While you and [ama] work for the next three hours, [bet] sleeps quietly on the couch behind you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2559
translate english c31s004_flight1_1a7868ba:

    # "Una vez te dijo que, durante su tiempo en África, aprendió a quedarse dormida cada vez que tenía la oportunidad de hacerlo."
    "She once told you that, during her time in Africa, she learned to fall asleep whenever she had the chance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2560
translate english c31s004_flight1_b4f0434d:

    # "Nunca podía saber cuándo llegaría una urgencia que la tendría despierta durante varias horas."
    "She never knew when an emergency would come up that would keep her awake for hours."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2561
translate english c31s004_flight1_e34443db:

    # "Hablando con [ama] sobre las cosas que podéis hacer una vez lleguéis a Aruba, aparecen muchas ideas interesantes."
    "A lot of interesting ideas come up while talking with [ama] about the things you can do once you get to Aruba."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2562
translate english c31s004_flight1_b2e6d814:

