    "There are 1,247 pairs of boots on the base. Followed by a breakdown by size and how many individuals wear each size."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2878
translate english c31s004_flight2_69c23f22:

    # "[bet] se ha quedado dormida poco después de volver a su sofá."
    "[bet] fell asleep shortly after returning to her couch."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2879
translate english c31s004_flight2_eca863e7:

    # "Envidias esa capacidad de poderse quedar dormida rápidamente en cualquier circunstancia."
    "You envy that ability to fall asleep quickly in any circumstance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2881
translate english c31s004_flight2_31faaefa:

    # "Cada vez te cuesta más mantener los ojos abiertos."
    "It's getting harder and harder to keep your eyes open."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2882
translate english c31s004_flight2_49ba4d3b:

    # "Entre el cansancio del largo día de despedidas y lo aburridos que son los informes de [aar], se convierte en una lucha titánica."
    "Between the exhaustion of the long day of goodbyes and how boring [aar]'s reports are, it becomes a titanic struggle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2884
translate english c31s004_flight2_bdb1cd7b:

    # "Una lucha que pierdes cuando aún quedan dos horas para aterrizar."
    "A struggle you lose when there are still two hours left until landing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2885
translate english c31s004_flight2_5d600ac5:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 39 – VIERNES{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 39 – FRIDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2887
translate english c31s004_flight2_7cf3e3a5:

    # alb "Señor, estamos a punto de aterrizar. Deberían abrocharse los cinturones."
    alb "Sir, we are about to land. You should fasten your seatbelts."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2889
translate english c31s004_flight2_c55e0697:

    # mc "Gracias, [alb]. Voy a despertar a [ama] y a Tía [bet]."
    mc "Thank you, [alb]. I'll wake up [ama] and Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2890
translate english c31s004_flight2_09940810:

    # alb "Gracias, Señor."
    alb "Thank you, Sir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2892
translate english c31s004_flight2_762c74cc:

    # "Sacudes suavemente a [ama]."
    "You gently shake [ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2894
translate english c31s004_flight2_81bedd53:

    # mc "Cielo, despierta. Estamos a punto de aterrizar."
    mc "Honey, wake up. We're about to land."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2896
translate english c31s004_flight2_e815c473:

    # mc "[ama], despierta. Estamos a punto de aterrizar."
    mc "[ama], wake up. We're about to land."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2898
translate english c31s004_flight2_36b1463a:

    # "Su despertar no es como esperabas."
    "Her waking up isn't what you expected."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2900
translate english c31s004_flight2_6df40afd:

    # ama "¡Lo siento! ¿Te he hecho daño?"
    ama "I'm sorry! Did I hurt you?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2901
translate english c31s004_flight2_bd5b09f3:

    # "No quieres hacerla sentir mal, con lo que bromeas sobre el asunto."
    "You don't want to make her feel bad, so you joke about it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2902
translate english c31s004_flight2_40414d44:

    # mc "*Risa* Nada que una semana con el brazo en cabestrillo no pueda resolver."
    mc "*Laugh* Nothing a week with my arm in a sling won't fix."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2903
translate english c31s004_flight2_7a6a5ad6:

    # mc "Estamos a punto de aterrizar. [alb] ha venido a avisarnos de que nos pongamos los cinturones."
    mc "We're about to land. [alb] came to tell us to fasten our seatbelts."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2904
translate english c31s004_flight2_e14d9fb9:

    # mc "Voy a despertar a [bet]."
    mc "I'm going to wake [bet] up."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2907
translate english c31s004_flight2_756e4c21:

    # "Cuando te levantas, [bet] ya se está desperezando."
    "When you get up from your seat, [bet] is already stretching."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2908
translate english c31s004_flight2_0052fdc2:

    # bet "No hace falta que me despiertes. Me quedo dormida rápido, y me despierto igual de rápido."
    bet "No need to wake me. I fall asleep fast, and I wake up just as fast."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2909
translate english c31s004_flight2_35b6e99e:

    # mc "Perfecto. ¿Vienes a sentarte con nosotros para el aterrizaje?"
    mc "Perfect. Are you coming to sit with us for the landing?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2910
translate english c31s004_flight2_67bf9f80:

    # bet "Voy."
    bet "I'm coming."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2912
translate english c31s004_flight2_576f047c:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa [ama]? No me has roto nada..."
    mc "What's wrong, [ama]? You haven't broken any of my bones..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2914
translate english c31s004_flight2_1ec78dc1:

    # ama "Podía haberlo hecho. Este viaje me está poniendo los nervios de punta. Volver a la base..."
    ama "I could have. This trip is putting my nerves on edge. Going back to the base..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2915
translate english c31s004_flight2_06219e5b:

    # ama "Siempre voy a ser la misma persona desquiciada entrenada para matar..."
    ama "I'm always going to be the same deranged person trained to kill..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2916
translate english c31s004_flight2_7e186494:

    # mc "Si quitas 'la misma' y 'desquiciada' de esa frase, estoy de acuerdo, pero eres mucho más."
    mc "If you take out 'the same' and 'deranged' from that sentence, I agree, but you're so much more."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2917
translate english c31s004_flight2_fcb69b65:

    # mc "Y no eres la misma que se fue hace meses de Aruba. No eres ni siquiera la misma que vino con [aar] a casa."
    mc "And you're not the same person who left Aruba months ago. You're not even the same person who came home with [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2919
translate english c31s004_flight2_acc739f1:

    # bet "[mc] tiene razón. ¿Cuánto hace que te conocemos? ¿Tres semanas?"
    bet "[mc] is right. How long have we known you? Three weeks?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2921
translate english c31s004_flight2_0894abb3:

    # ama "Ayer hizo tres semanas que conocí a [mar] y a [nor]. Hoy hará tres semanas que conocí al resto. Secuestros aparte, claro."
    ama "Yesterday marked three weeks since I met [mar] and [nor]. Today will be three weeks since I met the rest of you. Kidnappings aside, of course."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2922
translate english c31s004_flight2_57347fd3:

    # ama "Porque ya es mañana, ¿verdad?"
    ama "Because it's already tomorrow, right?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2923
translate english c31s004_flight2_611aa062:

    # mc "Sí, ya es mañana. Incluso en casa."
    mc "Yeah, it's already tomorrow. Even at home."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2925
translate english c31s004_flight2_44aa4327:

    # bet "¿Te acuerdas de la chica que vino aquel día a cenar? Porque yo sí que me acuerdo."
    bet "Do you remember the girl who came to dinner that day? Because I sure do."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2926
translate english c31s004_flight2_888e7f80:

    # bet "Eras más tímida de lo que eres hoy. Más insegura. ¡Te dábamos miedo!"
    bet "You were shyer than you are today. More insecure. You were scared of us!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2927
translate english c31s004_flight2_85630bf9:

    # mc "A mí también me daría miedo conocer a una familia como la nuestra."
    mc "I'd be scared to meet a family like ours too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2929
translate english c31s004_flight2_5d521af9:

    # mc "Pero ahora formas parte de ella. Has encontrado amigas nuevas. Hermanas. Una familia nueva que no sustituye tu familia anterior."
    mc "But now you're part of it. You've found new friends. Sisters. A new family that doesn't replace your old one."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2930
translate english c31s004_flight2_8512420b:

    # "Después de lo que pasó con [eva], prefieres aclarar que aceptar la nueva familia no significa traicionar a la antigua."
    "After what happened with [eva], you prefer to clarify that accepting the new family doesn't mean betraying the old one."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2931
translate english c31s004_flight2_58af43b9:

    # mc "Has crecido como persona. Como mujer."
    mc "You've grown as a person. As a woman."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2933
translate english c31s004_flight2_2fa12777:

    # mc "Incluso te has casado."
    mc "You've even gotten married."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2935
translate english c31s004_flight2_451ea7e1:

    # ama "*Risa* No sé si eso es bueno o malo."
    ama "*Laugh* I don't know if that's a good or a bad thing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2936
translate english c31s004_flight2_96825b34:

    # mc "¡Hey!"
    mc "Hey!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2938
translate english c31s004_flight2_ac50cdcf:

    # bet "*Risa* No sabemos qué gusto tenías para los hombres antes, con lo que no podemos saber si has evolucionado para bien o para mal."
    bet "*Laugh* We don't know what your taste in men was like before, so we can't know if you've evolved for better or worse."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2939
translate english c31s004_flight2_85e7ec37:

    # mc "¡Hey! Estoy aquí. Lo sabéis, ¿verdad?"
    mc "Hey! I'm right here. You know that, right?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2941
translate english c31s004_flight2_9fbf1aa0:

    # bet "A ver, si antes le gustaba Jason Moanoa y se ha acabado casando contigo..."
    bet "I mean, if she used to like Jason Moanoa and ended up marrying you..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2942
translate english c31s004_flight2_ffee94dd:

    # mc "*Risa* Si a Jason le quitas la fama, el dinero, el pelo, la barba, y los músculos... ¿Qué tiene que no tenga yo?"
    mc "*Laugh* If you take away Jason's fame, money, hair, beard, and muscles... What does he have that I don't?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2944
translate english c31s004_flight2_66ef0658:

    # bet "*Risa* Nada, nada..." (multiple=2)
    bet "*Laugh* Nothing, nothing..." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2945
translate english c31s004_flight2_79b7f536:

    # ama "*Risa* ¿Talento para actuar?" (multiple=2)
    ama "*Laugh* Acting talent?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2946
translate english c31s004_flight2_3267f1ce:

    # mc "¡Paren este avión, quiero bajarme!"
    mc "Stop this plane, I want to get off!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2948
translate english c31s004_flight2_e1ac6040:

    # bet "Pero hablando en serio..."
    bet "But seriously..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2949
translate english c31s004_flight2_3ba4b337:

    # bet "Lo que quería decir [mc], aunque le guste darle muchas vueltas a todo, es que no eres la misma que conocimos hace tres semanas."
    bet "What [mc] wanted to say, even though he likes to beat around the bush, is that you're not the same person we met three weeks ago."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2952
translate english c31s004_flight2_e0f4645a:

    # bet "Lo que quiere decir [mc], aunque le guste darle muchas vueltas a todo, es que no eres la misma que conocimos hace tres semanas."
    bet "What [mc] means to say, even though he likes to beat around the bush, is that you're not the same person we met three weeks ago."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2953
translate english c31s004_flight2_b36be703:

    # bet "Ya no sois [eva] y tú contra el mundo. Ahora nos tenéis a nosotros también."
    bet "It's no longer just you and [eva] against the world. Now you have us too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2954
translate english c31s004_flight2_0ebf2174:

    # bet "Nadie se mete con un Marks sin que 23 personas le salten al cuello."
    bet "Nobody messes with a Marks without 23 people jumping at their throat."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2955
translate english c31s004_flight2_b547ee30:

    # mc "Y si no, siempre podemos mandar a Jamaal a atropellarlo. Aunque salta poco."
    mc "And if not, we can always send Jamaal to run them over. Even though he can't jump too high."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2957
translate english c31s004_flight2_736d580a:

    # ama "No podría hacer esto sin vosotros. Gracias..."
    ama "I couldn't do this without you guys. Thank you..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2959
translate english c31s004_flight2_520e658b:

    # ama "Y sobre lo de atropellar a alguien... *Risita* Creo que cuando conozcáis a un tal [dam], un clon de la serie D, os entrarán ganas de hacerlo."
    ama "And about running someone over... *Giggles* I think when you meet a certain [dam], a D-series clone, you'll feel like doing it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2960
translate english c31s004_flight2_8c86aede:

    # alb "*Megafonía* Aterrizaremos en unos minutos. Recuerden abrocharse los cinturones."
    alb "*PA system* We will be landing in a few minutes. Please remember to fasten your seatbelts."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2961
translate english c31s004_flight2_1f8baac2:

    # mc "Bueno, creo que el viaje de verdad empieza ahora. No es nada que no podamos hacer juntos."
    mc "Well, I think the real trip starts now. It's nothing we can't do together."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2962
translate english c31s004_flight2_9584d0e2:

    # mc "Y si hay que atropellar al tal [dam], se le atropella."
    mc "And if we have to run over this [dam] guy, we'll run him over."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2969
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_62c3affa:

    # "Una vez el avión aterriza, va directamente a lo que parece un hangar militar."
    "Once the plane lands, it goes straight to what looks like a military hangar."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2970
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_2ede401c:

    # "[aar] os está esperando con un coche dentro del hangar."
    "[aar] is waiting for you with a car inside the hangar."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2974
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_41b5383b:

    # "A [ama] se le ilumina la cara al verlo por la ventanilla."
    "[ama]'s face lights up when she sees him through the window."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2976
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_770cf792:

    # "Y hace lo que nunca hubieras esperado de alguien como [ama]."
    "And she does what you would never have expected from someone like [ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2977
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_350aa7cb:

    # "Por su cara de sorpresa, [aar] tampoco lo hubiera esperado nunca."
    "Judging by his surprised face, [aar] would never have expected it either."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2979
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_dcb99871:

    # ama "No tenías que haberte molestado en venir."
    ama "You didn't have to bother coming."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2980
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_06c41f7f:

    # aar "Era lo menos que podía hacer..."
    aar "It was the least I could do..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2982
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_3a4f68fa:

    # mc "[aar], es un placer verte en persona en vez de hacerlo a través de una pantalla."
    mc "[aar], it's a pleasure to see you in person instead of through a screen."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2983
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_2e0531e7:

    # aar "Lo mismo digo, [mc]. Tenía ganas de traspasarte el trabajo de CEO."
    aar "Likewise, [mc]. I was looking forward to handing the CEO job over to you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2985
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_ba759fc9:

    # aar "*Susurrando* ¿Qué le habéis hecho a [ama]?"
    aar "*Whispering* What have you done to [ama]?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2986
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_5c450db9:

    # mc "*Risa* Enseñarle a mostrar lo que siente. Es un buen cambio."
    mc "*Laugh* We taught her to express what she feels. It's a good change."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2988
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_39c9cc94:

    # ama "Jeetje mina*! ¡[aar] es tu clon! \n* ¡Madre mía! en holandés."
    ama "Jeetje mina*! [aar] is your clone! \n* 'Mother of mine!' in Dutch."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2990
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_a51b1017:

    # mc "Te dije que lo descubriría en el momento en que nos viera juntos."
    mc "I told you she'd figure it out the moment she saw us together."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2991
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_238515b8:

    # aar "Tenía que intentarlo."
    aar "I had to try."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2993
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_211c275e:

    # ama "¿Tú lo sabías? ¿Por qué no me dijiste nada?"
    ama "You knew? Why didn't you tell me?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2994
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_6e71b403:

    # mc "Se lo prometí a [aar]. Me dijo que quería contároslo él."
    mc "I promised [aar]. He told me he wanted to tell you himself."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2996
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_5d401034:

    # bet "Si por videoconferencia era obvio, solo un ciego no lo descubriría viéndoos juntos."
    bet "If it was obvious over a video call, only a blind person wouldn't figure it out seeing you together."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2997
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_8f5a1fb0:

    # mc "Ya, es lo que pensé."
    mc "Yeah, that's what I thought."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2999
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_1e2626b7:

    # ama "¿Tú también lo sabías? ¿[eva] también lo sabe? ¿Soy la única idiota que no lo sabía?"
    ama "You knew too? Does [eva] know too? Am I the only idiot who didn't know?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3000
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_aa6c3611:

    # mc "No, [ama]. [eva] tampoco lo sabe. [aar] quería decíroslo en persona."
    mc "No, [ama]. [eva] doesn't know either. [aar] wanted to tell both of you in person."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3002
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_eb18b069:

    # aar "Creo que pequé un poco de ingenuo."
    aar "I think I was a bit naive."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3003
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_780c2b55:

    # mc "¿Sólo un poco?"
    mc "Just a bit?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3005
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_cc91dae0:

    # ama "Bueno, sabíamos que eras el clon de alguien. No sabíamos de quién."
    ama "Well, we knew you were someone's clone. We just didn't know whose."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3006
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_28d13ec0:

    # ama "¿Cuándo lo descubriste? ¿Por qué no nos dijiste nada?"
    ama "When did you find out? Why didn't you tell us anything?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3008
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_f3692149:

    # aar "Yo lo sé desde hace unos meses, cuando empezó la Guerra Clon. Pero no era el momento de decir nada."
    aar "I've known for a few months, since the Clone War started. But it wasn't the right time to say anything."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3009
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_95ab0870:

    # aar "Me extrañó que no dijerais nada el día que conocimos a [mar] y a [nor], con lo que pensé que no era demasiado obvio."
    aar "I was surprised you didn't say anything the day we met [mar] and [nor], so I thought it wasn't too obvious."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3011
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_69720dec:

    # aar "Hace años que no tengo tu aspecto, y no creo que las chicas lo recuerden."
    aar "I haven't looked like you for years, and I don't think the girls remember how I looked back then."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3012
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_ca38fbc7:

    # mc "Creo que tiene más que ver con lo impactadas que estaban por conocer a [mar] y a [nor]."
    mc "I think it has more to do with how shocked they were to meet [mar] and [nor]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3013
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_fa493f58:

    # mc "Me parece que no nos miraron más de un par de veces."
    mc "I don't think they looked at us more than a couple of times."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3015
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_74cb3c6a:

    # ama "Supongo que debe ser eso. He tardado menos de un minuto en verlo ahora."
    ama "I guess that must be it. It took me less than a minute to see it now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3016
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_c69d3bfc:

    # mc "Es normal que no tuvieras más que ojos para [mar] y [nor] aquel día, cielo."
    mc "It's normal that you only had eyes for [mar] and [nor] that day, sweetie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3019
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_2a441c4a:

    # ama "*Risa* Al menos sé que mi marido no se va a quedar calvo."
    ama "*Laugh* At least I know my husband isn't going to go bald."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3020
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_464ccb1b:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso también me da cierta alegría a mí."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm pretty happy about that too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3021
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_7d031e06:

    # mc "Aunque yo sería un calvo orgulloso si pasara, de esos que se rapan al cero. Nada de pelucas para mí."
    mc "Although I'd be a proud bald guy if it happened, the kind who shaves it all off. No wigs for me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3023
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_0b43a49d:

    # aar "¿Qué? ¿Marido? ¿De qué va esto? ¿Es algún tipo de tapadera?"
    aar "What? Husband? What's this about? Is it some kind of cover?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3024
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_6e4b6d37:

    # mc "Creo que [ama] tiene que explicarte algunas cosas, [aar]."
    mc "I think [ama] has to explain some things to you, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3026
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_4ca237a9:

    # ama "*Risa* Al menos sabes que no te vas a quedar calvo."
    ama "*Laugh* At least you know you're not going to go bald."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3027
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_464ccb1b_1:

    # mc "*Risa* Eso también me da cierta alegría a mí."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm pretty happy about that too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3028
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_7d031e06_1:

    # mc "Aunque yo sería un calvo orgulloso si pasara, de esos que se rapan al cero. Nada de pelucas para mí."
    mc "Although I'd be a proud bald guy if it happened, the kind who shaves it all off. No wigs for me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3030
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_48f1f471:

    # bet "¿Podemos hablar de calvicies y de todo lo que queráis de camino a la base?"
    bet "Can we talk about baldness and whatever else you want on the way to the base?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3031
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_de620dd9:

    # bet "Es tarde y deberíamos descansar antes de empezar el día mañana."
    bet "It's late and we should get some rest before starting the day tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3033
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_7a93eca1:

    # aar "No vais a dormir en la base. Os voy a llevar a la Casa del CEO."
    aar "You're not going to sleep at the base. I'm taking you to the CEO's House."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3034
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_de627ecd:

    # mc "Creía que la Casa del CEO estaba en la base..."
    mc "I thought the CEO's House was at the base..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3036
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_8c4b6f25:

    # aar "No. Ni Richards ni Daniels quisieron nunca vivir en la base. La casa está a unos quince kilómetros. Unas diez millas para vosotros."
    aar "No. Neither Richards nor Daniels ever wanted to live at the base. The house is about fifteen kilometers away. About ten miles for you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3037
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_6111ea36:

    # mc "¿Tú también vives ahí? Has sido CEO en funciones..."
    mc "Do you live there too? You've been acting CEO..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3038
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_7e28962c:

    # aar "Yo vivo en la base, con el resto de los chicos. Nada ha cambiado respecto a eso."
    aar "I live at the base, with the rest of the guys. Nothing has changed regarding that."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3040
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_f47e96c8:

    # aar "Por cierto... bienvenida, [bet]. No me han dejado saludarte."
    aar "By the way... welcome, [bet]. They didn't let me greet you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3041
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_1297831f:

    # mc "Ve preparando la expresión de sorpresa, [aar]."
    mc "Get your surprised face ready, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3043
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_ac1abe42:

    # aar "¿A qué te refieres?"
    aar "What do you mean?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3046
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_e7633ab4:

    # bet "¿Qué es eso de extender la mano? Eres el clon de mi sobrino-nieto. ¡Eres familia!"
    bet "What's with holding out your hand? You're the clone of my great-nephew. You're family!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3047
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_b15b59b5:

    # "[aar] entiende a qué te referías un segundo demasiado tarde."
    "[aar] realizes what you meant a second too late."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3048
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_2941fcf9:

    # mc "*Risa* Me refería a eso, [aar]."
    mc "*Laugh* I meant exactly that, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3049
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_26634e50:

    # mc "Y [aar] no cree que seamos familia por compartir genes, {b}Tía{/b} [bet]."
    mc "And [aar] doesn't think we're family because we share genes, {b}Aunt{/b} [bet]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3050
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_0d5b86d1:

    # "Remarcas el 'Tía' para dejar claro que sois familia."
    "You emphasize the 'Aunt' to make it clear that you are family."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3051
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_260cc0df:

    # bet "¡Tonterías!"
    bet "Nonsense!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3053
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_c70c8356:

    # "Da lo mismo que [bet] y tú no compartáis genes. Sois familia porque elegís serlo."
    "It doesn't matter that you and [bet] don't share genes. You're family because you choose to be."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3055
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_d10156a2:

    # "También esperas que, remarcando el 'Tía', [bet] no diga nada sobre que vosotros también estáis casados."
    "You also hope that, by emphasizing the 'Aunt', [bet] won't say anything about you two being married also."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3056
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_03b2ffbf:

    # "No quieres que a [aar] le explote la cabeza nada más veros. No sabrías llegar a la Casa del CEO. ¿Quizás [ama] lo sepa?"
    "You don't want [aar]'s head to explode in the first ten minutes of meeting you. You wouldn't know how to get to the CEO's House. Maybe [ama] knows?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3058
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_5a7d2b7d:

    # "Tras unos incómodos segundos para [aar], [bet] le suelta y da un par de pasos atrás."
    "After a few uncomfortable seconds for [aar], [bet] lets him go and takes a couple of steps back."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3059
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_a93bced7:

    # bet "Bueno, ya hemos hecho las presentaciones. La próxima vez espero que me devuelvas el abrazo, [aar]."
    bet "Well, we've done the introductions. Next time I expect you to hug me back, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3060
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_547c8a1f:

    # mc "Deja que su cerebro vuelva a funcionar antes de exigirle cosas para la próxima vez."
    mc "Let his brain start working again before demanding things for next time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3062
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_43cff04b:

    # aar "¿Qué? ¿Va a haber próxima vez?"
    aar "What? There's going to be a next time?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3063
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_f982b868:

    # "El duro mercenario parece ridículo, incomodado por los abrazos de una anciana."
    "The tough mercenary looks ridiculous, made uncomfortable by an old woman's hugs."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3064
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_81ba533a:

    # mc "*Risa* No sabes nada, [aar] Gilford."
    mc "*Laugh* You know nothing, [aar] Gilford."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3066
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_22d58535:

    # ama "Eso es de una serie de la TV, [aar]."
    ama "That's from a TV show, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3067
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_1879d4b9:

    # ama "Y sí. Va a haber un montón de próximas veces. Ya te acostumbrarás."
    ama "And yes. There are going to be a lot of next times. You'll get used to it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3068
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_c0280c35:

    # ama "Los Marks somos una familia de abrazadores. Los Gilford deberíamos aprender mucho de los Marks."
    ama "We Marks are a family of huggers. We Gilfords should learn a lot from the Marks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3069
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_12da8da0:

    # "Te encanta que se incluya en las dos familias en una sola frase."
    "You love that she includes herself in both families in a single line."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3070
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_7943f579:

    # mc "Y ahora creo que nos deberíamos ir antes de que a [aar] le dé una apoplejía."
    mc "And now I think we should go before [aar] has a stroke."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3072
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_ab32aab2:

    # "Tras despediros de [alb] y de los pilotos, subís a la limusina y emprendéis el viaje a la que va a ser tu casa durante los próximos meses."
    "After saying goodbye to [alb] and the pilots, you get into the limo and begin the journey to what will be your home for the next few months."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3073
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_ea94d5cc:

    # "[aar] actúa de chófer mientras [ama] se sienta a su lado y le explica todo lo que ha pasado desde que él volvió a Aruba."
    "[aar] acts as chauffeur while [ama] sits next to him and explains everything that has happened since he returned to Aruba."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3074
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_af4c1341:

    # "Las palabras y la emoción de la hermosa mujer resuenan en las calles vacías, iluminando la noche con su sonrisa."
    "The beautiful woman's words and excitement resonate in the empty streets, lighting up the night with her smile."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3075
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_8f198eeb:

    # "Ella no habla de misiones o de dispositivos de vigilancia. Habla de familia. Explica risas y abrazos. Habla de las chicas y de Jamaal."
    "She doesn't talk about missions or surveillance devices. She talks about family. She recounts laughter and hugs. She talks about the girls and Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3077
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_20404727:

    # "Habla de vuestra boda."
    "She talks about your wedding."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3078
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_9e5c9fc4:

    # "[bet] y tú sólo intervenís cuando [ama] se deja algún detalle que consideráis importante."
    "[bet] and you only intervene when [ama] leaves out some detail that you consider important."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3079
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_6ec8d16d:

    # "Ninguno de los dos queréis interrumpir la ilusión con la que la mercenaria está explicando su nueva vida."
    "Neither of you wants to interrupt the excitement with which the blonde mercenary is explaining her new life."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3080
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_9943de76:

    # "La [ama] que casi te rompe el brazo en el avión ha desaparecido de nuevo, aunque sabes que aún está ahí dentro."
    "The [ama] that almost broke your arm on the plane has disappeared again, although you know she's still in there."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3081
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_91095358:

    # "[aar] sobrevive al viaje sin apoplejías ni infartos de corazón. A duras penas."
    "[aar] survives the trip without strokes or heart attacks. Barely."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3082
translate english c31s005_AarPicksUp_b69dc59d:

    # "Lo cual es una suerte. Él es quien conduce."
    "Which is lucky. He's the one driving."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3088
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_de4378fb:

    # "Llegáis a la Casa del CEO cerca de las 4 AM. Hay un par de coches en el garaje, aparte de la limusina en la que llegáis."
    "You arrive at the CEO's House around 4 AM. There are a couple of cars in the garage, apart from the limo you arrived in."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3089
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_0a13cb57:

    # "Habías visto fotos del interior, pero algo no te cuadra. Lo que has visto en las fotos no cabe en ese edificio."
    "You had seen pictures of the interior, but something doesn't add up. What you've seen in the photos doesn't fit in that building."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3091
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_afcbb943:

    # bet "Creía que sería más grande..."
    bet "I thought it would be bigger..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3092
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_fc82af07:

    # bet "Sin ánimo de ofender, pero parece una choza y un edificio pequeño."
    bet "No offense, but it looks like a shack and a small building."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3093
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_542448ce:

    # bet "No es que me queje. La terraza en la choza parece impresionante y he vivido en sitios peores."
    bet "Not that I'm complaining. The terrace on the shack looks impressive and I've lived in worse places."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3095
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_0dd8e3b2:

    # aar "El nombre oficial es Una Casa en el Acantilado. Hay dos plantas por debajo de lo que veis."
    aar "The official name is A House on the Cliff. There are two floors below what you see."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3096
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_05359c75:

    # aar "Esto sólo es la cocina, el salón y la terraza. En la siguiente planta están las habitaciones."
    aar "This is just the kitchen, the living room, and the terrace. The bedrooms are on the next floor."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3097
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_fda14927:

    # mc "¿Y en la tercera planta?"
    mc "And on the third floor?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3099
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_ee80499b:

    # aar "La habitación del pánico. Oficialmente llamada El Bunker."
    aar "The panic room. Officially called The Bunker."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3100
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_0dca65a0:

    # aar "Hay comunicaciones seguras con la base desde esa habitación, en caso de ataque o de querer seguir alguna operación desde aquí."
    aar "There are secure communications with the base from that room, in case of an attack or if the CEO wants to follow an operation from here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3101
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_e46ec2b8:

    # aar "También hay una pequeña armería y la sala de vigilancia."
    aar "There's also a small armory and the surveillance room."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3102
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_5809d825:

    # mc "¿Tenemos personal de seguridad?"
    mc "Do we have security personnel?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3104
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_42d4edcb:

    # ama "No. Le dije a [aar] que no era necesario para esta noche."
    ama "No. I told [aar] it wasn't necessary for tonight."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3105
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_6c1174f1:

    # ama "Nadie sabe que veníamos y la casa lleva algunas semanas vacía, con lo que no esperamos necesitarlo."
    ama "No one knows we were coming and the house has been empty for a few weeks, so we don't expect to need it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3107
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_d1515b34:

    # ama "Además, no quería que te cruzaras con ningún operativo hasta que no sepamos qué esperar de cada uno de ellos."
    ama "Besides, I didn't want you to run into any operatives until we know what to expect from each of them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3108
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_2af4d6d9:

    # mc "Me parece muy inteligente."
    mc "That sounds very smart."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3110
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_178d9d9a:

    # aar "Ahora deberíais descansar. Mañana vais a tener un día muy largo."
    aar "You should rest now. You're going to have a very long day tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3111
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_4b98d4ab:

    # mc "Creo que tienes razón. ¿Nos vemos mañana en la base?"
    mc "I think you're right. See you tomorrow at the base?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3113
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_a8133fae:

    # aar "Sí, la primera reunión la tienes a las 10 AM, con los jefes de departamento. Yo también estaré allí."
    aar "Yeah, your first meeting is at 10 AM, with the department heads. I'll be there too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3114
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_f5044b8c:

    # aar "Pero antes tienes agendado que te enseñen las instalaciones, con lo que deberías estar allí sobre las 8 AM."
    aar "But before that, you're scheduled for a tour of the facilities, so you should be there around 8 AM."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3115
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_0b03e858:

    # mc "Perfecto. Nos vemos allí entonces."
    mc "Perfect. See you there then."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3117
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_9afeb654:

    # "Tanto [bet] como [ama] se despiden de [aar] con un abrazo después de que os ayude a meter el equipaje en la cocina."
    "Both [bet] and [ama] say goodbye to [aar] with a hug after he helps you bring the luggage into the kitchen."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3118
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_b45d2904:

    # "A este paso, se va a acostumbrar muy rápido a los abrazos de los Marks, aunque no quiera formar parte de la familia."
    "At this rate, he's going to get used to the Marks' hugs very quickly, even if he doesn't want to be part of the family."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3119
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_8fa90c79:

    # "Sólo hace falta que [eva] y un par más de las chicas vengan y lo abracen... No le quedará más remedio que cambiar de opinión."
    "All it will take is for [eva] and a couple more of the girls to come and hug him... He'll have no choice but to change his mind."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3120
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_ca836ce4:

    # "De alguna forma es tu hermano también."
    "In a weird way, he's your brother too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3121
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_9540a212:

    # "Se va conduciendo la limusina. Por un momento has pensado que dejaría la limusina y cogería el Humvee."
    "He drives off in the limo. For a moment you thought he'd leave the limo and take the Humvee."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3124
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_07d83ba2:

    # ama "Creo que deberíamos ir a dormir ya. Os enseño vuestras habitaciones."
    ama "I think we should go to sleep now. I'll show you your rooms."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3125
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_cf2aa8fc:

    # mc "¿Habías estado aquí antes?"
    mc "Have you been here before?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3127
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_2f025de4:

    # ama "Nunca, pero sé mirar un plano y puedo guiaros a las habitaciones que [aar] os ha asignado."
    ama "Never, but I know how to read a floor plan and I can guide you to the rooms [aar] has assigned you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3128
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_9c0fca5d:

    # ama "Ni Richards ni Daniels querían que las chicas formáramos parte del equipo de seguridad de la mansión."
    ama "Neither Richards nor Daniels wanted us girls to be part of the mansion's security team."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3129
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_0510d4a5:

    # mc "¿Había alguna razón para eso?"
    mc "Was there a reason for that?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3131
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_e926464f:

    # ama "Decían que podíamos hacer cosas más interesantes que mirar un monitor."
    ama "They said we could do more interesting things than stare at a monitor."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3132
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_771f29b2:

    # mc "Y tenían razón. Pese a ello te has pasado los últimos meses haciéndolo."
    mc "And they were right. Despite that, you've spent the last few months doing just that."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3134
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_ae617da5:

    # ama "*Risa* Y si no fuera por [emm] y [kat]... bueno, y por el resto... hubiera sido muy aburrido."
    ama "*Laugh* And if it weren't for [emm] and [kat]... well, and the rest of you... it would have been really boring."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3135
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_48236755:

    # mc "No te voy a quitar la razón en eso."
    mc "I can't argue with that."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3137
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_defe69fb:

    # bet "Chicos, os recuerdo que son más de las 4. Tenemos que dormir algo si mañana tenemos que estar en la base a las 8."
    bet "Guys, just a reminder that it's past 4. We need to get some sleep if we have to be at the base by 8 tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3138
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_337435f8:

    # mc "¿Vas a dormir más? ¡Te has pasado casi todo el vuelo durmiendo!"
    mc "You're going to sleep more? You spent almost the whole flight sleeping!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3140
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_ce05bbbe:

    # bet "*Risa* A mi edad, una chica necesita su sueño reparador."
    bet "*Laugh* At my age, a girl needs her beauty sleep."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3142
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_823cdb3f:

    # ama "Dejad las maletas grandes en la cocina. Mañana lo recogeremos todo. Hoy es tarde para ponerse a deshacer maletas."
    ama "Leave the big suitcases in the kitchen. We'll sort everything out tomorrow. It's too late to start unpacking today."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3143
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_32d864f3:

    # ama "Coged lo imprescindible para pasar la noche."
    ama "Grab the essentials for the night."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3144
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_dbe078ec:

    # mc "El neceser y poco más."
    mc "My toiletry bag and not much else."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3146
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_bc145742:

    # "[ama] acompaña primero a [bet] a su habitación, antes de guiarte a la tuya."
    "[ama] walks [bet] to her room first, before showing you to yours."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3147
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_de7cc760:

    # "Es justo como en las fotos que habías visto, con unas espectaculares vistas del Caribe."
    "It's exactly like the photos you saw, with spectacular views of the Caribbean."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3149
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_97ff6797:

    # ama "Esta es la habitación principal. Ahí tienes el baño y ahí unas escaleras para bajar a la habitación del pánico."
    ama "This is the master bedroom. There's the restroom, and over there are the stairs down to the panic room."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3150
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_dc2088e7:

    # mc "Espero no tener que usarlas nunca."
    mc "I hope I never have to use them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3151
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_afdf5be0:

    # ama "Yo también. La casa nunca ha recibido un ataque, con lo que esa habitación sólo se ha usado como centro de mando y vigilancia."
    ama "Me too. The house has never been attacked, so that room has only been used as a command and surveillance center."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3155
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_d259401b:

    # ama "Buenas noches, [mc]. Te veo mañana... O en unas dos horas y media."
    ama "Good night, [mc]. I'll see you tomorrow... Or in about two and a half hours."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3156
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_47450581:

    # mc "Buenas noches, cielo. Descansa."
    mc "Good night, sweetheart. Get some rest."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3158
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_b391b72f:

    # mc "[ama]..."
    mc "[ama]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3160
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_09360d88:

    # ama "¿Sí...?"
    ama "Yes...?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3161
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_a17fb7e0:

    # mc "¿Vas a estar bien? Si quieres quedarte a dormir, esa cama es grande."
    mc "Are you going to be okay? If you want to stay the night, that bed is big."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3163
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_016fcb47:

    # ama "No te preocupes por mí. Estaré bien. Pero gracias de todos modos."
    ama "Don't worry about me. I'll be fine. But thanks anyway."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3164
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_0307e973:

    # mc "Si me necesitas, sabes dónde vivo."
    mc "If you need me, you know where I live. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3165
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_5e0780c6:

    # ama "Lo tendré en cuenta. Descansa."
    ama "I'll keep that in mind. Get some rest."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3167
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_d4e77122:

    # "Te desnudas y te aseas. Te dejas los boxers puestos por si una de las dos mujeres quiere hacer su aparición en la habitación."
    "You undress and freshen up. You leave your boxers on just in case one of the two women decides to make an appearance in the room."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3168
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_fb690820:

    # "No tienes sueño después del rato que has dormido en el avión."
    "You're not sleepy after the time you spent sleeping on the plane."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3169
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_45763d5d:

    # mcp "(Mañana va a ser un día interesante.)"
    mcp "(Tomorrow is going to be an interesting day.)"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3171
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_3b889a27:

    # "Te sirves un zumo de piña y sales al balcón de la habitación."
    "You pour yourself some pineapple juice and step out onto the room's balcony."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3172
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_656c6488:

    # "El Caribe brilla bajo las estrellas."
    "The Caribbean shines beneath the stars."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3173
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_88d83a1b:

    # "Si no has perdido el sentido de la orientación, crees que este balcón da al Este, con lo que te despertará el sol cuando salga."
    "If you haven't lost your sense of direction, you figure this balcony faces East, so the sun will wake you up when it rises."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3175
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_892927af:

    # "Sólo te puedes imaginar cómo se vería la casa desde una barca en el mar."
    "You can only imagine what the house would look like from a boat on the sea."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3176
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_669c279f:

    # "Seguramente ahora es una masa oscura contra el cielo. Tienes que verla de día."
    "It's probably just a dark mass against the starry sky right now. You'll have to see it during the day."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3177
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_c34fa20d:

    # mcp "(Debería irme a dormir. No daría muy buena impresión si el CEO se duerme en las reuniones de su primer día.)"
    mcp "(I should go to sleep. It wouldn't make a very good impression if the CEO fell asleep in the middle of meetings on his first day.)"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3179
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3180
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_ab770f08:

    # "Unos nudillos te sacan de tus ensoñaciones. Hay costumbres que nunca cambian, aunque cambies de país."
    "A knock snaps you out of your daydreams. Some habits never change, even if you change countries."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3181
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_2ffbba0b:

    # ama "*A través de la puerta* Soy yo. ¿Puedo pasar?"
    ama "*Through the door* It's me. Can I come in?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3182
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_3b55a4ab:

    # mc "Sí, entra."
    mc "Yes, come in."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3184
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_0269f882:

    # mc "¿Te has olvidado algo?"
    mc "Did you forget something?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3185
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_203fd4fe:

    # ama "Aceptar tu oferta de quedarme a dormir."
    ama "To accept your offer to stay the night."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3186
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_98c81edc:

    # ama "He visto luz en tu balcón y..."
    ama "I saw a light on your balcony and..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3187
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_6e83634c:

    # mc "No tienes que darme explicaciones para aceptar una oferta que te he hecho yo."
    mc "You don't have to explain yourself for accepting an offer I made you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3189
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_5d454985:

    # ama "Esto va a ser muy duro..."
    ama "This is going to be really hard..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3190
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_96bd13db:

    # mc "Nada que no podamos superar juntos, [ama]."
    mc "Nothing we can't overcome together, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3191
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_b5587787:

    # mc "Y has sobrevivido a la habitación de [emm] sin arrancarte los ojos."
    mc "And you survived [emm]'s room without gouging your eyes out."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3192
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_06edb69f:

    # mc "No creo que unos clones vayan a poder contigo."
    mc "I don't think a few clones will be able to defeat you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3194
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_f0ab3851:

    # ama "El problema no van a ser los clones... O al menos no van a ser el problema principal."
    ama "The problem isn't going to be the clones... Or at least they won't be the main problem."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3195
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_63f18179:

    # ama "No sé cómo el resto del personal va a tomarse los cambios que queremos hacer en la empresa."
    ama "I don't know how the rest of the staff will take the changes we want to make to the company."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3196
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_74d2ffe2:

    # mc "Yo tampoco, pero ¿sabes una cosa?"
    mc "Me neither, but you know what?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3198
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_e44310b5:

    # ama "¿Qué?"
    ama "What?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3199
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_58c4108e:

    # mc "Es algo que empezaremos a descubrir mañana. No nos preocupemos hoy."
    mc "That's something we'll start figuring out tomorrow. Let's not worry about it today."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3201
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_c1cd90f3:

    # mc "Hoy lo único que quiero es dormir con mi esposa. Aunque sólo sean dos horas y media."
    mc "Today all I want is to sleep with my wife. Even if it's only for two and a half hours."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3203
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_86ee3907:

    # ama "Dos horas y cuarto. Pero solo va a ser dormir..."
    ama "Two and a quarter hours. But it's just going to be sleeping..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3204
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_214247f0:

    # mc "Sí, no te preocupes. No quiero que nuestra primera vez sea así, ni tan rápido."
    mc "Yeah, don't worry. I don't want our first time to be like this, or so rushed."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3205
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_a73b2ab8:

    # mc "Además, hoy estamos cansados del viaje."
    mc "Besides, we're tired from the trip today."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3207
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_69c786b7:

    # ama "Tienes razón. Y no. No te voy a comprar esa camiseta."
    ama "You're right. And no. I'm not going to buy you that shirt."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3208
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_f7270242:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que al final la tendré que encargar online."
    mc "*Laugh* I think I'll end up having to order it online."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3212
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_bd33b22a:

    # ama "Entonces, vamos a la cama."
    ama "Then, let's go to bed."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3213
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_c898a30c:

    # mc "Después de ti."
    mc "After you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3215
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_28bd9c12:

    # ama "Por cierto... Había oído que dormías desnudo. No sé si sentirme decepcionada."
    ama "By the way... I heard you slept naked. I don't know whether to feel disappointed."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3216
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_f826b8e1:

    # mc "Es algo que puedo solucionar, si quieres."
    mc "That's something I can fix, if you want."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3217
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_7ed56edc:

    # ama "*Risa* Me parece que no quiero."
    ama "*Laugh* I don't think I want to."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3219
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_f5187d42:

    # ama "Al menos hoy."
    ama "At least, not today."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3220
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_f4cc3d5f:

    # ama "Recuerda que tuvimos cámaras en tu habitación. Ya he visto todo lo que había que ver."
    ama "Remember we had cameras in your room. I've already seen everything there is to see."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3221
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_f1c647f7:

    # mc "Cambiando de tema, me encanta el camisón de Zeus."
    mc "Changing the subject, I love the Zeus nightgown."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3222
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_3fa66fd4:

    # ama "Lo compré antes de conocerlo, con lo que solo era un camisón con un montón de gatos."
    ama "I bought it before I met him, so it was just a nightgown with a bunch of cats on it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3223
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_ada77496:

    # mc "¿Vas a tardar mucho en acostarte?"
    mc "Are you going to take long to get into bed?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3224
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_0a2c7118:

    # ama "No..."
    ama "No..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3226
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_5f11d045:

    # "Finalmente, [ama] decide apagar las luces y meterse en la cama contigo."
    "Finally, [ama] decides to turn off the lights and get into bed with you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3227
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_390ccea4:

    # "Nada más acomodaros en brazos del otro, caéis dormidos como troncos bajo la luz de la luna que se filtra por el ventanal."
    "As soon as you settle into each other's arms, you fall asleep like dormice under the moonlight filtering through the large window."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3228
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_1c43d281:

    # "El día ha sido más largo de lo que ninguno esperabais y el cansancio ha hecho mella en vosotros."
    "The day has been longer than either of you expected, and exhaustion has taken its toll on you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3230
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_f2ebf9cc:

    # "Duermes con tu esposa por primera vez. Aunque sean poco más de dos horas."
    "You sleep with your wife for the first time. Even if it's just for a little over two hours."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3231
translate english c31s005_houseArrival_bdb3931a:

    # "Vas a tener un mes para dormir con ella un montón de noches."
    "You're going to have a month to sleep with her plenty of nights."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3236
translate english c31s006_Caroline_1a10c5f8:

    # "Después de desayunar, [ama] os lleva hasta la base. Está a menos de 30 minutos de la casa."
    "After breakfast, [ama] drives you to the base. It's less than 30 minutes from the house."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2451
translate english c31s006_Caroline_020a6dc8:

    # "Después de desayunar, [ama] os lleva hasta la base. Está a menos de 15 minutos de la casa."
    "After breakfast, [ama] takes you to the base. It's less than 15 minutes from the house."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2452
translate english c31s006_Caroline_36340068:

    # ama "Bueno, ya estamos aquí. Esta es la base principal de NTR."
    ama "Well, here we are. This is NTR's main base."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2453
translate english c31s006_Caroline_b8d84426:

    # mc "Es impresionante. Aunque parece una fábrica más que lo que imaginas como una base militar."
    mc "It's impressive. Although it looks more like a factory than what you'd imagine a military base to be."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2455
translate english c31s006_Caroline_e6d884d4:

    # bet "Ha actuado como fábrica de clones, de muerte, y de infelicidad durante mucho tiempo."
    bet "It has acted as a factory of clones, death, and misery for a long time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2456
translate english c31s006_Caroline_1e4592a3:

    # mc "Tienes razón..."
    mc "You're right..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2458
translate english c31s006_Caroline_0ac894ba:

    # ama "Vamos a empezar la visita por la persona más importante con quién tendrás que lidiar en los próximos meses."
    ama "We're going to start the tour with the most important person you'll have to deal with in the coming months."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2459
translate english c31s006_Caroline_263e99ec:

    # mc "¿[mael], el Jefe del Departamento Científico? ¿O [vin], de Contabilidad? Creía que teníamos una reunión con ellos después."
    mc "[mael], the Head of the Science Department? Or [vin], from Accounting? I thought we had a meeting with them later."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2461
translate english c31s006_Caroline_7619f015:

    # ama "[car], tu secretaria."
    ama "[car], your secretary."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2462
translate english c31s006_Caroline_27bb2658:

    # "Ese dedo índice señalando al cielo es una postura tan Marks... No llevas un día aquí y ya estás echando de menos a la familia."
    "That index finger pointing to the sky is such a Marks pose... You haven't been here a day and you're already missing the family."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2463
translate english c31s006_Caroline_23850e58:

    # mc "Eso no me lo esperaba. He leído su ficha... Era la secretaria de Daniels... Y de Richards antes que él."
    mc "I wasn't expecting that. I read her file... She was Daniels' secretary... And Richards' before him."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2464
translate english c31s006_Caroline_ef968228:

    # mc "Y la de Tío Mike. Lleva aquí desde que la empresa se mudó a Aruba."
    mc "And Uncle Mike's. She's been here since the company moved to Aruba."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2465
translate english c31s006_Caroline_a78ce96d:

    # ama "Es leal a la empresa, no al CEO de turno. Si te la ganas, será de gran ayuda para ti."
    ama "She's loyal to the company, not the CEO of the moment. If you win her over, she'll be a great help to you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2466
translate english c31s006_Caroline_759e31a4:

    # ama "No podrás hacer que esto funcione sin su ayuda. Conoce todo y a todos."
    ama "You won't be able to make this work without her help. She knows everything and everyone."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2467
translate english c31s006_Caroline_33ab9927:

    # ama "Y que no te engañe su aspecto. Podría masticar balas, si quisiera."
    ama "And don't let her looks fool you. She could chew bullets if she wanted to."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2469
translate english c31s006_Caroline_237d6a3c:

    # bet "Una secretaria puede hacerte la vida muy fácil o muy difícil."
    bet "A secretary can make your life very easy or very difficult."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2470
translate english c31s006_Caroline_7b639aef:

    # bet "Creo que [ama] tiene razón en que sea la primera persona que conozcas."
    bet "I think [ama] is right that she should be the first person you meet."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2471
translate english c31s006_Caroline_3dc08b87:

    # bet "Y recuerda, las primeras impresiones son importantes. No la cagues."
    bet "And remember, first impressions are important. Don't fuck it up."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2472
translate english c31s006_Caroline_f02557ac:

    # mc "*Risa* Me tranquiliza la confianza que depositáis en mí."
    mc "*Laughs* The confidence you place in me is reassuring."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2473
translate english c31s006_Caroline_ff41ca5a:

    # mc "Vamos a conocer a la temible [car]."
    mc "Let's go meet the fearsome [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2475
translate english c31s006_Caroline_b8f4b2ad:

    # ama "Caroline, te presento a [mc] Marks. El nuevo CEO."
    ama "Caroline, meet [mc] Marks. The new CEO."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2476
translate english c31s006_Caroline_f4df7136:

    # ama "También ha venido [bet] Cavendish, la cirujana que va a operar a [gav]."
    ama "[bet] Cavendish is also here, the surgeon who's going to operate on [gav]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2477
translate english c31s006_Caroline_2e8abe0d:

    # car "Encantada de conocerlos. Espero que la casa estuviera a su gusto, Sr. Marks."
    car "Nice to meet you. I hope the house was to your liking, Mr. Marks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2478
translate english c31s006_Caroline_d982c5ca:

    # mc "Igualmente, [car]."
    mc "Likewise, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2479
translate english c31s006_Caroline_05f1df77:

    # mc "La casa es impresionante, gracias."
    mc "The house is impressive, thank you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2481
translate english c31s006_Caroline_a543b3ea:

    # car "Hoy tiene una agenda apretada, Sr. Marks."
    car "You have a tight schedule today, Mr. Marks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2482
translate english c31s006_Caroline_86007264:

    # mc "Llámame [mc], por favor."
    mc "Call me [mc], please."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2483
translate english c31s006_Caroline_4046077a:

    # car "Lo primero es la visita turística a las instalaciones principales de la base."
    car "First up is the sightseeing tour of the main base facilities."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2485
translate english c31s006_Caroline_aa575e46:

    # bet "*Risa* Lo de 'visita turística' ha sonado gracioso, [car]."
    bet "*Laughs* The 'sightseeing tour' part sounded funny, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2487
translate english c31s006_Caroline_f114ee19:

    # car "Es la primera vez que tenemos que enseñarle la base a un CEO. Hasta ahora, los CEOs anteriores habían ascendido desde las filas de la empresa."
    car "It's the first time we've had to show the facilities to a CEO. Until now, previous CEOs had risen through the ranks of the company."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2488
translate english c31s006_Caroline_2210dd78:

    # car "Se habían ganado el derecho a estar aquí después de años de servicio."
    car "They had earned the right to be here after years of service."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2489
translate english c31s006_Caroline_1bf6c3c8:

    # mc "Espero poder ganarme ese derecho."
    mc "I hope I can earn that right."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2491
translate english c31s006_Caroline_eae358d5:

    # car "Yo también lo espero, Sr. Marks."
    car "I hope so too, Mr. Marks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2492
translate english c31s006_Caroline_e2a2531e:

    # car "Ha habido un problema con David, el operativo que tenía que hacer su visita."
    car "There's been a problem with David, the operative who was supposed to give you the tour."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2494
translate english c31s006_Caroline_2c93df91:

    # ama "¿Está bien?"
    ama "Is he okay?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2495
translate english c31s006_Caroline_ad909581:

    # car "Tan solo un esguince en el tobillo. Estoy esperando que [aar] me diga quién lo va a sustituir en la visita."
    car "Just a sprained ankle. I'm waiting for [aar] to tell me who's going to replace him for the tour."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2497
translate english c31s006_Caroline_232d656f:

    # ama "No te preocupes por eso. Dile a [aar] que yo voy a enseñarle la base a [mc]."
    ama "Don't worry about that. Tell [aar] that I'll show [mc] around the base."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2498
translate english c31s006_Caroline_d5aa9e6d:

    # car "Me parece una buena solución. Si tenemos que esperar a [aar], seguramente tendríamos que reducir la duración de visita."
    car "Sounds like a good solution. If we have to wait for [aar], we'd probably have to cut the tour short."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2499
translate english c31s006_Caroline_720cfcd9:

    # mc "Entonces un problema arreglado. ¿Algo más?"
    mc "So that's one problem solved. Anything else?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2501
translate english c31s006_Caroline_9d99232a:

    # car "Después de la visita, tiene la reunión con los jefes de departamento. En dos horas."
    car "After the tour, you have the meeting with the department heads. In two hours."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2502
translate english c31s006_Caroline_287f1372:

    # mc "Bien, [car]."
    mc "Sweet, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2505
translate english c31s006_Caroline_fa033f4c:

    # bet "Bam Bam Baa."
    bet "Bam Bam Baa."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2507
translate english c31s006_Caroline_ebfa80d0:

    # car "..."
    car "..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2509
translate english c31s006_Caroline_103e00b6:

    # car "Después tiene una reunión con Soporte Informático, donde le harán una pequeña formación sobre el software de la empresa."
    car "After that, you have a meeting with IT Support, where they'll give you a brief training on the company's software."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2510
translate english c31s006_Caroline_0b829346:

    # car "Y, cuando tenga un momento, le tengo que dar el Manual del Empleado, donde encontrará toda la información que necesite."
    car "And, whenever you have a moment, I need to give you the Employee Handbook, where you'll find all the information you need."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2511
translate english c31s006_Caroline_9f74374e:

    # car "He dejado espacio suficiente entre ambas reuniones para que no vaya estresado de tiempo en su primer día."
    car "I've left enough time between both meetings so you won't be stressed for time on your first day."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2512
translate english c31s006_Caroline_da378e55:

    # mc "Gracias, [car]."
    mc "Thanks, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2516
translate english c31s006_Caroline_9402cb80:

    # car "Por la tarde, tiene una reunión con [aar]. Le dará un informe {b}{u}exhaustivo{/u}{/b} sobre su gestión estos días."
    car "In the afternoon, you have a meeting with [aar]. He will give you an {b}{u}exhaustive{/u}{/b} report on his management these past few days."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2517
translate english c31s006_Caroline_76404822:

    # mc "Eso suena a que tú también has sufrido los informes de [aar]."
    mc "That sounds like you've suffered through [aar]'s reports too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2519
translate english c31s006_Caroline_49687396:

    # car "Los informes ejecutivos deberían ser concisos, Sr. Marks."
    car "Executive reports should be concise, Mr. Marks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2520
translate english c31s006_Caroline_bd7d9df9:

    # mc "[mc]."
    mc "[mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2521
translate english c31s006_Caroline_4725d612:

    # car "Usted no va a tener tiempo para preocuparse de si el stock de munición va a durar nueve meses o nueve meses y dos días."
    car "You're not going to have time to worry about whether the ammo stock will last nine months and two days or only nine months."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2522
translate english c31s006_Caroline_7f36e1a2:

    # mc "Estoy de acuerdo."
    mc "I agree."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2524
translate english c31s006_Caroline_d8af4fd3:

    # car "Deberían irse ahora si no quieren recortar la visita. Hablaremos después cuando acabe la primera reunión."
    car "You should leave now if you don't want to cut the visit short. We'll talk later when the first meeting is over."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2525
translate english c31s006_Caroline_b3b3c37a:

    # mc "Perfecto, [car]."
    mc "Perfect, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2527
translate english c31s006_Caroline_4f14db7a:

    # mc "[bet], creo que has olvidado lo de la primera impresión."
    mc "[bet], I think you forgot about the first impression thing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2528
translate english c31s006_Caroline_17051cf0:

    # bet "No lo he olvidado. Pero, desde que he oído su nombre, tengo esa canción en la cabeza."
    bet "I didn't forget. But ever since I heard her name, I've had that song stuck in my head."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2529
translate english c31s006_Caroline_568bf98f:

    # bet "Y si se centra en la tía excéntrica del CEO, tu parecerás mejor en comparación."
    bet "And if she focuses on the CEO's eccentric aunt, you'll look better by comparison."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2530
translate english c31s006_Caroline_941197f0:

    # ama "No sé de qué canción estáis hablando ni he entendido tu gesto, Tía [bet]."
    ama "I don't know what song you're talking about, nor did I understand your gesture, Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2532
translate english c31s006_Caroline_1b5e90ca:

    # bet "Hay que empezar a trabajar en tu educación musical, mi niña. ¡Es un clásico del 69!"
    bet "We need to start working on your musical education, my girl. It's a classic from '69!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2533
translate english c31s006_Caroline_7d262a9a:

    # ama "Ya habrá tiempo para eso. Ahora deberíamos empezar la visita."
    ama "There will be time for that later. We should start the tour now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2534
translate english c31s006_Caroline_4f9d9d29:

    # mc "Cuando quieras. Creo que yo me hubiera perdido un par de veces a estas alturas."
    mc "Whenever you're ready. I think I would've gotten lost a couple of times by now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3136
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_a0b85b73:

    # ama "Por aquí. Intentaré no abrumarte, pero hay mucho que ver."
    ama "This way. I'll try not to overwhelm you, but there's a lot to see."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3137
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_4bb2aef5:

    # mc "Tranquila. Prefiero verlo todo de una vez y hacerme una idea real del sitio."
    mc "Don't worry. I prefer to see everything at once and get a real feel for the place."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3138
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_0c5b78d4:

    # ama "Como quieras. Empezamos por los dormitorios de la tropa."
    ama "As you wish. Let's start with the troop dorms."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3141
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c5972219:

    # ama "Aquí duermen los operativos. Literas, taquillas individuales, zona común al fondo."
    ama "The operatives sleep here. Bunk beds, individual lockers, common area at the back."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3142
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_744b9b50:

    # mc "Es... funcional."
    mc "It's... functional."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3144
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_10e00322:

    # ama "Es lo más amable que se puede decir."
    ama "That's the nicest thing you could say about it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3145
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_214be116:

    # mc "¿Cuántos comparten habitación?"
    mc "How many share a room?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3147
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_d9244d75:

    # ama "Ocho por módulo. Hay seis módulos en este bloque."
    ama "Sixteen per module. There are six modules in this block. There are six blocks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3148
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_620f54f4:

    # mc "¿Y esto no ha cambiado en años?"
    mc "And this hasn't changed in years?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3149
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_aa62e8ee:

    # ama "No. La dirección anterior no veía motivo para mejorar lo que consideraba suficiente."
    ama "No. The previous management saw no reason to improve what they considered sufficient."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3150
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_f985dcb7:

    # mc "Pues yo sí lo veo."
    mc "Well, I do."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3152
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_af45e037:

    # ama "Lo sé."
    ama "I know."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3150
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_1f2a88c0:

    # mc "¿Creciste aquí?"
    mc "Did you grow up here?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3152
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_a216b640:

    # ama "En un módulo más pequeño, sólo para las chicas. Es básicamente lo mismo, pero nuestra zona común es más grande."
    ama "In a smaller module, just for the girls. It's basically the same, but our common area is bigger."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3153
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_e71c5eb9:

    # ama "Teníamos que especializarnos en más cosas, con lo que debíamos entrenar con dispositivos diferentes."
    ama "We had to specialize in more things, so we had to train with different devices."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3154
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_d56b9c53:

    # mc "Lo entiendo."
    mc "I get it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3154
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_db787fdc:

    # bet "Yo diría que huele a vestuario de polideportivo, pero no quiero ser cruel."
    bet "I'd say it smells like a gym locker room, but I don't want to be cruel... to gym locker rooms."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3155
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_460a30af:

    # mc "¿Tú también lo notas?"
    mc "You notice it too?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3156
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_2318742c:

    # bet "Llevo aquí cinco minutos y ya me estoy acostumbrando. Eso da más miedo."
    bet "I've been here five minutes and I'm already getting used to it. That's scarier."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3158
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_7bead8a2:

    # ama "Ventilación deficiente. Está en la lista de reformas pendientes desde hace dos años."
    ama "Poor ventilation. It's been on the pending renovations list for two years."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3159
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_fc784a98:

    # mc "Avísame cuando suba a la primera posición de esa lista."
    mc "Let me know when it moves to the top of that list."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3160
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_53dd844a:

    # ama "Anotado."
    ama "Noted. Let's continue the visit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3163
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_d4e96205:

    # ama "Laboratorio principal. Análisis, desarrollo de protocolos, investigación aplicada."
    ama "Main laboratory. Analysis, protocol development, applied research."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3164
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_772f75f4:

    # mc "¿Aplicada a qué exactamente?"
    mc "Applied to what exactly?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3165
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_8591b7a4:

    # ama "Mejoras de rendimiento físico, tratamientos de recuperación, adaptaciones para el campo."
    ama "Physical performance enhancements, recovery treatments, field adaptations."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3166
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c102562d:

    # ama "Y, obviamente, mejoras en los protocolos de clonación."
    ama "And, obviously, improvements in cloning protocols."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3168
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_3a86785f:

    # bet "Este sitio va a hacer las delicias de [dap] y [sca]..."
    bet "This place is going to be a treat for [dap] and [sca]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3169
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_48cc3e9a:

    # mc "No entiendo qué son la mitad de las cosas que estoy viendo, pero todo parece de alta tecnología."
    mc "I don't understand what half the things I'm seeing are, but it all looks high-tech."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3171
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_fe823e67:

    # ama "[mael], el jefe del Departamento Científico, es un sibarita cuando se trata de pedir equipamiento."
    ama "[mael], the head of the Science Department, has very refined tastes when it comes to ordering equipment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3172
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_f349d67a:

    # ama "Y la parte más interesante es la que se ha desarrollado aquí, como tecnología propia."
    ama "And the most interesting part is what has been developed here, as proprietary technology."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3173
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_4c9e2cef:

    # mc "Eso podría ser la piedra fundacional de lo que queremos hacer para el cambio de orientación de la empresa."
    mc "That could be the cornerstone of what we want to do for the company's change in direction."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3175
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_4811af7c:

    # ama "Creo que tenemos una buena base para empezar a crecer, pero en la reunión de dentro de un rato te quedará más claro."
    ama "I think we have a good foundation to start growing, but it will be clearer to you in the meeting in a little while."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3176
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_eb9629cd:

    # mc "¿Todo esto estaba operativo antes de que yo llegara?"
    mc "Was all this operational before I got the job?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3177
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_8be0bdfa:

    # ama "El laboratorio, sí. Aunque algunos proyectos se paralizaron con el cambio de dirección."
    ama "The lab, yes. Although some projects were put on hold with the change in management."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3178
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_276a0d79:

    # mc "¿Cuáles?"
    mc "Which ones?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3180
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_1d155b77:

    # ama "Los que no eran rentables a corto plazo. Que casualmente eran los más interesantes."
    ama "The ones that weren't profitable in the short term. Which coincidentally were the most interesting."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3181
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_5feeb067:

    # mc "¿Puedo ver qué estaba paralizado?"
    mc "Can I see what was put on hold?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3182
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_6b7fdc17:

    # ama "Te preparo un informe. Pero ahora seguimos."
    ama "I'll prepare a report for you. But let's keep moving for now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3184
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_30a04035:

    # mc "¿No hay nadie trabajando?"
    mc "Is no one working?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3185
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_b2e407c2:

    # ama "Creo que hay varias reuniones de equipo, donde están ultimando la información que te presentarán en breve."
    ama "I think there are several team meetings going on, where they're finalizing the information they'll present to you shortly."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3186
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_8c0b8827:

    # ama "Me parece que nadie se quería cruzar contigo antes de esa reunión."
    ama "I get the feeling no one wanted to run into you before that meeting."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3187
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_3fac017b:

    # mc "Entiendo."
    mc "I understand."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3190
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_18890a76:

    # ama "Sala de clonación 1."
    ama "Cloning Room 1."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3193
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_437a7119:

    # mc "Por el amor de Dios."
    mc "For God's sake!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3191
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_0a835d55:

    # mc "Dios."
    mc "For God's sake!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3194
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_61ec9ea1:

    # ama "Sí. [eva] y yo nacimos ahí dentro."
    ama "Yeah. [eva] and I were born in there."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3196
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_b55592fd:

    # ama "Sí. [eri], [dap] y [emm] nacieron ahí dentro."
    ama "Yes. [eri], [dap], and [emm] were born in there."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3197
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_6109e69f:

    # ama "Hacía años que no venía aquí..."
    ama "I haven't been here in years..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3201
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_a1060dd4:

    # "Te sientes tentado de abrazar a la mercenaria, pero la carga emocional que hay en su voz te dice que no es el mejor momento."
    "You feel tempted to hug the mercenary, but the emotional weight in her voice tells you it's not the best time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3203
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_874cb6b0:

    # "La carga emocional que hay en su voz te indica que, pese a que ella no ha nacido en esa sala, no es un lugar agradable para ella."
    "The emotional weight in her voice tells you that, even though she wasn't born in this room, it's not a pleasant place for her."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3198
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_6c0f2e3f:

    # mc "¿Sigue activa?"
    mc "Is it still active?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3200
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_f0d573c0:

    # ama "Sí, todos los tubos de clonación están llenos. [mael] te podrá dar datos sobre ellos."
    ama "Yes, all the cloning tubes are full. [mael] can give you the details on them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3201
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_df3eb5ca:

    # ama "No te voy a dar los números ahora mismo."
    ama "I'm not going to give you the numbers right now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3202
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_442d7fdf:

    # mc "¿Por qué no?"
    mc "Why not?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3204
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_4b72efc3:

    # ama "Porque estamos de tour y prefiero que llegues a la reunión de hoy con la cabeza despejada."
    ama "Because we're on a tour and I prefer you go into today's meeting with a clear head."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3206
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_973dfa6e:

    # bet "Es su forma de decir que son números que impresionan."
    bet "It's her way of saying they're impressive numbers."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3207
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_bf29b46d:

    # mc "¿Lo son?"
    mc "Are they?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3208
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_ce891c2e:

    # bet "Mucho. He hablado con [mael] estos últimos días."
    bet "Very. I've been talking to [mael] these past few days."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3210
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_41618d42:

    # mc "¿Qué hacemos con todo esto? ¿Con la sala, con el equipo?"
    mc "What do we do with all this? With the room, with the equipment?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3211
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_5d21dd38:

    # ama "Ese es exactamente el tipo de pregunta que necesitamos que hagas tú en la reunión. Y que la respondas."
    ama "That's exactly the kind of question we need you to ask at the meeting. And answer it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3212
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_e6326af3:

    # mc "No tengo respuesta todavía."
    mc "I don't have an answer yet."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3213
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_76b508e2:

    # ama "No la necesitas hoy."
    ama "You don't need one today."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3215
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_3a77c5a2:

    # mc "¿Podemos entrar?"
    mc "Can we go in? [bet] is going to smash her nose against the glass..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3216
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_5bc34429:

    # ama "No con la ropa de calle. Hay que entrar con trajes de protección y pasar un proceso de desinfección antes."
    ama "Not in street clothes. We have to wear protective suits and go through a decontamination process first."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3223
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_714d05fb:

    # ama "Se entra por detrás. Esta puerta solo se usa cuando no hay ningún proceso de clonación en marcha y la sala no necesita ser estéril."
    ama "You enter from the back. This door is only used when there's no cloning process underway and the room doesn't need to be sterile."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3217
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_19e1bb29:

    # mc "Me parece lógico."
    mc "Makes sense."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3219
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_77840939:

    # bet "Hay cosas que llevan tiempo digerir. Creo que esta es una de ellas."
    bet "Some things take time to process. I think this is one of them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3220
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_feaf16a6:

    # mc "¿Tú cómo lo llevas? A mí se me están poniendo los pelos de punta."
    mc "How are you holding up? It's giving me the creeps."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3221
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_7bccaec0:

    # bet "Me voy a centrar en ser útil. En hacer lo que sé hacer."
    bet "I'm going to focus on being useful. On doing what I know how to do."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3226
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c407e765:

    # bet "Hay cosas que llevan tiempo digerir. Creo que esta sala es una de ellas."
    bet "There are things that take time to digest. I think this room is one of them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3229
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_801f91e4:

    # bet "No voy a juzgar lo que se ha hecho aquí con anterioridad. Juzgaré si no se deja de hacer."
    bet "I'm not going to judge what was done here previously. I'll judge if it doesn't stop."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3224
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_5606b665:

    # ama "Instalaciones médicas. Quirófanos, recuperación, consultas."
    ama "Medical facilities. Operating rooms, recovery, and consultation rooms."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3225
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_54346d53:

    # mc "Impresiona. Es más grande de lo que esperaba."
    mc "Impressive. It's bigger than I expected."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3227
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_cf26a2dc:

    # bet "Supongo que se necesita un hospital pequeño en un sitio así."
    bet "I suppose a small hospital is needed in a place like this."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3228
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_ba9d6eb4:

    # bet "Imagino que las heridas pueden ser diversas, sabiendo a lo que se dedica la empresa."
    bet "I imagine the injuries can be quite diverse, knowing what the company does."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3230
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_20b85ec0:

    # ama "Diversas es una palabra muy diplomática."
    ama "Diverse is a very diplomatic word."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3232
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c15af9f7:

    # bet "Soy médico. La diplomacia es parte del trabajo."
    bet "I'm a doctor. Diplomacy is part of the job."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3233
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_460bdb97:

    # mc "¿Cuántas camas de recuperación hay?"
    mc "How many recovery beds are there?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3235
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_1f28ec2e:

    # ama "Veinticuatro. Aunque hemos llegado a tener más ocupación de la deseable."
    ama "Twenty-four. Although we've had more occupancy than desirable."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3236
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_716f5230:

    # mc "¿Y ahora mismo?"
    mc "And right now?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3238
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_93a1d949:

    # ama "Nueve pacientes, por lo que he leído. Desde una gripe hasta... [gav] y varios heridos de la Guerra Clon."
    ama "Nine patients, from what I've read. Ranging from a flu to... [gav] and several wounded from the Clone War."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3239
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_7c29365d:

    # mc "¿[gav] aún está aquí?"
    mc "Is [gav] still here?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3241
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_d9d3c8b1:

    # bet "Después de hablar con él, he creído que sería lo mejor que se mantuviera en un entorno controlado."
    bet "After talking to him, I thought it would be best if he stayed in a controlled environment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3242
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_2fd9fae1:

    # bet "Puede salir de su habitación y moverse por la base, pero no más excursiones a la playa de momento."
    bet "He can leave his room and move around the base, but no more excursions to the beach for now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3243
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_871edece:

    # mc "¿Va a funcionar bien lo del brazo?"
    mc "Is the arm thing going to work well?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3245
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_ac4a8c8b:

    # bet "Va a funcionar mejor que el original. No es una exageración, es una maravilla de la ingeniería."
    bet "It's going to work better than the original. That's no exaggeration, it's an engineering marvel."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3246
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_918d07e8:

    # bet "Tengo ganas de ver el aparato real. Hasta ahora solo he visto fotos y planos."
    bet "I'm looking forward to seeing the real device. So far I've only seen photos and blueprints."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3247
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_b1ec7853:

    # mc "¿Cuándo es la intervención?"
    mc "When is the surgery?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3249
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_2a7468a5:

    # bet "El lunes. Si todo va bien, en dos semanas estará en fisioterapia."
    bet "On Sunday. If everything goes well, he'll be in physical therapy in two weeks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3250
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_d88fdbbc:

    # mc "¿Y [gav] sabe cómo va a quedar?"
    mc "And does [gav] know how it's going to turn out?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3252
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_4f0709d4:

    # bet "Le expliqué cada paso. Me preguntó si podría volver al campo."
    bet "I explained every step to him. He asked if he could go back to the field."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3253
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_5c602d0c:

    # mc "¿Y?"
    mc "And?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3254
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_ac93f27d:

    # bet "Le dije que probablemente sí. Que el brazo no iba a ser su límite."
    bet "I told him probably yes. That the arm wasn't going to be his limit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3255
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_457c1076:

    # mc "¿Y él?"
    mc "And how did he react?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3265
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_33cfb197:

    # ama "Se debió poner contento."
    ama "He must have been happy."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3257
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c759d1da:

    # bet "Se le iluminó la cara. Fue bonito."
    bet "His face lit up. It was sweet."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3258
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_5e02bf30:

    # ama "No me lo habías contado."
    ama "You hadn't told me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3259
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_84c34bcb:

    # bet "Confidencialidad médico-paciente..."
    bet "Doctor-patient confidentiality..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3260
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_0dd13cac:

    # mc "Gracias por hacer esto, de verdad."
    ama "Thanks for doing this, really."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3261
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_323f3ee6:

    # bet "Es mi trabajo. Pero también... después de hablar con el chico... me importa."
    bet "It's my job. But also... after talking to the kid... I care."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3263
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_391f88cf:

    # ama "Tenemos que seguir. El hangar nos espera."
    ama "We have to keep going. The hangar is waiting for us."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3264
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_46ba6c1e:

    # bet "Yo me voy a quedar aquí. No tengo ningún interés en ver armas. A ver si puedo encontrar a alguien que me enseñe esto en profundidad."
    bet "I'm going to stay here. I have no interest in seeing weapons. Let's see if I can find someone to show me this in depth."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3265
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_aa2ffe0d:

    # ama "¿Sabrás encontrar la sala de reuniones? Tenemos una en cuarenta minutos con los jefes de departamento."
    ama "Will you know how to find the meeting room? We have one in forty minutes with the department heads."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3267
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_542718fc:

    # bet "No lo había pensado..."
    bet "I hadn't thought about that..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3268
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_b830a32c:

    # ama "Segunda puerta a la derecha del ascensor en el segundo piso."
    ama "Second door on the right from the elevator on the second floor."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3269
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_9eff3961:

    # bet "Encontraré algo parecido a eso y confiaré en la intuición."
    bet "I'll find something resembling that and trust my intuition."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3272
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_72521cef:

    # mc "¿Cuánto tiempo llevamos? No me gustaría llegar tarde a la reunión."
    mc "How long have we been here? I don't want to be late for the meeting."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3273
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_2bfccbf6:

    # ama "Veinte minutos. Tenemos margen."
    ama "There are forty minutes left. We have some time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3274
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_66b76905:

    # mc "¿Qué hay en el hangar?"
    mc "What's in the hangar?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3275
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c47cb59c:

    # ama "Vehículos operativos. Lo que usamos en el campo de entrenamiento."
    ama "Operational vehicles. What we use on the training ground."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3278
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_41701d6a:

    # ama "Hangar principal. Aquí guardamos los vehículos de uso habitual."
    ama "Main hangar. This is where we keep the vehicles in regular use."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3279
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_dd2ebd94:

    # mc "Hay más de lo que pensaba."
    mc "There are more than I thought."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3280
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_bcc6af59:

    # ama "NTR opera en entornos variados. Necesitamos versatilidad."
    ama "NTR operates in varied environments. We need versatility."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3281
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_777b2cc3:

    # mc "¿Me los explicas?"
    mc "Can you explain them to me?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3283
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_14786c38:

    # ama "Vehículos ligeros para reconocimiento y desplazamiento rápido. Camiones para logística y personal."
    ama "Light vehicles for recon and rapid deployment. Trucks for logistics and personnel."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3284
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_0a4a32b3:

    # ama "Los AFV para zonas con resistencia moderada. Y los IFV para operaciones de combate directo."
    ama "AFVs for areas with moderate resistance. And IFVs for direct combat operations."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3285
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_d4107052:

    # ama "Muchos de ellos son capturas que hemos traído a la base para poder entrenar con ellos y conocer diversos tipos de vehículos."
    ama "Many of them are captures we've brought to the base so we can train with them and get to know different types of vehicles."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3296
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_0ce93641:

    # "Sigues con la mirada sus gestos, intentando adivinar qué vehículo corresponde a qué siglas. Solo eres capaz de ponerle nombre a los camiones."
    "You follow her gestures with your eyes, trying to guess which vehicle corresponds to which acronym. You're only able to name the trucks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3286
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_18a46dcd:

    # mc "¿Estos son los vehículos que alquilamos a otras empresas?"
    mc "Are these the vehicles we rent out to other companies?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3288
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_3a71b47d:

    # ama "Algunos de ellos. En la mayoría de las misiones de infiltración no usamos vehículos o nos los proporcionan en el destino."
    ama "Some of them. In most infiltration missions we don't use land vehicles, or they're provided for us at the destination."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3289
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_734bc7f6:

    # ama "La mayoría se usa para entrenar o para transporte."
    ama "Most of them are used for training or transport."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3290
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_49346031:

    # mc "Espera. ¿Eso de ahí es un tanque?"
    mc "Wait. Is that a tank over there?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3303
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_a17f9edc:

    # ama "¿Ese?"
    ama "That one?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3294
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_b5e6776f:

    # ama "No."
    ama "No, that isn't a tank."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3295
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_27d7305e:

    # mc "Parece un tanque."
    mc "It looks like a tank."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3296
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_f9bba86a:

    # ama "Tiene cadenas, torreta y un cañón. Lo entiendo. Pero no es un tanque."
    ama "It has tracks, a turret, and a cannon. I get it. But it's not a tank."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3308
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_535a70b6:

    # "Parece genuínamente sorprendida de que no lo sepas. A ti te sigue pareciendo un tanque."
    "She seems genuinely surprised that you don't know. To you, it still looks like a tank."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4093
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_0b7ce2f7:

    # "Parece genuinamente sorprendida de que no lo sepas. A ti te sigue pareciendo un tanque."
    "She seems genuinely surprised that you don't know. It still looks like a tank to you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3297
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_65325c94:

    # mc "¿Qué es entonces?"
    mc "What is it then?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3298
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_3122cafb:

    # ama "Un IFV. Vehículo de combate de infantería. Un Bradley, si quieres el nombre específico."
    ama "An IFV. Infantry Fighting Vehicle. A Bradley, if you want the specific name."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3299
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_9f66fff7:

    # ama "Ese en concreto salió del Líbano hace unos años."
    ama "That one in particular came out of Lebanon a few years ago."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3300
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_2399641f:

    # mc "¿Cuál es la diferencia entre un IFV y un tanque?"
    mc "What's the difference between an IFV and a tank?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3302
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_e8712b86:

    # ama "Un tanque está diseñado para destruir otros vehículos acorazados y posiciones blindadas."
    ama "A tank is designed to destroy other armored vehicles and fortified positions."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3303
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_261cb618:

    # ama "El IFV lleva infantería al combate y les da apoyo de fuego. Es otra filosofía."
    ama "The IFV carries infantry into combat and provides fire support. It's a different philosophy."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3304
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_44e6c996:

    # mc "¿Y NTR no tiene tanques?"
    mc "And NTR doesn't have tanks?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3306
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_fdb1c96e:

    # ama "No. Ni los necesitamos."
    ama "No. We don't even need them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3307
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_442d7fdf_1:

    # mc "¿Por qué no?"
    mc "Why not?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3308
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_11187978:

    # ama "NTR no hace guerra convencional. No somos un ejército. Hacemos operaciones de precisión, espionaje, extracción, eliminación..."
    ama "NTR doesn't do conventional warfare. We aren't an army. We do precision operations, espionage, extraction, elimination..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3309
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_d4dcc286:

    # ama "Un tanque en ese contexto es un problema logístico enorme y una señal muy visible."
    ama "A tank in that context is a huge logistical problem and a very visible signal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3310
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_ac15cdf7:

    # mc "No queremos visibilidad."
    mc "We don't want visibility."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3312
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_58fb179c:

    # ama "Exacto. Los IFV nos dan protección y potencia de fuego sin anunciar que venimos."
    ama "Exactly. IFVs give us protection and firepower without announcing that we're coming."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3326
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_974c9428:

    # "Su sonrisa te dice que has acertado. Se la ve contenta de que empieces a entender su mundo. Un mundo que va a ser el tuyo también."
    "Her smile tells you that you guessed right. She looks happy that you're starting to understand her world. A world that's going to be yours too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3313
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_d3b5cf1c:

    # ama "Si cae uno en nuestras manos en una misión, estamos entrenados para usarlo a nivel básico, pero no es lo normal."
    ama "If one falls into our hands on a mission, we're trained to use it at a basic level, but it's not the norm."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3314
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_67dcdea5:

    # mc "Tiene sentido."
    mc "Makes sense."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3316
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_17a38d52:

    # ama "Además, mover los tanques, mantenerlos, tripularlos... requiere infraestructura que no tenemos aquí."
    ama "Besides, moving tanks, maintaining them, crewing them... requires infrastructure we don't have here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3317
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_ce77575f:

    # ama "Y capturar un tanque es mucho más raro, con lo que no necesitamos ese entrenamiento."
    ama "And capturing a tank is much rarer, so we don't need that training."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3318
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_f4f0bbbf:

    # mc "Entiendo. ¿Cuántos IFV tenemos?"
    mc "I see. How many IFVs do we have?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3320
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_62d67e93:

    # ama "Cuatro operativos de diferentes modelos. Un par más inoperativos, pero también los usamos para entrenamiento."
    ama "Four operational ones of different models. A couple more are non-operational, but we also use them for training."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4120
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_092456e0:

    # ama "Los AFV son ocho. Son como un IFV, pero con ruedas en vez de cadenas. En algunos sitios se les llama igual."
    ama "There are eight AFVs. They're like an IFV, but with wheels instead of tracks. In some places they're called the same thing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3321
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_4851b21c:

    # ama "Los AFV son ocho. Son como un IFV pero con ruedas en vez de cadenas. En algunos sitios se les llama igual."
    ama "There are eight AFVs. They're like an IFV but with wheels instead of tracks. In some places they're called the same thing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3322
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c1661fd9:

    # mc "¿Todo esto cabe aquí?"
    mc "Does all of this fit in here?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3324
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_314abfa6:

    # ama "Este es el hangar principal de la base. Hay otro más en las instalaciones de entrenamiento."
    ama "This is the main hangar of the base. There's another one, even bigger, at the training facilities."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3325
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_8f8a907a:

    # mc "¿Y los aviones y helicópteros?"
    mc "What about the planes and helicopters?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3326
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_a3430981:

    # ama "En el aeropuerto o en las instalaciones de entrenamiento. Están un poco alejados de la base."
    ama "At the airport or the training facilities. They're a bit away from the base."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3327
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_73982012:

    # mc "¿A cuánto están?"
    mc "How far are they?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3329
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_b637b71b:

    # ama "Unos tres kilómetros. Allí está el campo de entrenamiento, los almacenes de armamento, la pista de aterrizaje, el hangar de aeronaves y otro hangar de vehículos."
    ama "About three kilometers. Over there is the training ground, the weapons depots, the airstrip, the aircraft hangar, and the other vehicle hangar."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3330
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c438ab01:

    # mc "¿Por qué separado?"
    mc "Why are they separate?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3331
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_d531339f:

    # ama "Seguridad y logística. Si algo falla en un punto, no compromete el otro."
    ama "Security and logistics. If something fails at one point, it doesn't compromise the other."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3332
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_fb8daad5:

    # mc "¿Lo veremos hoy?"
    mc "Will we see it today?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3334
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_60167086:

    # ama "No tenemos tiempo antes de la reunión. Te lo agendo para mañana si quieres."
    ama "We don't have time before the meeting. I'll schedule it for tomorrow if you want."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3335
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c9243ff0:

    # mc "Sí. Quiero verlo todo."
    mc "Yes. I want to see everything."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3336
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_3d9906cf:

    # ama "Lo suponía."
    ama "I figured."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3338
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_27f0abd1:

    # mc "Oye."
    mc "Hey."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3339
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_45b012e8:

    # ama "¿Sí?"
    ama "Yeah?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3340
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_29e72cc7:

    # mc "Esto es muy grande."
    mc "This is really big."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3341
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_af45e037_1:

    # ama "Lo sé."
    ama "I know."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3342
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_e39094cc:

    # mc "No lo digo en sentido logístico ni me refiero a la base. Lo digo en el sentido de... es mucha responsabilidad."
    mc "I don't mean it in a logistical sense, nor am I referring to the base. I mean it in the sense of... it's a lot of responsibility."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3343
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c1fc5fcc:

    # mc "Mientras estábamos en casa todo era muy abstracto. Ahora estoy viendo que es... real."
    mc "While we were at home everything was very abstract. Now I'm seeing that it's... real."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3345
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_8f0140e6:

    # ama "También lo sé."
    ama "I know that too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3346
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_2437b094:

    # mc "¿Y tú crees que puedo con esto?"
    mc "And you think I can handle this?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3347
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_4f80d06f:

    # ama "No te habría apoyado si no lo creyera."
    ama "I wouldn't have supported you if I didn't believe it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3348
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_b2ff6979:

    # mc "Eso no responde exactamente a mi pregunta."
    mc "That doesn't exactly answer my question."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3350
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_64b655c1:

    # ama "*Risa* Sí la responde. Solo hay que escuchar bien la respuesta."
    ama "*Laugh* Yes it does. You just have to listen carefully to the answer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3351
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_63fd57b4:

    # mc "Eres muy directa cuando quieres."
    mc "You're very direct when you want to be."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3352
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_18975b19:

    # ama "*Risa* Soy directa siempre. Lo que pasa es que este sitio..."
    ama "*Laugh* I'm always direct. The thing is, this place..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3353
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_51492c4a:

    # mc "¿Te está afectando volver?"
    mc "Is coming back getting to you?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3355
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_ca001451:

    # ama "Un poco. Esta empresa necesitaba un cambio real, no cosmético."
    ama "A little. This company needed a real change, not a cosmetic one."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3356
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_7bf6aaa2:

    # ama "Lo que has planeado para hoy, las reuniones de dentro de un rato..."
    ama "What you've planned for today, the meeting in a little while..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3357
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_445ce296:

    # ama "Eso no es lo que hacía el anterior CEO. En absoluto."
    ama "That's not what the previous CEO did. Not at all."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3358
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_cfcb856a:

    # mc "El listón no estaba muy alto."
    mc "The bar wasn't very high."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3360
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_6517222d:

    # ama "No. Pero tú lo has subido de todas formas. Eso importa. Y aún no has empezado a trabajar..."
    ama "No. But you raised it anyway. That matters. And you haven't even started working yet..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3361
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_872828eb:

    # mc "Gracias, Amanda."
    mc "Thanks, Amanda."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3362
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_3330b244:

    # ama "No me las des todavía. Queda mucho trabajo."
    ama "Don't thank me yet. There's a lot of work left."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3363
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_50d8828a:

    # mc "Lo sé."
    mc "I know."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3365
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_93634100:

    # ama "Nos quedan veinte minutos para la reunión. ¿Tienes alguna pregunta antes de entrar?"
    ama "We have twenty minutes left before the meeting. Do you have any questions before we go in?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3366
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_46661b66:

    # mc "Varias. Pero pueden esperar."
    mc "Several. But they can wait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3367
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_868eb3a1:

    # ama "Bien. Ah, y una cosa más."
    ama "Good. Oh, and one more thing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3368
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_a3db9a7f:

    # mc "¿Qué?"
    mc "What?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3370
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_827244e5:

    # ama "Si preguntan algo que no sepas responder, no finjas que lo sabes."
    ama "If they ask something you don't know how to answer, don't pretend you do."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3385
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_6197c694:

    # "Parece que la conversación sobre el no-tanque que tiene justo detrás le ha abierto los ojos a que eres novato en esto."
    "It seems the conversation about the not-tank right behind her has opened her eyes to the fact that you're a rookie at this."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3371
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_aa3d4492:

    # mc "¿Eso pasa mucho en estas reuniones?"
    mc "Does that happen a lot in these meetings?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3372
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_abe99241:

    # ama "Con los jefes de departamento, siempre."
    ama "With the department heads, always."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3373
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_54ae708d:

    # mc "Consejo anotado."
    mc "Advice noted."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3375
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_e9d0c3cc:

    # ama "Son buenos en lo suyo, pero llevan años sin rendirle demasiadas cuentas a nadie."
    ama "They're good at what they do, but they haven't had to answer to anyone for years."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3376
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_dc214e2a:

    # mc "¿Eso es una advertencia?"
    mc "Is that a warning?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3377
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_a65f3029:

    # ama "Es contexto. La advertencia es que algunos van a intentar marearte con tecnicismos."
    ama "It's context. The warning is that some of them will try to confuse you with technicalities."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3378
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_520db1fc:

    # mc "¿Y qué hago?"
    mc "And what do I do?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3380
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_64550313:

    # ama "Escuchar. Preguntar. Y no firmar nada que no entiendas."
    ama "Listen. Ask questions. And don't sign anything you don't understand."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3381
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_daf55b5f:

    # mc "¿Ha pasado eso antes?"
    mc "Has that happened before?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3382
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_b2952f57:

    # ama "Con el Daniels, sí. Varias veces. Les dejaba hacer siempre y cuando cumplieran con los objetivos."
    ama "With Daniels, yes. Several times. He let them do as they pleased as long as they met the objectives."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3383
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_6ba3cf84:

    # mc "¿Y cómo acabó?"
    mc "And how did that end?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3385
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_d3b0eca8:

    # ama "Ya sabes cómo acabó. Mal. Por eso te lo digo ahora."
    ama "You know how it ended. Badly. That's why I'm telling you now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3386
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_035146fc:

    # mc "¿Vas a estar tú en la reunión?"
    mc "Are you going to be in the meeting?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3387
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_0051c6a3:

    # ama "A tu lado. Todo el rato."
    ama "By your side. The whole time. I'm not going to leave you alone among the sharks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3388
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_9a2a7c2b:

    # mc "Bien."
    mc "Good."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3391
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_b5ecfb44:

    # "En la puerta de la sala de reuniones, unos minutos después..."
    "At the door of the meeting room, a few minutes later..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3392
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_e7c0540e:

    # ama "¿Algo más antes de que entremos?"
    ama "Anything else before we go in?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3393
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_5956fca8:

    # mc "Sí. Una cosa."
    mc "Yeah. One thing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3394
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_ebe0f4ba:

    # ama "Dime."
    ama "Tell me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3395
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_8d0e1a50:

    # mc "Quiero reunirme con los clones. Con los operativos."
    mc "I want to meet with the clones. With the operatives."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3397
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_63f13e2e:

    # ama "¿Hoy?"
    ama "When? Today?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3398
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_9c149142:

    # mc "Después de la reunión de jefes de departamento. Si es posible."
    mc "After the department heads meeting. If possible."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3400
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_5c8cd1b7:

    # ama "[aar] me comentó que han formado un comité. Para hablar contigo de forma organizada."
    ama "[aar] told me they've formed a committee. To talk to you in an organized manner."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3401
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_185554ac:

    # mc "Perfecto. Eso es exactamente lo que quiero."
    mc "Perfect. That's exactly what I want."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3402
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_0b2f1aca:

    # ama "¿Cuándo propones?"
    ama "When do you suggest?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3403
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_06d1e40e:

    # mc "Una hora después de que acabemos con los jefes de departamento. ¿Es viable?"
    mc "An hour after we finish with the department heads. Is that doable?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3419
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c39437dd:

    # mc "Tengo que hablar con [car] y con Soporte informático. Puedo reunirme con los clones entre las dos cosas."
    mc "I need to talk to [car] and IT Support. I can meet with the clones in between."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3405
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_30108ff2:

    # ama "Puedo organizarlo. Dame un segundo para que les avise para que estén preparados dentro de un par de horas."
    ama "I can set that up. Give me a second to let them know so they can be ready in a couple of hours."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3406
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_eca8e830:

    # mc "Bien. No quiero que parezca una imposición. Quiero que sepan que lo estoy pidiendo yo."
    mc "Good. I don't want it to seem like an imposition. I want them to know I'm the one asking."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3407
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_a647bd2d:

    # ama "Se lo haré saber."
    ama "I'll let them know."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3408
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_b2516466:

    # mc "Gracias."
    mc "Thanks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3410
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_df4ae749:

    # ama "¿Sabes qué les vas a decir?"
    ama "Do you know what you're going to say to them?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3411
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_7bcfe1d1:

    # mc "Aún no. Pero sé que voy a escucharles."
    mc "Not yet. But I know I'm going to listen to them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3412
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_3a6c3597:

    # ama "Con eso es suficiente para empezar."
    ama "That's enough to start with."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3413
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_31fd88d8:

    # mc "¿Crees que van a fiarse de mí?"
    mc "Do you think they'll trust me?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3415
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_0969eb05:

    # ama "Algunos sí. Otros necesitarán tiempo. Es normal."
    ama "Some of them will. Others will need time. It's normal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3416
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_e703eb26:

    # mc "¿Y tú te fías de mí?"
    mc "And do you trust me?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3417
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_d3a517c8:

    # ama "Ya te lo he dicho antes. No hay nadie de quien me fíe más que de ti en cuanto a esto."
    ama "I've told you before. There's no one I trust more than you when it comes to this."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3418
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_a223bcfb:

    # mc "Lo sé, pero me gusta escucharlo."
    mc "I know, but I like hearing it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3420
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_0a05c01e:

    # ama "*Risa* No lo voy a volver a repetir o se te acabará subiendo a la cabeza."
    ama "*Laugh* I'm not going to repeat it again or it'll end up going to your head."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3421
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_c03e6302:

    # mc "*Risa* Está bien. Tenía que intentarlo."
    mc "*Laugh* Alright. I had to try."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3422
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_3673040a:

    # ama "Venga. La reunión nos espera."
    ama "Come on. The meeting awaits us."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3423
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_63cd8ebd:

    # mc "Vamos."
    mc "Let's go."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3424
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_de79a378:

    # "[ama] envía un par de mensajes de texto antes de entrar."
    "[ama] sends a couple of text messages before going in."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3425
translate english c31s006_baseArrival_1d1dfe8b:

    # "Un escalofrío te recorre la columna vertebral."
    "A chill runs down your spine."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2869
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_23940c53:

    # "Al entrar en la sala, todo el mundo se sienta rápidamente. El futuro brazo de [gav] tiene un aspecto impresionante."
    "Upon entering the room, everyone sits down quickly. [gav]'s future arm looks impressive."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2870
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_13f81308:

    # "Tienes que retenerte para acercarte a mirarlo con detalle. Parece sacado de una película de ciencia ficción."
    "You have to hold yourself back from going over to look at it in detail. It looks like something out of a sci-fi movie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2871
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_824948ce:

    # "Descubres que vas a odiar esta sala nada más entrar. Es oscura y opresiva. En línea con la imagen de la empresa."
    "You realize you're going to hate this room as soon as you walk in. It's dark and oppressive. Right in line with the company's image."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2873
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_b5425eca:

    # "[aar] hace las presentaciones. Nadie se levanta a estrecharte la mano."
    "[aar] makes the introductions. Nobody stands up to shake your hand."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2874
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_68e75baa:

    # aar "[flo], Jefe del Departamento Comercial."
    aar "[flo], Head of the Commercial Department."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2876
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_f7532d1f:

    # aar "[vin], Jefe del Departamento Financiero."
    aar "[vin], Head of the Financial Department."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2878
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_3f0b9abf:

    # aar "[mael], Jefe del Departamento de Clonación y Medicina."
    aar "[mael], Head of the Cloning and Medicine Department."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2880
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_54f4ccaf:

    # aar "[cal], Departamento de Clonación y Medicina."
    aar "[cal], Cloning and Medicine Department."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2881
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_a694a0a1:

    # "Notas la ausencia del término 'Jefe' al nombrar a [cal]. Es el diseñador del brazo."
    "You notice the absence of the title 'Head' when naming [cal]. He's the designer of the arm."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2883
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4412ee22:

    # mc "Bien. Gracias a todos por venir."
    mc "Good. Thank you all for coming."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2885
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_6c0fdd61:

    # "Señalas el brazo electromecánico antes de continuar. Te hubiera gustado mirarlo con detenimiento antes de empezar la reunión."
    "You point to the electromechanical arm before continuing. You would have liked to examine it closely before starting the meeting."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2886
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_e86b371d:

    # "Todos lo miran, siguiendo la dirección que tu mano señala."
    "Everyone looks at it, following the direction your hand is pointing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2887
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_36cd575a:

    # mc "Sé que no es la forma más habitual de empezar una reunión de dirección, pero quería tenerlo aquí."
    mc "I know it's not the most conventional way to start a management meeting, but I wanted it here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2888
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_ad70f504:

    # mc "Para recordarme, y recordaros, de qué somos capaces cuando miramos en la dirección correcta."
    mc "To remind myself, and to remind you, of what we're capable of when we look in the right direction."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2890
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_d321dd09:

    # mc "Antes de entrar en materia, me gustaría que cada uno me diese un resumen de su área."
    mc "Before getting down to business, I'd like each of you to give me a summary of your area."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2891
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_aa402515:

    # mc "¿En qué estado de la empresa? Sin adornos. Empecemos por ti, [aar]."
    mc "What state is the company in? No sugarcoating. Let's start with you, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2893
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_233b51bd:

    # aar "De acuerdo. El Área Operaciones está activa y a pleno rendimiento."
    aar "Alright. The Operations Area is active and running at full capacity."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2894
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_560d333d:

    # aar "Tenemos compromisos firmados con varios clientes para los próximos dos trimestres: Colombia, Estados Unidos, Reino Unido, y Francia."
    aar "We have signed commitments with several clients for the next two quarters: Colombia, the United States, the United Kingdom, and France."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2895
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_2ff5a840:

    # aar "En total son siete contratos de distinta envergadura, todos en fase de ejecución o preparación avanzada."
    aar "In total, there are seven contracts of varying scope, all in the execution or advanced preparation phase."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2896
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_70600eb1:

    # aar "Los equipos de campo están operativos. No hay bajas graves en este momento, salvo el caso de [gav], que ya conocéis."
    aar "The field teams are operational. There are no serious casualties at the moment, except for [gav]'s case, which you already know about."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2898
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_96b7f82a:

    # aar "Aparte de eso tenemos varios contratos de soporte con otras PMCs. Iron Fist y Walküre son nuestros principales clientes en ese área."
    aar "Apart from that, we have several support contracts with other PMCs. Iron Fist and Walküre are our main clients in that area."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2899
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_0ba968c5:

    # aar "Atlas y Chimera son clientes con contratos más pequeños, pero más continuos. Te mandé una lista detallada del resto de clientes."
    aar "Atlas and Chimera are clients with smaller, but more continuous contracts. I sent you a detailed list of the rest of the clients."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2900
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_920a77d8:

    # mc "Lo sé. La vi. Y vi que incluía clientes con los que hace diez años que no trabajamos ya."
    mc "I know. I saw it. And I saw that it included clients we haven't worked with in ten years."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2902
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_e085fbfc:

    # "[aar] hace oídos sordos a tu crítica velada antes de continuar."
    "[aar] turns a deaf ear to your veiled criticism before continuing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2903
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_646688bc:

    # aar "El problema es que todos esos contratos, los de operaciones y los de soporte, tienen fechas de entrega."
    aar "The problem is that all those contracts, both operations and support, have deadlines."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2904
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_f55cc2c5:

    # aar "Si tocamos la estructura operativa, necesito saberlo con tiempo suficiente para no dejar a nadie tirado a mitad de una misión."
    aar "If we touch the operational structure, I need to know with enough time so we don't leave anyone stranded in the middle of a mission."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2905
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_962b4142:

    # mc "Entendido."
    mc "Understood."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2907
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_64d383ed:

    # mc "[flo], ¿Departamento Comercial?"
    mc "[flo], Commercial Department?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2908
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_003a31f7:

    # flo "El panorama es interesante. Tenemos negociaciones abiertas con el Gobierno de Colombia para tres operaciones encubiertas de medio plazo."
    flo "The outlook is interesting. We have open negotiations with the Colombian government for three medium-term covert operations."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2909
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_b4c7cb3e:

    # flo "Con Estados Unidos hay conversaciones preliminares sobre seis operaciones extra aparte de las que ya están contratadas. El contacto con ellos es sólido."
    flo "With the United States, there are preliminary talks about six extra operations on top of the ones already contracted. Our contact with them is solid."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2910
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_d092d406:

    # flo "Reino Unido y Francia tienen una operación en marcha cada uno. Estoy en negociaciones con Francia para ampliar nuestra área de actuación al Sahel."
    flo "The UK and France each have one ongoing operation. I'm in negotiations with France to expand our area of operations to the Sahel."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2911
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_a3167936:

    # flo "Todos son clientes que pagan bien y que repiten."
    flo "They're all high-paying, repeat clients."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2913
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_d4bd0ba1:

    # flo "China e Israel han querido contratarnos en diversas ocasiones, pero Richards nunca quiso llegar a un acuerdo con ellos. Pagan bien."
    flo "China and Israel have wanted to hire us on several occasions, but Richards never wanted to reach an agreement with them. They pay well."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2914
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_a75bc9e3:

    # flo "Corea del Norte e Irán se han puesto en contacto varias veces, pero estaban vetados porque nos podría acarrear perder contratos con otros clientes."
    flo "North Korea and Iran have reached out several times, but they were vetoed because it could cause us to lose contracts with other clients."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2916
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_128e5c09:

    # flo "Dicho esto... y sé que puede sonar raro viniendo de mí... creo que hay un mercado enorme esperando en el sector médico."
    flo "That being said... and I know it might sound weird coming from me... I think there's a huge market waiting in the medical sector."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2917
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_5b9b1d71:

    # flo "Alta tecnología, equipamiento hospitalario y dispositivos de consumo."
    flo "High tech, hospital equipment, and consumer devices."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2918
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_ee75ed15:

    # flo "Si pivotamos bien, podríamos competir en un sector con márgenes muy distintos y mucha menos exposición legal."
    flo "If we pivot well, we could compete in a sector with very different margins and much less legal exposure."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2919
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_f4046e66:

    # mc "Eso es exactamente la dirección en la que quiero que pensemos. Gracias."
    mc "That's exactly the direction I want us to think in. Thank you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2921
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_6f9238d1:

    # mc "[vin], los números."
    mc "[vin], the numbers."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2922
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_b7df0e0b:

    # vin "Sí, los números."
    vin "Yes, the numbers."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2923
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_50a9e85e:

    # vin "Fondos disponibles: doscientos doce millones de dólares. Costes operativos mensuales: veintiséis millones."
    vin "Available funds: two hundred twelve million dollars. Monthly operating costs: twenty-six million."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2924
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_58c0faea:

    # vin "Lo que significa que, sin ingresos nuevos, tenemos algo más de ocho meses antes de que la situación se vuelva... incómoda."
    vin "Which means that, without new income, we have a little over eight months before the situation gets... uncomfortable."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2925
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_21c61ebd:

    # "Tiene una de esas voces que hacen parecer la deriva continental algo divertido de escuchar."
    "He has one of those voices that makes continental drift seem fun to listen to."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2927
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_9665be25:

    # vin "Sin embargo, en el próximo trimestre esperamos la entrada de ciento ochenta y tres millones por operaciones ya realizadas y pendientes de cobro."
    vin "However, in the next quarter we expect an influx of one hundred eighty-three million from operations already completed and pending collection."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2928
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_0536ab7d:

    # vin "Así que, en términos estrictamente financieros, estamos bien."
    vin "So, in strictly financial terms, we're good."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2929
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_94125296:

    # mc "¿Bien bien, o bien de momento?"
    mc "Good good, or good for now?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2931
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_c626803d:

    # vin "Bien de momento, como siempre en esta industria. Pero bien."
    vin "Good for now, as always in this industry. But good."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2932
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_da6f08cb:

    # vin "El anterior CEO, Daniels... era de la opinión de que los números siempre cuadraban si sabías dónde mirar."
    vin "The previous CEO, Daniels... was of the opinion that the numbers always added up if you knew where to look."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2933
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_46424ae7:

    # mc "Daniels está en prisión por cosas como esa, [vin]."
    mc "Daniels is in prison for things like that, [vin]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2935
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_9ee1c93a:

    # vin "Sí. Ya lo sé."
    vin "Yes. I know."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2936
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_bf1b3875:

    # "Hace una pausa breve antes de continuar."
    "He pauses briefly before continuing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2937
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_b4dedfd0:

    # vin "Solo era un comentario sobre su filosofía contable. No sobre sus otros... hobbies."
    vin "It was just a comment on his accounting philosophy. Not on his other... hobbies."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2938
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_1b3e3cc3:

    # "Te acabas de dar cuenta de que tiene unas manos ridículamente pequeñas."
    "You just realized that he has ridiculously small hands."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2939
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_e2f3bb15:

    # "Te cuesta un pequeño esfuerzo contener la risa imaginándotelo contando billetes con esas manos."
    "It takes a bit of effort to hold back your laughter imagining him counting bills with those hands."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2941
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_157c1ec8:

    # mc "[mael], tu turno."
    mc "[mael], your turn."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2942
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_43daf923:

    # "La actitud de [mael] te resulta incómoda."
    "[mael]'s attitude makes you uncomfortable."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2943
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_7319db52:

    # "Es la actitud de alguien que lleva años esperando que le pregunten esto para poder decir exactamente lo contrario de lo que quieren oír."
    "It's the attitude of someone who has spent years waiting to be asked this so they can say exactly the opposite of what people want to hear."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2944
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_9001b5f1:

    # mael "El departamento de clonación y genética es el núcleo tecnológico real de esta empresa."
    mael "The cloning and genetics department is the real technological core of this company."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2945
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_9f573c51:

    # mael "Todo lo demás, las operaciones, los contratos, incluso ese brazo que tenéis ahí en la mesa..."
    mael "Everything else, the operations, the contracts, even that arm you have there on the table..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2947
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_a17cf71d:

    # mael "Todo eso existe porque nosotros llevamos más de 20 años empujando los límites de lo que la biología y la ciencia permite."
    mael "All of that exists because we've spent over 20 years pushing the limits of what biology and science allow."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2948
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4d7e8f81:

    # mael "Tenemos en este momento cuarenta y dos sujetos en fase de gestación avanzada. Nacerán en las próximas semanas."
    mael "We currently have forty-two subjects in advanced stages of gestation. They will be born in the coming weeks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2950
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_f33b7a5f:

    # mael "Son seres humanos viables, y tendremos que decidir qué hacer con ellos independientemente de cualquier decisión estratégica."
    mael "They are viable human beings, and we'll have to decide what to do with them regardless of any strategic decision."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2951
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4c67d937:

    # mael "[aar] ha dicho que quieres cerrar el Departamento de Clonación. Me parece un error."
    mael "[aar] said you want to shut down the Cloning Department. I think that's a mistake."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2952
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_80b136cb:

    # mc "¿Por qué? ¿Si dejamos de producir clones? ¿Qué perdemos exactamente?"
    mc "Why? If we stop producing clones? What exactly do we lose?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2954
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_d8f998f2:

    # mael "Perdemos el conocimiento vivo. La clonación no es solo un producto, es un proceso."
    mael "We lose living knowledge. Cloning isn't just a product, it's a process."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2955
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_3c382f8c:

    # mael "Cada serie nos enseña algo nuevo sobre expresión génica, sobre diferenciación celular, sobre límites del desarrollo embrionario."
    mael "Every batch teaches us something new about gene expression, about cellular differentiation, about the limits of embryonic development."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2956
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_60d48f74:

    # mael "Si cerramos el grifo, en cinco años habremos perdido capacidad técnica que tardamos décadas en construir."
    mael "If we turn off the tap, in five years we'll have lost technical capacity that took us decades to build."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2957
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_073cda67:

    # mc "Entiendo la lógica. Pero... no sé..."
    mc "I understand the logic. But... I don't know..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2958
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_aa20c7a3:

    # mc "¿No podríamos mantener ese conocimiento haciendo... no sé... clones de animales o algo así? ¿Clonar un páncreas suelto para trasplantes?"
    mc "Couldn't we maintain that knowledge by making... I don't know... animal clones or something? Cloning a loose pancreas for transplants?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2959
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_b5345e3d:

    # "Te sientes un poco estúpido. Deberías haber estudiado alternativas para el departamento central de NTR."
    "You feel a bit stupid. You should have studied alternatives for NTR's central department."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2960
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_8f120e10:

    # "Te parece que estás hablando por hablar. Por fin entiendes cómo se siente [emm] muchas veces."
    "You feel like you're just talking without knowing what you are talking about. You finally understand how [emm] feels a lot of the time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2962
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_a69e0430:

    # mael "¿Un páncreas suelto?"
    mael "A loose pancreas?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2963
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_53b10eb4:

    # mc "O lo que sea. Un riñón. Estoy improvisando, no soy biólogo o genetista."
    mc "Or whatever. A kidney. I'm just improvising, I'm not a biologist or a geneticist."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2964
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_f52d080e:

    # mael "No, ya... ya veo que estás improvisando."
    mael "No, yeah... I can see you're improvising."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2965
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_84fa2f30:

    # "Su tono parece decir que, si tuviera un arma en las manos ahora mismo, preferiría apretar el gatillo a tener que lidiar contigo."
    "His tone seems to say that if he had a gun in his hands right now, he'd rather pull the trigger than have to deal with you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2967
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_60ddea4a:

    # "[mael] hace una inspiración profunda antes de continuar, como si se estuviera armando de paciencia para explicarle algo básico a un niño."
    "[mael] takes a deep breath before continuing, as if gathering the patience to explain something basic to a child."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2968
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4809f22b:

    # mael "Los animales serían viables, sí."
    mael "Animals would be viable, yes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2969
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_146d7360:

    # mael "No habría problema legal en Aruba, y desde el punto de vista técnico nos permitiría mantener las habilidades del equipo y seguir investigando."
    mael "There wouldn't be any legal problems in Aruba, and from a technical standpoint, it would allow us to maintain the team's skills and keep researching."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2970
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_78660419:

    # mael "Cerdos, primates, incluso animales en peligro de extinción si queremos darle un ángulo de imagen pública positivo."
    mael "Pigs, primates, even endangered animals if we want to give it a positive public image angle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2972
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_0398d4eb:

    # mael "Los órganos humanos aislados son otro cantar."
    mael "Isolated human organs are a different story."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2973
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_7e196cab:

    # mael "Es técnicamente posible, pero hay obstáculos enormes: vascularización, rechazo inmunológico, maduración fuera de un organismo completo. No está resuelto."
    mael "It's technically possible, but there are huge obstacles: vascularization, immune rejection, maturation outside of a complete organism. It hasn't been solved."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2974
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_e9a74422:

    # mael "Sería un proyecto de investigación, no un producto a corto plazo."
    mael "It would be a research project, not a short-term product."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2975
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_8941e2bd:

    # mc "Pero ¿merece la pena intentarlo?"
    mc "But is it worth a try?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2977
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_fc69572f:

    # mael "Tengo que estudiarlo con más detalle antes de darte una respuesta honesta."
    mael "I need to study it in more detail before giving you an honest answer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2978
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_89babaaa:

    # mael "Lo que sí puedo decirte es que la idea de mantener el departamento abierto con esa orientación... no me disgusta. De hecho, me gusta."
    mael "What I can tell you is that the idea of keeping the department open with that direction... doesn't displease me. In fact, I like it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2979
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_cf1ffbc6:

    # "Un leve sentimiento de sorpresa recorre la mesa. Parece que nadie esperaba que [mael] aceptara tan fácilmente el cambio."
    "A slight feeling of surprise runs across the table. It seems no one expected [mael] to accept the change so easily."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2981
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_af97d9fc:

    # mael "La mayoría de los productos médicos que ha salido de mi departamento han sido accidentes felices."
    mael "Most of the medical products that have come out of my department have been happy accidents."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2982
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_b4a35668:

    # mael "Efectos colaterales de investigación en la que íbamos en otra dirección. ¿Sabes cómo nació nuestra prueba rápida de embarazo?"
    mael "Side effects of research where we were heading in another direction. Do you know how our rapid pregnancy test came about?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2984
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_762a101a:

    # flo "¿La que empezaremos a comercializar en la Unión Europea el mes que viene?"
    flo "The one we'll start marketing in the European Union next month?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2985
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_b415f974:

    # mael "Sí, esa misma."
    mael "Yes, that exact one."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2987
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_fd64c5fa:

    # mael "Pues nació porque estábamos estudiando marcadores moleculares en embriones de primera fase y uno de mis investigadores detectó algo raro."
    mael "Well, it came about because we were studying molecular markers in early-stage embryos and one of my researchers detected something weird."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2988
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_1b694428:

    # mael "Había una molécula que el cuerpo produce mucho antes de que los niveles de hCG, la hormona del embarazo tradicional, sean detectables."
    mael "There was a molecule that the body produces long before hCG levels, the traditional pregnancy hormone, are detectable."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2989
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_e53d55a4:

    # mael "Detectamos embarazos con varias semanas de antelación respecto a cualquier test del mercado."
    mael "We detect pregnancies several weeks earlier than any test on the market."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2991
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_b0910916:

    # mael "¿Estábamos buscando eso? No. Estábamos buscando otra cosa completamente distinta."
    mael "Were we looking for that? No. We were looking for something completely different."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2992
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_03400293:

    # mael "Pero así es como funciona la investigación de frontera. Si cierras el laboratorio, cierras también unas puertas que no sabes que están ahí."
    mael "But that's how frontier research works. If you close the lab, you also close doors you don't even know are there."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2993
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_43446e1d:

    # mael "Puede que las puertas ni siquiera existan o que lo que haya detrás no valga la pena, pero a veces..."
    mael "The doors might not even exist, or what's behind them might not be worth it, but sometimes..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2994
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_b6967b68:

    # mc "Lo entiendo..."
    mc "I get it..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2996
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_8e10ced4:

    # "[bet], que hasta ese momento había estado mirando el brazo con la concentración de alguien que toma el pulso a un paciente, levanta la vista."
    "[bet], who until that moment had been looking at the arm with the concentration of someone taking a patient's pulse, looks up."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2997
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_152c853e:

    # bet "Perdona que interrumpa... ¿cuántos de esos cuarenta y dos sujetos tienen anomalías genéticas detectadas en esta fase?"
    bet "Sorry to interrupt... how many of those forty-two subjects have genetic anomalies detected at this stage?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2998
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_aa92ca51:

    # mael "Ninguno. Nuestros clones son perfectos dentro de los parámetros. Nada que no hayamos gestionado antes."
    mael "None. Our clones are perfect within the parameters. Nothing we haven't handled before."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2999
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_c502921a:

    # bet "¿Y el protocolo si hay complicaciones en el... nacimiento?"
    bet "And the protocol if there are complications during... birth?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3000
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_bed15091:

    # mael "Tenemos equipo médico interno especializado en ello."
    mael "We have an internal medical team specialized in that."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3001
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_dfc3ea70:

    # bet "¿Neonatólogos?"
    bet "Neonatologists?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3002
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4ff43295:

    # mael "Contratados externamente cuando es necesario."
    mael "Hired externally when necessary."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3003
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_715b8968:

    # bet "De acuerdo. Solo preguntaba."
    bet "Alright. Just asking."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3005
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_f82768d2:

    # "[bet] vuelve a mirar el brazo. No parece del todo satisfecha con la respuesta, pero no insiste."
    "[bet] looks at the arm again. She doesn't seem entirely satisfied with the answer, but she doesn't push it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3006
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_0c5d71f1:

    # mc "Bien. Sigamos. [cal]."
    mc "Good. Let's move on. [cal]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3008
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_41a92896:

    # "[cal] no ha hablado hasta ahora. Ha estado mirando el brazo, igual que [bet], aunque con una expresión muy distinta."
    "[cal] hasn't spoken until now. He has been looking at the arm, just like [bet], although with a very different expression."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3009
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_19d12001:

    # "La de alguien que mira con orgullo algo que construyó con sus propias manos porque nadie le prestó suficiente atención."
    "That of someone looking proudly at something they built with their own hands because no one paid them enough attention."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3010
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_92496b3f:

    # "Es uno de los pocos clones que han dejado las operaciones de campo y se han reciclado a otras funciones con éxito."
    "He is one of the few clones who have left field operations and successfully retrained for other roles."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3011
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_dc816664:

    # cal "El brazo es funcional. Todas las pruebas que hemos podido hacer sin una implantación real dan resultados dentro de los parámetros esperados."
    cal "The arm is functional. All the tests we've been able to run without an actual implantation give results within the expected parameters."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3012
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_a453d02d:

    # cal "El sistema de integración neuromuscular es lo más delicado."
    cal "The neuromuscular integration system is the most delicate part."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3013
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_1898ae7a:

    # cal "Básicamente le decimos al sistema nervioso periférico que ese trozo de titanio y goma es una extremidad, y esperamos que se lo crea."
    cal "Basically, we tell the peripheral nervous system that this piece of titanium and rubber is a limb, and we hope it believes it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3015
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_28871556:

    # flo "¿Y se lo cree?"
    flo "And does the peri... the nervous system believe it?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3016
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_7aabb92b:

    # cal "Los modelos de simulación dicen que sí. Pero hasta que no lo hagamos en una persona de verdad, es teoría."
    cal "The simulation models say yes. But until we do it on a real person, it's just theory."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3017
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_e11cf90e:

    # flo "Claro, claro..."
    flo "Right, right..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3018
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_fe32cd00:

    # "[flo] asiente con esa forma de asentir que tiene la gente cuando en realidad está pensando en otra cosa. Quizás está empezando a pensar dónde puede venderlo."
    "[flo] nods with that kind of nod people do when they're actually thinking about something else. Maybe they're starting to think about where they can sell it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3019
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_2a29672a:

    # mc "¿Qué puede hacer ese brazo que no pueda hacer uno natural?"
    mc "What can that arm do that a natural one can't?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3021
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_514e0087:

    # cal "En términos de fuerza, bastante más. No vamos a convertir a [gav] en el Soldado de Otoño, que quede claro."
    cal "In terms of strength, quite a bit more. We're not going to turn [gav] into the Autumn Soldier, just to be clear."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3022
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_93ecd837:

    # cal "Pero sí tendrá en ese brazo una fuerza muscular equivalente a entre dos y tres veces la de su brazo original."
    cal "But he will have muscular strength in that arm equivalent to two to three times that of his original arm."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3024
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_466e155d:

    # cal "El control fino, las tareas de precisión, eso va a requerir rehabilitación y tiempo. Es un proceso."
    cal "Fine motor control, precision tasks, that's going to require rehabilitation and time. It's a process."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3025
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_1db19429:

    # cal "No es una mejora instantánea, es una recuperación con ventajas adicionales."
    cal "It's not an instant upgrade; it's a recovery with added perks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3026
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_35859867:

    # mc "¿Y podríamos hacer lo mismo con otras extremidades? ¿Piernas, por ejemplo? ¿O manos...?"
    mc "And could we do the same with other limbs? Legs, for example? Or hands...?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3028
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_bbb8fa51:

    # cal "En principio, la arquitectura es extrapolable. Las piernas tienen más masa, más carga estructural, el sistema de equilibrio añade complejidad..."
    cal "In principle, the architecture can be extrapolated. Legs have more mass, more structural load, the balance system adds complexity..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3029
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_ae5be5b0:

    # cal "Una mano o un antebrazo serían sencillos de diseñar partiendo del brazo. El problema sería el peso total y la autonomía de las baterías."
    cal "A hand or a forearm would be simple to design based on the arm. The problem would be the total weight and battery life."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3031
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_1b4c2492:

    # cal "Pero si la operación de [gav] sale bien, no veo por qué no."
    cal "But if [gav]'s surgery goes well, I don't see why not."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3032
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4c4d1ff4:

    # cal "Es trabajo, no magia. Y ya hemos hecho el trabajo más difícil."
    cal "It's work, not magic. And we've already done the hardest part."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3034
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_7554c245:

    # bet "¿Cuánto tiempo llevas desarrollando esto?"
    bet "How long have you been developing this?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3035
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_9dd5abb2:

    # cal "Siete años. En mi tiempo libre."
    cal "Seven years. In my free time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3036
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_31e6f40a:

    # bet "¿En tu tiempo libre?"
    bet "In your free time?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3037
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_64d26b3a:

    # cal "La empresa no consideró que fuera una prioridad hasta que les puse el prototipo encima de la mesa."
    cal "The company didn't consider it a priority until I put the prototype on the table."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3039
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_9326bc02:

    # bet "¿Y tú tienes...?"
    bet "And do you have...?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3040
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_9296ded0:

    # cal "¿Una mano mecánica? ¿Yo? No. Nunca llegué a subir tan arriba en la lista de prioridades."
    cal "A mechanical hand? Me? No. I never made it that high up the priority list."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3041
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_dbf775cd:

    # bet "Pues eso es lo primero que deberíamos arreglar cuando terminemos con [gav]."
    bet "Well, that's the first thing we should fix when we're done with [gav]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3043
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_a1aac41c:

    # "[bet] te mira como pidiendo disculpas por si se ha extralimitado."
    "[bet] looks at you apologetically in case she overstepped."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3044
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_8e1a0aed:

    # "[cal] no dice nada, pero te mira con una mezcla de expectación y esperanza."
    "[cal] says nothing, but looks at you with a mix of anticipation and hope."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3045
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_8cbf93b6:

    # mc "Estoy de acuerdo con esa propuesta."
    mc "I agree with that proposal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3046
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_ad04ddba:

    # vin "Desde el punto de vista presupuestario, una unidad adicional del prototipo no debería suponer un..."
    vin "From a budgetary standpoint, an additional unit of the prototype shouldn't be a..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3047
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_2ff084c3:

    # mc "[vin], no es una decisión presupuestaria. Es una deuda."
    mc "[vin], it's not a budgetary decision. It's a debt."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3048
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_f8dca959:

    # vin "De acuerdo."
    vin "Understood."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3050
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_d1155cd4:

    # flo "Si me permitís retomar el hilo comercial un momento..."
    flo "If you'll allow me to get back to the commercial side for a moment..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3051
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_590b3479:

    # flo "Si la operación de [gav] es un éxito, y estoy convencido de que lo será, estamos ante algo que no existe en ningún sitio."
    flo "If [gav]'s operation is a success, and I'm convinced it will be, we're looking at something that doesn't exist anywhere else."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3053
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_8c744874:

    # flo "No hay ninguna prótesis en el mercado con este nivel de integración neuromuscular."
    flo "There is no prosthesis on the market with this level of neuromuscular integration."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3054
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_82b40b02:

    # flo "Ninguna. Lo he estudiado y los competidores más avanzados están a años de distancia."
    flo "None. I've studied it and the most advanced competitors are years away."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3055
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_65a0f41a:

    # flo "El mercado potencial es enorme: militares, civiles, deportistas de élite, accidentes laborales, enfermedades degenerativas..."
    flo "The potential market is huge: military, civilians, elite athletes, workplace accidents, degenerative diseases..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3056
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_788216b8:

    # flo "Podríamos ir desde el segmento premium hospitalario hasta acuerdos con seguros médicos. Es exactamente el tipo de producto de alta tecnología del que hablabas, [mc]."
    flo "We could go from the premium hospital segment to medical insurance agreements. It's exactly the kind of high-tech product you were talking about, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3057
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_0325cf8a:

    # mc "Es exactamente eso."
    mc "That's exactly it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3059
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_081f9d77:

    # ama "Aunque habría que resolver antes la cuestión de las patentes. Si esto se desarrolló dentro de la empresa en tiempo... ¿libre, dijiste?"
    ama "Although the patent issue would have to be resolved first. If this was developed inside the company in... free time, you said?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3060
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4d33f325:

    # cal "Sí."
    cal "Yes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3061
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_5b5b1de6:

    # ama "Eso puede crear ambigüedad en la propiedad intelectual. Habría que limpiar eso antes de lanzarnos al mercado."
    ama "That could create ambiguity in intellectual property. We'd need to clean that up before launching to market."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3062
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_729cfafb:

    # cal "Lo que sea necesario."
    cal "Whatever is necessary."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3063
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_8ef747fc:

    # mc "Bien. Entonces vamos a recapitular lo que tenemos sobre la mesa, literal y metafóricamente."
    mc "Good. Then let's recap what we have on the table, literally and metaphorically."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3065
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_b89df83f:

    # mc "Las operaciones encubiertas comprometidas para los próximos dos trimestres se van a cumplir. [aar], no vamos a dejar contratos sin cerrar."
    mc "The covert operations committed for the next two quarters will be carried out. [aar], we're not going to leave any contracts unfulfilled."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3066
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_99d46b80:

    # aar "Gracias."
    aar "Thank you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3068
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_afbdee79:

    # mc "[flo], las negociaciones con Colombia y con Estados Unidos siguen adelante por ahora."
    mc "[flo], negotiations with Colombia and the United States are moving forward for now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3069
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_c8c77ded:

    # mc "China e Israel hay que estudiarlas con cuidado. Corea del Norte e Irán continúan vetadas o corremos el riesgo de sanciones."
    mc "China and Israel need to be studied carefully. North Korea and Iran remain banned, or we run the risk of sanctions."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3070
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_bc3fbb39:

    # mc "Pero quiero que empieces a explorar en paralelo contactos en el sector médico."
    mc "But I want you to start exploring contacts in the medical sector in parallel."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3071
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_79762cb3:

    # mc "Hospitales, aseguradoras, fondos de inversión sanitarios. No para mañana, pero quiero saber qué hay ahí fuera."
    mc "Hospitals, insurance companies, healthcare investment funds. Not for tomorrow, but I want to know what's out there."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3072
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_e5df2b21:

    # mc "También quiero saber qué tecnologías tenemos que se puedan vender o empezar a fabricar y de las que no hayamos explorado las posibilidades comerciales."
    mc "I also want to know what technologies we have that can be sold or manufactured, and whose commercial possibilities we haven't explored yet."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3073
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_605259e4:

    # flo "Considéralo hecho."
    flo "Consider it done."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3075
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_569c1da7:

    # mc "[mael], quiero en dos semanas un informe sobre la viabilidad real de mantener el departamento de clonación orientado a animales y a investigación de órganos."
    mc "[mael], I want a report in two weeks on the real viability of keeping the cloning department focused on animals and organ research."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3076
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_00eb2451:

    # mc "Sin compromisos por ninguna parte, solo datos."
    mc "No compromises, just data."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3077
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_d30b29a9:

    # mael "Dos semanas. De acuerdo."
    mael "Two weeks. Understood."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3078
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_0e2e7a77:

    # mc "Los cuarenta y dos sujetos que están en gestación... vamos a garantizar que tengan un recibimiento digno y que se les dé una salida adecuada, sea la que sea."
    mc "The forty-two subjects currently in gestation... we're going to guarantee they get a proper welcome and are given a suitable outcome, whatever that may be."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3079
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_84c837a9:

    # mc "No somos los que éramos. No creo que se conviertan en operativos de campo."
    mc "We're not who we used to be. I don't think they'll become field operatives."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3081
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_854445a9:

    # mc "[vin], necesito que me prepares tres escenarios financieros."
    mc "[vin], I need you to prepare three financial scenarios for me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3082
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_e4d39871:

    # mc "Uno con la empresa tal como está, uno con el cierre progresivo de operaciones encubiertas, y uno con una inversión seria en la línea médica."
    mc "One with the company as it is, one with the gradual shutdown of covert operations, and one with a serious investment in the medical division."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3083
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_1d0a32fe:

    # mc "Números reales, no proyecciones optimistas."
    mc "Real numbers, not optimistic projections."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3084
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_d267c4b5:

    # vin "¿Cuándo?"
    vin "When?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3085
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_b3e51eee:

    # mc "La semana que viene."
    mc "Next week."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3086
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4783c894:

    # vin "Claro."
    vin "Sure."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3088
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_85ec888d:

    # mc "[ama], seguridad operativa durante la transición. Necesito que nadie de fuera sepa que estamos cambiando de rumbo hasta que estemos listos para contarlo nosotros."
    mc "[ama], operational security during the transition. I need no one on the outside to know we're changing course until we're ready to announce it ourselves."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3089
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4a06d11e:

    # ama "Entendido."
    ama "Understood."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3091
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_11b93c94:

    # mc "Y [cal]..."
    mc "And [cal]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3092
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_3a412510:

    # mc "Lo que habéis hecho tú y tu equipo es extraordinario."
    mc "What you and your team have done is extraordinary."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3093
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_f483d35b:

    # mc "Quiero que la operación de [gav] sea un éxito, y quiero que tú tengas tu mano."
    mc "I want [gav]'s operation to be a success, and I want you to have your hand."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3094
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_6312b14e:

    # mc "En ese orden, pero quiero las dos cosas."
    mc "In that order, but I want both."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3095
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_e4a4f714:

    # cal "De acuerdo."
    cal "Agreed."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3097
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_80ede5b5:

    # bet "He revisado el protocolo de implantación tres veces y tengo algunas sugerencias para el procedimiento que me gustaría comentar contigo, [cal], antes de entrar a quirófano."
    bet "I've reviewed the implantation protocol three times and I have some suggestions for the procedure that I'd like to discuss with you, [cal], before going into surgery."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3098
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_6e5a6591:

    # cal "Cuando quieras."
    cal "Whenever you want."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3099
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_1027abb3:

    # bet "¿Esta tarde?"
    bet "This afternoon?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3100
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4643f46b:

    # cal "Esta tarde."
    cal "This afternoon."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3102
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_ef97fcde:

    # flo "¿Sabéis lo que sería una historia de marketing perfecta?"
    flo "Do you know what would be a perfect marketing story?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3103
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_8ca89ddc:

    # flo "El ingeniero que diseñó la prótesis porque la necesitaba, recibiendo la prótesis que diseñó. Eso vale más que cualquier campaña publicitaria."
    flo "The engineer who designed the prosthesis because he needed it, receiving the prosthesis he designed. That's worth more than any ad campaign."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3104
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_e4888b9b:

    # cal "No soy una campaña publicitaria, [flo]."
    cal "I'm not an ad campaign, [flo]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3105
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_139e482b:

    # flo "Ya lo sé. Por eso funcionaría."
    flo "I know. That's why it would work."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3107
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_ee5012d9:

    # ama "[flo]..."
    ama "[flo]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3108
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_1c50af4c:

    # flo "¿Qué? Es verdad."
    flo "What? It's true."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3109
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_e25971c4:

    # ama "Es verdad. Y aun así..."
    ama "It is true. And even so..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3110
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_1b9e71c5:

    # vin "Si hemos terminado con la parte emotiva... ¿podemos cerrar esta reunión? Tengo que preparar tres informes..."
    vin "If we're done with the emotional part... can we wrap up this meeting? I have to prepare three reports..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3111
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4aab074c:

    # mc "Creo que no hay nada más de lo que hablar."
    mc "I don't think there's anything else to talk about."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3113
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_271e4c07:

    # "La gente se empieza a levantar."
    "People start getting up."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3114
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_0fc156a4:

    # "[bet] rodea la mesa despacio y se detiene junto al brazo electromecánico. Lo mira de cerca, sin tocarlo, como si estuviera leyendo algo escrito en él."
    "[bet] slowly walks around the table and stops next to the electromechanical arm. She looks at it closely, without touching it, as if she were reading something written on it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3115
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_19d2a449:

    # bet "¿Cuánto pesa? Parece más pesado que en las especificaciones que me mandasteis."
    bet "How much does it weigh? It looks heavier than in the specs you sent me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3117
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_6be20864:

    # cal "Este es el prototipo. Pesa un poco más que el que implantarás. Cuatro kilos cien gramos. Y no tiene las baterías."
    cal "This is the prototype. It weighs a little more than the one you'll implant. Four kilos, one hundred grams. And it doesn't have the batteries."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3118
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_87a6afc6:

    # cal "El que le pondrás a [gav], tres kilos ochocientos gramos al completo."
    cal "The one you'll put on [gav], three kilos, eight hundred grams in total."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3119
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_67a68b86:

    # "Suena como un padre orgulloso."
    "He sounds like a proud father."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3121
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_9a8b8a88:

    # bet "Menos de lo que esperaba."
    bet "Less than I expected."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3122
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_709652dc:

    # cal "Era un requisito de diseño. Si pesa demasiado, el hombro lo paga a largo plazo."
    cal "It was a design requirement. If it weighs too much, the shoulder pays for it in the long run."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3123
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_4328d08d:

    # bet "Pensaste en todo."
    bet "You thought of everything."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3124
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_2e29ef91:

    # cal "Tuve siete años para hacerlo."
    cal "I had seven years to do it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3126
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_5e264f03:

    # vin "*Murmurando para sí mismo* Daniels también creía que lo tenía todo pensado."
    vin "*Muttering to himself* Daniels also thought he had everything figured out."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3127
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_0f8ef23c:

    # "Prefieres no contestar y te diriges con [ama] a tu despacho para revisar los expedientes de los clones con los que te reunirás en poco más de una hora."
    "You prefer not to answer and head with [ama] to your office to review the files of the clones you'll be meeting with in a little over an hour."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3129
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_31652e76:

    # "Te detienes un momento frente a una ventana."
    "You stop for a moment in front of a window."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3130
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_017a6969:

    # "Fuera, el Caribe brilla a lo lejos con esa indiferencia perfecta que tiene el mar cuando no sabe que alguien está mirándolo."
    "Outside, the Caribbean shines in the distance with that perfect indifference the sea has when it doesn't know someone is watching it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3131
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_38152f55:

    # "Alguien que acaba de heredar una empresa ilegal y la intención, todavía sin forma precisa, de convertirla en algo distinto."
    "Someone who has just inherited an illegal enterprise and who has the intention, still without a precise shape, to turn it into something different."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3132
translate english c31s006_departmentMeeting_d4666650:

    # "Es un buen comienzo. O al menos, es un comienzo."
    "It's a good start. Or at least, it's a start."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2541
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_5d882aa2:

    # "Más tarde, de nuevo en la sala de reuniones y después de las presentaciones..."
    "Later, back in the meeting room and after the introductions..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2542
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_d9a84e78:

    # mc "Gracias a todos por venir con tan poca antelación. Sé que esto es nuevo para muchos de vosotros."
    mc "Thank you all for coming on such short notice. I know this is new for a lot of you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2543
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_36093761:

    # mc "Lo primero es presentarme. Soy [mc] Marks y actúo como el nuevo CEO. Esto es tan nuevo para mí como para vosotros."
    mc "First of all, let me introduce myself. I'm [mc] Marks and I'm acting as the new CEO. This is as new to me as it is to you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2544
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_92a548af:

    # mc "Mi intención es escucharos. Tenéis la palabra para plantear lo que necesitéis."
    mc "My intention is to listen to you. You have the floor to raise whatever you need."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2546
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_40b3e942:

    # aar "Apreciamos el gesto, [mc]. Los chicos llevan tiempo queriendo hablar con la dirección. Nunca antes se les había dado esta oportunidad."
    aar "We appreciate the gesture, [mc]. The guys have been wanting to talk to management for a while. They've never been given this opportunity before."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2548
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_0a0a0928:

    # ama "[mc] ha querido que esta reunión sea abierta y sin filtros. Podéis hablar con libertad."
    ama "[mc] wanted this meeting to be open and unfiltered. You can speak freely."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2549
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_f2431388:

    # ama "[mc] es... diferente de la anterior dirección."
    ama "[mc] is... different from the previous management."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2551
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_5920525f:

    # dam "¿En serio? ¿Podemos pedir lo que queramos?"
    dam "Seriously? We can ask for whatever we want?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2552
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_52e3172c:

    # dam "Porque yo tengo una lista bastante interesante..."
    dam "Because I have a pretty interesting list..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2554
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_267a1e65:

    # gav "[dam], por favor. Empecemos por lo importante. Consensuamos una serie de puntos ayer."
    gav "[dam], please. Let's start with what's important. We agreed on a series of points yesterday."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2556
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6545731e:

    # fred "[gav] tiene razón. Hay cosas urgentes sobre la mesa."
    fred "[gav] is right. There are urgent matters on the table."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2558
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_d22e1119:

    # carl "He preparado un resumen de las peticiones que acordamos en la reunión previa."
    carl "I've prepared a summary of the requests we agreed on in the previous meeting."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2559
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_b62c57a5:

    # carl "Si os parece, las voy repasando una a una."
    carl "If it's alright with you, I'll go over them one by one."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2560
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_bec1d115:

    # mc "Adelante, Carl."
    mc "Go ahead, Carl."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2562
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_98cff6b5:

    # carl "La primera petición es de índole personal. Los operativos quieren poder llevar barba, o cambiar su corte de pelo. El reglamento actual lo prohíbe."
    carl "The first request is of a personal nature. The operatives want to be able to grow beards, or change their haircuts. The current regulations prohibit it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2563
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_11aa53e4:

    # carl "[aar] es el único operativo que verás con barba en la base, y eso es porque se la dejó crecer mientras estaba... fuera de servicio."
    carl "[aar] is the only operative you'll see with a beard on base, and that's because he let it grow while he was... off duty."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2565
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_d3af2b5f:

    # dam "Llevo dos años queriendo dejarme la barba. ¡Dos años!"
    dam "I've been wanting to grow a beard for two years. Two years!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2567
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_1a59eca7:

    # gav "Es una cuestión de identidad. Para nosotros... significa más de lo que parece."
    gav "It's a matter of identity. For us... it means more than it seems."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2568
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a2603103:

    # mc "Entiendo. ¿Hay alguna razón operativa para mantener esa restricción, [ama]?"
    mc "I understand. Is there any operational reason to keep that restriction, [ama]?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2570
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_5fe2c92c:

    # ama "Ninguna que yo vea. En algunas misiones de infiltración puede ser relevante, pero eso se puede gestionar caso por caso."
    ama "None that I can see. In some infiltration missions it might be relevant, but that can be handled on a case-by-case basis."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2571
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_012f0ad6:

    # ama "Siempre y cuando no interfiera con el equipo... máscaras de gas, cascos, visores nocturnos... no veo ningún problema."
    ama "As long as it doesn't interfere with the equipment... gas masks, helmets, night vision goggles... I don't see a problem."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2572
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_70a1e99b:

    # mc "De acuerdo. A partir de ahora, cada operativo puede llevar el estilo personal que prefiera."
    mc "Alright. From now on, every operative can wear whatever personal style they prefer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2573
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e379e758:

    # mc "Si hay una misión que requiera un aspecto concreto, se os comunicará con antelación."
    mc "If there's a mission that requires a specific look, you'll be notified in advance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2575
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_350bba27:

    # gav "Gracias, [mc]. De verdad."
    gav "Thank you, [mc]. Really."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2576
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_dafd1765:

    # fred "Era lo mínimo, pero se agradece."
    fred "It was the bare minimum, but it's appreciated."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2577
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_b7ad0f36:

    # dam "¡Por fin! Voy a dejarme unas patillas épicas."
    dam "Finally! I'm going to grow some epic sideburns."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2578
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_c9821169:

    # aar "[dam]..."
    aar "[dam]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2580
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6e6be4ea:

    # dam "¿Qué? ¡Es legítimo!"
    dam "What? It's legit!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2582
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_5edb2419:

    # "Carl decide ignorar a su compañero y seguir con las peticiones."
    "Carl decides to ignore his partner and continue with the requests."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2583
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6445500f:

    # carl "La segunda petición es más delicada. Se trata de Eric."
    carl "The second request is more delicate. It's about Eric."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2584
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_443be3c6:

    # fred "Eric está retenido desde hace un mes, acusado de traición."
    fred "Eric has been detained for a month, accused of treason."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2585
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_290f8b0f:

    # dam "Nunca me cayó bien... Nadie de la E me caía bien, pero es injusto."
    dam "I never liked him... I didn't like anyone from E, but it's unfair."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2586
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_09fdf597:

    # aar "Actuó contra los propietarios de la empresa, sí. Pero hay contexto."
    aar "He acted against the owners of the company, yes. But there's context."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2587
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_19c6561a:

    # mc "Lo sé. Estuve revisando el expediente. Seguía órdenes de Daniels. Era su superior..."
    mc "I know. I was reviewing the file. He was following Daniels' orders. He was his superior..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2589
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_ff5c7a7f:

    # ama "Un superior que ahora también está bajo arresto, dicho sea de paso."
    ama "A superior who is now also under arrest, by the way."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2590
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6054290a:

    # ama "Un superior que ordenó los asesinatos de mis hermanas, de los A y de tu familia."
    ama "A superior who ordered the murders of my sisters, the A's, and your family."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2592
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_43ce085f:

    # gav "Nadie dice que Eric sea buena gente ni mucho menos. Pero estaba atrapado entre dos fuegos. No tenía elección real."
    gav "Nobody is saying Eric is a good guy, far from it. But he was caught in the crossfire. He didn't have a real choice."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2594
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_97c7d6f5:

    # fred "Nosotros tampoco la teníamos, en aquellos tiempos. Hacíamos lo que nos mandaban... O había consecuencias."
    fred "We didn't have one either, back in those days. We did what we were told... Or there were consequences."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2595
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_ef160ee3:

    # fred "Yo estuve en la otra operación en ese momento... Íbamos engañados y, si Eric debe estar arrestado, también lo deberíamos estar [gav] o yo."
    fred "I was in the other operation at that time... We were misled, and if Eric should be arrested, [gav] or I should be too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2596
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a4e84d83:

    # mc "Soy consciente de eso. La estructura anterior no dejaba margen para la desobediencia."
    mc "I'm aware of that. The previous structure left no room for disobedience."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2598
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_d1d190a1:

    # fred "Lo siento, [ama]..."
    fred "I'm sorry, [ama]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2599
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_f9671a0f:

    # "[ama] no se molesta en contestar. Beatrice y Diana murieron a manos del grupo al que pertenecía [fred]."
    "[ama] doesn't bother to answer. Beatrice and Diana died at the hands of the group [fred] belonged to."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2601
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a52d66e4:

    # dam "Eric no es un traidor. Es alguien que sobrevivió como pudo. Se mantuvo fiel a quién estaba al mando en ese momento."
    dam "Eric is not a traitor. He's someone who survived however he could. He remained loyal to whoever was in command at the time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2603
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a33e4933:

    # carl "La petición formal es su liberación inmediata y la retirada de los cargos."
    carl "The formal request is his immediate release and the dropping of the charges."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2604
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_7218061a:

    # mc "No voy a tomar esa decisión hoy a la ligera. Necesito revisar el caso completo."
    mc "I'm not going to make that decision lightly today. I need to review the whole case."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2605
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_587a9a90:

    # mc "Pero os doy mi palabra de que lo estudiaré personalmente. Eric tendrá una revisión justa."
    mc "But I give you my word that I will look into it personally. Eric will have a fair review."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2606
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_defcc6d3:

    # carl "Con eso nos conformamos. Por ahora, señor."
    carl "We'll settle for that. For now, sir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2607
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e32a1a09:

    # "Ese 'señor' al final de la frase suena casi a un desafío a que no cumplas tu palabra."
    "That 'sir' at the end of the sentence almost sounds like a challenge for you not to keep your word."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2609
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_bd556b53:

    # carl "Tercera petición: los operativos solicitan un régimen de permisos para salir de la base."
    carl "Third request: the operatives request a leave system to go off-base."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2610
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_bc448111:

    # carl "Actualmente no pueden abandonar el perímetro sin una misión activa."
    carl "Currently, they cannot leave the perimeter without an active mission."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2612
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_aa45883c:

    # fred "Llevamos años sin poder ir a un bar, a un cine, a ver a nadie."
    fred "We've gone years without being able to go to a bar, to the movies, to see anyone."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2613
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e0add868:

    # dam "Sin poder ligar, vamos a lo importante."
    dam "Without being able to get laid, let's get to the important stuff."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2614
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_30c6f52e:

    # gav "Sin poder respirar aire que no sea este."
    gav "Without being able to breathe any air other than this."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2615
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_dd5407b0:

    # aar "Es una de las restricciones más duras. Los mantiene aislados del mundo."
    aar "It's one of the harshest restrictions. It keeps them isolated from the world."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2616
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_c76ddba6:

    # mc "¿Eso es literal? ¿No podéis salir en ningún caso?"
    mc "Is that literal? You can't leave under any circumstances?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2618
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_2da319ae:

    # ama "Era la norma, sí. Control total de movimientos."
    ama "That was the rule, yes. Total movement control."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2619
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_36e05359:

    # mc "Eso es... inaceptable. No sois prisioneros."
    mc "That's... unacceptable. You aren't prisoners."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2621
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_17a3be4b:

    # fred "Durante años nos trataron como si lo fuéramos."
    fred "For years they treated us like we were."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2622
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_660a0965:

    # mc "Eso se acabó. Vamos a establecer un sistema de permisos inmediatamente."
    mc "That's over. We're going to establish a leave system immediately."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2623
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_653c9398:

    # mc "Salidas individuales con preaviso razonable. Nada de pedir permiso como si fuerais niños."
    mc "Individual outings with reasonable notice. No asking for permission like you're children."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2625
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_11db2a81:

    # gav "¿En serio?"
    gav "Seriously?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2626
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_5f6a2c7a:

    # mc "En serio. Ya no sois esclavos. Nunca debisteis serlo."
    mc "Seriously. You're no longer slaves. You never should have been."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2627
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_c9bdddee:

    # aar "Eso... significa mucho, [mc]. Más de lo que imaginas."
    aar "That... means a lot, [mc]. More than you can imagine."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2628
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6f54b9bc:

    # dam "¡Sí! ¡Libertad! ¡Primera parada: cualquier sitio que no sea aquí!"
    dam "Yeah! Freedom! First stop: anywhere but here!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2629
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_3df29d04:

    # fred "Gracias, [mc]."
    fred "Thank you, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2631
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_50973adb:

    # "Hay un silencio breve en la sala. Varios de los clones intercambian miradas."
    "There's a brief silence in the room. Several of the clones exchange glances."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2632
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_db0ff1e8:

    # "Aún no los conoces lo suficiente como para interpretar esas miradas, pero detectas un componente de esperanza."
    "You don't know them well enough yet to interpret those glances, but you detect a hint of hope."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2634
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_3a371344:

    # carl "La cuarta petición está relacionada con [gav]."
    carl "The fourth request is related to [gav]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2635
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_907ec0ae:

    # carl "Los operativos quieren que todos los que perdieron extremidades o sufrieron heridas graves reciban el mismo tratamiento que se ha aprobado para [gav]."
    carl "The operatives want everyone who lost limbs or suffered serious injuries to receive the same treatment that has been approved for [gav]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2636
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_66a8af5e:

    # carl "Dentro de lo posible y de la disponibilidad de prótesis y otros dispositivos, claro."
    carl "Within what's possible and the availability of prosthetics and other devices, of course."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2638
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_003f416c:

    # gav "No me parece justo que yo tenga esta oportunidad y los demás no. Hay varios chicos más con amputaciones. Y otros con daños permanentes."
    gav "It doesn't seem fair that I get this opportunity and the others don't. There are several other guys with amputations. And others with permanent damage."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2639
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_d8f8a3d1:

    # mc "¿Cuántos operativos están en esa situación?"
    mc "How many operatives are in that situation?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2641
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e55778cc:

    # aar "Con amputaciones, 19 contando a [gav]. [gav] es el más... reciente. Y el único para quien tenemos preparada una prótesis."
    aar "With amputations, 19 counting [gav]. [gav] is the most... recent. And the only one we have a prosthesis ready for."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2642
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_09d2579d:

    # aar "Se estaba trabajando en la que va a ser su prótesis antes del... incidente."
    aar "They were working on what's going to be his prosthesis before the... incident."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2643
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6e9ec8f2:

    # aar "Con secuelas permanentes graves, otros seis o siete."
    aar "With severe permanent injuries, another six or seven."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2644
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_d26e96d6:

    # aar "[carl] entraría en esta categoría por su ojo, por ejemplo, pero no tenemos ningún dispositivo que le pueda ayudar."
    aar "[carl] would fall into this category because of his eye, for example, but we don't have any device that can help him."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2646
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_3b3e3fd0:

    # ama "Las prótesis de alta gama no crecen en los árboles. Habría que estudiar el coste del desarrollo."
    ama "High-end prosthetics don't grow on trees. We'd have to look into the development costs."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2647
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_09d3f3e7:

    # ama "Ni siquiera sé lo que tenemos disponible, aparte del brazo de [gav]."
    ama "I don't even know what we have available, apart from [gav]'s arm."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2648
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_aa3483b3:

    # mc "Lo sé. Pero es lo correcto. No puedo mirar hacia otro lado."
    mc "I know. But it's the right thing to do. I can't look the other way."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2649
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_8ffdce37:

    # mc "No os prometo que sea inmediato, pero está en mi lista de prioridades reales."
    mc "I can't promise it'll be immediate, but it's on my list of real priorities."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2650
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_97f8a630:

    # mc "Hablaré con Caleb. Si pudo hacer el prototipo en su tiempo libre..."
    mc "I'll talk to Caleb. If he was able to make the prototype in his free time..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2652
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_b503035e:

    # fred "Con eso nos vale por ahora."
    fred "That's good enough for us for now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2653
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_4d7e5b76:

    # gav "Gracias, [mc]. Por todos ellos."
    gav "Thank you, [mc]. For all of them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2654
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_8be5769f:

    # dam "Oye, y si me ponen una prótesis de brazo aunque tenga los dos..."
    dam "Hey, what if they give me a prosthetic arm even though I have both of mine..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2655
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_732c07b7:

    # dam "¿Tendría tres brazos? Pregunto por curiosidad científica."
    dam "Would I have three arms? Asking for scientific curiosity."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2657
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_488b001f:

    # carl "[dam]..."
    carl "[dam]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2658
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_7c5120c7:

    # dam "Era broma. Mayormente."
    dam "Just kidding. Mostly."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2660
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6b0ae0e2:

    # carl "Quinta petición: Salario. Los operativos consideran que la compensación no refleja el riesgo ni la naturaleza de su trabajo."
    carl "Fifth request: Salary. The operatives feel that the compensation does not reflect the risk or the nature of their work."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2661
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_8f3e2338:

    # "En ese momento descubres qué hay raro cada vez que [carl] habla."
    "At that moment, you realize what's weird every time [carl] speaks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2662
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_7dec5d66:

    # "Nunca dice 'nosotros' o 'los clones'. Siempre habla de 'los operativos', como si quisiera distanciarse emocionalmente de las peticiones."
    "He never says 'we' or 'the clones'. He always talks about 'the operatives', as if he wants to distance himself emotionally from the requests."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2664
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_fd08ef19:

    # fred "Llevamos años sin ningún ingreso... Tan solo dos cosas: manutención y vivienda."
    fred "We've gone years without any income... Just two things: room and board."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2665
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_51009217:

    # fred "Has dicho que no somos esclavos. Pero eso se parece mucho a la esclavitud. Sin un sueldo, lo seguiremos siendo."
    fred "You said we aren't slaves. But that sounds a lot like slavery. Without a salary, we'll remain so."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2666
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_f3d381eb:

    # mc "Es una petición razonable. No voy a decir que no."
    mc "That's a reasonable request. I'm not going to say no."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2667
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_b0308632:

    # mc "Pero necesito sentarme a revisar los números antes de comprometer cifras concretas."
    mc "But I need to sit down and review the numbers before committing to concrete figures."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2669
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_96d356a7:

    # ama "Las finanzas de NTR no están en su mejor momento tras los últimos meses, [fred]."
    ama "NTR's finances aren't at their best after the last few months, [fred]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2670
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6e9d39d7:

    # mc "Aun así, esto tiene que cambiar. La empresa os lo debe."
    mc "Even so, this has to change. The company owes it to you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2672
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_1eb2cb12:

    # gav "Nadie espera que lo soluciones hoy, [mc]."
    gav "No one expects you to solve it today, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2673
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_8209b7f8:

    # dam "Yo sí, un poco."
    dam "I do, a little."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2674
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_1758e8bc:

    # fred "[dam]..."
    fred "[dam]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2675
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_dac900f8:

    # dam "Estoy de broma. Más o menos."
    dam "I'm kidding. Sort of."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2676
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_25abb483:

    # dam "Pero creo que un aumento del 40%% estaría bien."
    dam "But I think a 40%% raise would be good."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2678
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_885eaeec:

    # gav "Te das cuenta de que un 40%% de cero sigue siendo cero, ¿verdad?"
    gav "You realize that 40%% of zero is still zero, right?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2679
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_f5cd6f0f:

    # fred "¿No había otro D que pudiera venir a esta reunión?"
    fred "Wasn't there another D that could come to this meeting?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2680
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_2ebc5798:

    # carl "Los D... No hay mucho donde elegir..."
    carl "The Ds... There's not much to choose from..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2681
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6fae1d7d:

    # dam "¡Hey! Somos los mejores..."
    dam "Hey! We're the best..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2682
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_df3c1e0f:

    # aar "Sí, en decir gilipolleces."
    aar "Yeah, at talking bullshit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2683
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_44a5e86c:

    # mc "Tened paciencia. Pero sabed que lo tomo en serio."
    mc "Be patient. But know that I take it seriously."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2685
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_f017a5ef:

    # dam "Hablando de compensaciones... yo tenía otra petición que creo que no llegó al orden del día."
    dam "Speaking of compensation... I had another request that I don't think made it to the agenda."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2686
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_7798aff2:

    # dam "¿Qué hay de coches deportivos? Uno para cada operativo. Al menos para los que somos suficientemente mayores para conducir..."
    dam "What about sports cars? One for each operative. At least for those of us old enough to drive..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2688
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_90cb4332:

    # carl "[dam], eso ya lo discutimos en la reunión anterior. Lo descartamos en los primeros cinco minutos."
    carl "[dam], we already discussed that in the previous meeting. We ruled it out in the first five minutes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2690
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_55506672:

    # dam "Sí, pero parece que [mc] está abierto a cosas que creíamos que rechazaría. Igual él lo ve diferente."
    dam "Yeah, but it seems [mc] is open to things we thought he'd reject. Maybe he sees it differently."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2691
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a78db22b:

    # carl "Lo verá igual que nosotros. Es una petición absurda. Ya ha puesto la excusa de los fondos..."
    carl "He'll see it the same way we do. It's an absurd request. He's already used the excuse of funds..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2692
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_4d5c0c4f:

    # dam "¡Es una petición legítima de bienestar del empleado!"
    dam "It's a legitimate employee wellness request!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2693
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_bd3ad819:

    # carl "Un Ferrarini no es bienestar del empleado, [dam]."
    carl "A Ferrarini isn't employee wellness, [dam]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2694
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e4a1a67c:

    # dam "¿Y tú qué sabes? ¿Has probado a conducir un Ferrarini?"
    dam "And what do you know? Have you ever tried driving a Ferrarini?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2695
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_8f6962fb:

    # gav "[dam], por favor..."
    gav "[dam], please..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2696
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_9e391f69:

    # mc "Aprecio el entusiasmo, [dam]. Pero creo que podemos centrar el presupuesto en otras cosas."
    mc "I appreciate the enthusiasm, [dam]. But I think we can focus the budget on other things."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2698
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_d8f2cdcc:

    # ama "Cosas mucho más urgentes."
    ama "Much more urgent things."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2699
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_2f9869dc:

    # dam "Bien. Pero que conste en acta que lo intenté."
    dam "Fine. But let the record show that I tried."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2700
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_4ed99d1c:

    # aar "Consta, consta. No te preocupes. También voy a hacer constar que eres idiota."
    aar "Noted, noted. Don't worry. I'm also going to put on the record that you're an idiot."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2702
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_ff0bb406:

    # carl "Volviendo a los salarios. La petición incluye que el salario, si se aprueba, sea retroactivo. Varios años atrás."
    carl "Getting back to the salaries. The request includes that the salary, if approved, be retroactive. Going back several years."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2704
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_4cf65e13:

    # fred "Llevamos mucho tiempo trabajando sin cobrar lo que merecíamos. Es una deuda real. Y no solo económica."
    fred "We've been working for a long time without getting paid what we deserved. It's a real debt. And not just a financial one."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2705
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_c9697095:

    # fred "Que nos empecéis a pagar ahora no resolverá la injusticia histórica."
    fred "Starting to pay us now won't fix the historical injustice."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2706
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_45c8c975:

    # mc "Entiendo la lógica. Y tenéis razón. Moralmente y legalmente."
    mc "I understand the logic. And you're right. Morally and legally."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2707
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_351a5f1f:

    # mc "El problema es que ahora mismo no hay fondos suficientes para asumir esa cantidad."
    mc "The problem is that right now there aren't enough funds to cover that amount."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2709
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_ef2f9cea:

    # gav "¿De cuánto estamos hablando?"
    gav "How much are we talking about?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2710
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_888f293b:

    # ama "Con los años acumulados y el número de operativos, sería una cifra muy considerable."
    ama "With the accumulated years and the number of operatives, it would be a very substantial amount."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2711
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_76829767:

    # fred "Lo sabemos. Pero eso no hace que la deuda desaparezca."
    fred "We know. But that doesn't make the debt disappear."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2712
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_d8b6fce0:

    # dam "Claro que no. Trabajamos. Arriesgamos la vida. Merecemos que se nos reconozca."
    dam "Of course not. We work. We risk our lives. We deserve recognition."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2713
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_c142e264:

    # mc "Tenéis razón. Completamente. Pero si prometo algo que no puedo cumplir, os estaré fallando igual que la dirección anterior."
    mc "You're right. Completely. But if I promise something I can't deliver, I'll be failing you just like the previous management."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2714
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_0582f20e:

    # mc "Necesito estudiar cómo compensaros de otra forma."
    mc "I need to look into how to compensate you in another way."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2716
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_eb822c4e:

    # fred "¿De qué forma?"
    fred "In what way?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2717
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_34d2d78e:

    # mc "Aún no lo sé. Pero lo buscaré. Os lo prometo."
    mc "I don't know yet. But I'll figure it out. I promise you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2719
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_61d93fdf:

    # carl "Con todo el respeto, [mc], hemos escuchado promesas antes."
    carl "With all due respect, [mc], we've heard promises before."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2720
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_40646422:

    # mc "Lo sé, [carl]. Y entiendo que esas promesas ya no valen mucho para vosotros."
    mc "I know, [carl]. And I understand that those promises don't mean much to you anymore."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2721
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_f351a33a:

    # mc "Solo puedo pediros tiempo y demostrarlo con hechos."
    mc "I can only ask for time and prove it with actions."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2723
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_75deed05:

    # gav "Escuchadme un momento. Llevamos media hora en esta reunión."
    gav "Listen to me for a moment. We've been in this meeting for half an hour."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2724
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a4b4835f:

    # gav "Estamos hablando de las promesas que se nos hicieron y no se cumplieron. Y la mejor de esas promesas fue mejorar el rancho."
    gav "We're talking about the promises that were made to us and weren't kept. And the best of those promises was improving the ranch."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2726
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_270d8286:

    # gav "[mc] ha dicho que sí a la barba y a los permisos. Se ha comprometido a estudiar lo de Eric, a las prótesis y a los salarios."
    gav "[mc] said yes to the beards and the time off. He promised to look into Eric's situation, the prosthetics, and the wages."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2727
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_5e468e30:

    # gav "Daniels no nos dejaba ni entrar a esta sala. Y Richards, antes de él, no era mucho mejor en esto."
    gav "Daniels wouldn't even let us in this room. And Richards, before him, wasn't much better at this."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2728
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_8247a637:

    # gav "Démosle el beneficio de la duda. Al menos durante un tiempo..."
    gav "Let's give him the benefit of the doubt. At least for a while..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2730
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_3af2bc72:

    # fred "Es verdad. Tienes razón."
    fred "It's true. You're right."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2731
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_7cf0ccd8:

    # dam "Tú vas a tener un brazo nuevo y te ha prometido llevarte con él a los Estados Unidos. Es normal que le apoyes..."
    dam "You're getting a new arm and he promised to take you with him to the States. It's normal for you to support him..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2732
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_3698fcc9:

    # carl "No creo que el apoyo de [gav] tenga nada que ver con eso."
    carl "I don't think [gav]'s support has anything to do with that."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2734
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_1db3544a:

    # gav "No tiene nada que ver con eso, [dam]. Te lo prometo. Yo estaba allí cuando... lo de Eric. Daniels nunca hubiera actuado como actuó [mc]."
    gav "It has nothing to do with that, [dam]. I promise you. I was there when... the Eric thing happened. Daniels would never have acted the way [mc] did."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2735
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6f6ba7bf:

    # gav "Seguramente hubiera ordenado a [ama] y a [eva] que nos ejecutaran a todos."
    gav "He probably would have ordered [ama] and [eva] to execute us all."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2736
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e1f6efbe:

    # mcp "(En aquella época ni siquiera sabía cómo se llamaban. No se me hubiera ocurrido ordenarles algo.)"
    mcp "(At that time I didn't even know their names. It wouldn't have occurred to me to order them to do anything.)"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2737
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_68908b9b:

    # mcp "(Y que os mataran no estaría entre las órdenes que les hubiera dado, si hubiera podido darles alguna.)"
    mcp "(And having you killed wouldn't be among the orders I would have given them, if I could have given them any.)"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2738
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_cf677da0:

    # gav "No digo que nos conformemos con migajas. Pero hay que reconocer la diferencia."
    gav "I'm not saying we should settle for crumbs. But we have to recognize the difference."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2739
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_d2466246:

    # gav "[mc] está escuchando. Eso ya es algo que ninguno de nosotros esperaba hace un mes... O hace una hora."
    gav "[mc] is listening. That's already something none of us expected a month ago... Or an hour ago."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2741
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_64dd59a0:

    # dam "[gav] tiene razón. Y yo, que soy el más quejica, lo reconozco."
    dam "[gav] is right. And I, being the biggest complainer, admit it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2742
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e3efb808:

    # aar "El chico tiene cabeza. Me refiero a [gav], no a [dam]..."
    aar "The kid's got a good head on his shoulders. I mean [gav], not [dam]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2743
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_38f4ac6a:

    # mc "Gracias, [gav]. Eso... significa mucho."
    mc "Thanks, [gav]. That... means a lot."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2744
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_4ebd9be0:

    # ama "Y no son solo promesas vacías. [mc] lleva días trabajando en esto desde que asumió el cargo."
    ama "And they aren't just empty promises. [mc] has been working on this for days since he took over."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2745
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_8d81aa3d:

    # ama "[aar] y yo le hemos inundado con información. Pensad que para él tampoco debe ser fácil."
    ama "[aar] and I have flooded him with information. Think about it, it can't be easy for him either."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2747
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_0ee149c1:

    # carl "Creo que estamos exigiendo a [mc] que asuma los errores de la anterior dirección. Es su primer día aquí y de momento nos está escuchando."
    carl "I think we're demanding that [mc] take responsibility for the mistakes of the previous management. It's his first day here and so far he's listening to us."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2748
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_708f9b21:

    # carl "No digo que renunciemos a nuestras peticiones, pero creo que deberíamos darle el beneficio de la duda."
    carl "I'm not saying we should give up on our demands, but I think we should give him the benefit of the doubt."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2749
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a4ba8285:

    # "Sorprendentemente, todos asienten. Te das cuenta de que [carl] te empieza a caer bien. Y crees que tú empiezas a caerle bien a él."
    "Surprisingly, everyone nods. You realize you're starting to like [carl]. And you think he's starting to like you too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2751
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e1766345:

    # carl "Continuemos, pues. La siguiente petición es la más importante para muchos de nosotros."
    carl "Let's continue, then. The next request is the most important one for many of us."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2752
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_260fe742:

    # carl "Los operativos quieren poder elegir su futuro. Su posición dentro de NTR. Y, a largo plazo, poder rescindir sus contratos si así lo deciden."
    carl "The operatives want to be able to choose their future. Their position within NTR. And, in the long term, to be able to terminate their contracts if they so decide."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2754
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_cbc49dee:

    # "La sala queda en silencio unos segundos. Es la petición que más les ilusiona de todas las que han hecho. Puedes leerlo en sus caras."
    "The room falls silent for a few seconds. It's the request they're most excited about of all the ones they've made. You can read it on their faces."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2755
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_3a9dd54b:

    # aar "Esta es la que más nos importa. A todos."
    aar "This is the one that matters most to us. To all of us."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2756
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_534c6c70:

    # fred "No queremos ser propiedad de nadie. Ya fuimos propiedad de la empresa una vez, y [aar] nos ha dicho que no se va a repetir."
    fred "We don't want to be anyone's property. We were already the company's property once, and [aar] told us that it's not going to happen again."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2757
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_50d8828a:

    # mc "Lo sé."
    mc "I know."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2758
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_985d148b:

    # dam "Queremos poder decir 'me quiero ir' y que sea una opción real. No una sentencia."
    dam "We want to be able to say 'I want to leave' and have it be a real option. Not a sentence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2759
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_afd3c51c:

    # gav "O quedarnos. Pero que sea nuestra elección."
    gav "Or stay. But let it be our choice."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2760
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_45aef16d:

    # mc "Os escucho. Y os entiendo."
    mc "I hear you. And I understand you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2761
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_42d9f9ce:

    # mc "Cambiar de posición dentro de la empresa: eso lo podemos empezar a estructurar en breve."
    mc "Changing positions within the company: we can start structuring that shortly."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2762
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_417a1c7d:

    # mc "Que cada uno pueda postularse para roles distintos, formarse, crecer. Eso sí. Siempre y cuando la persona sea válida para ese rol."
    mc "That everyone can apply for different roles, train, grow. Of course. As long as the person is qualified for that role."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2764
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_f83340c0:

    # "Ninguno puede ocultar su sonrisa... O su sorpresa."
    "None of them can hide their smile... Or their surprise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2765
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_bfe72352:

    # ama "Tendremos que crear un sistema de promoción interno, pero es viable."
    ama "We'll have to create an internal promotion system, but it's viable."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2766
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_b4efce6e:

    # mc "En cuanto a rescindir contratos... eso es más complejo."
    mc "As for terminating contracts... that's more complex."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2767
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_04621e4a:

    # mc "No porque no quiera permitíroslo., sino porque hay implicaciones legales, de seguridad, de vuestro propio origen."
    mc "Not because I don't want to allow it, but because there are legal and security implications regarding your own origins."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2768
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_c60be5bb:

    # mc "Sois personas. Merecéis elegir. Pero tengo que asegurarme de que esa salida os proteja."
    mc "You are people. You deserve to choose. But I have to make sure that leaving protects you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2769
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_aa2b0b0e:

    # mc "No quiero sonar paternalista, pero tampoco quiero que os vayáis y que el mundo de fuera os trate peor de lo que os trató este sitio."
    mc "I don't want to sound patronizing, but I also don't want you to leave and have the outside world treat you worse than this place did."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2771
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_f1fcd014:

    # fred "¿Eso es un 'no'?"
    fred "Is that a 'no'?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2772
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a81552cd:

    # mc "Es un 'trabajaremos juntos en ello para que sea un sí a su debido tiempo. En breve'."
    mc "It's a 'we'll work together on it, so it's a yes in due time. Soon'."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2773
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_26733e06:

    # aar "No creo que podamos esperar una respuesta más positiva sobre este tema."
    aar "I don't think we can expect a more positive answer on this matter."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2774
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_15a2dd8e:

    # gav "Yo me quedo. Que conste. Pero quiero saber que podría irme si quisiera."
    gav "I'm staying. For the record. But I want to know that I could leave if I wanted to."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2775
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_265ba84f:

    # mc "Eso es exactamente lo que vamos a garantizar. No hoy, pero lo haremos."
    mc "That's exactly what we're going to guarantee. Not today, but we will."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2776
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_7c3256b6:

    # mc "Y quiero trabajar con vosotros para que nadie quiera rescindir ese contrato."
    mc "And I want to work with you so that no one wants to terminate that contract."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2778
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_cb1f10de:

    # "[carl] tiene una sonrisa en la cara cuando empieza a hablar. Cada vez estás más convencido de que le gusta lo que está oyendo en esta reunión."
    "[carl] has a smile on his face as he begins to speak. You're becoming more and more convinced that he likes what he's hearing in this meeting."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2779
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_9b6d484d:

    # carl "Última petición de la lista oficial. Solicitamos documentación con identidades alternativas."
    carl "Last request on the official list. We're requesting documentation with alternative identities."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2780
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_2a81a620:

    # carl "Pasaportes y otra documentación con nombres reales para poder movernos por el mundo con cierta normalidad."
    carl "Passports and other documentation with real names so we can move around the world with some degree of normalcy."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2781
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_2c7ff0f4:

    # mc "Eso es... ilegal. Y no sabría por dónde empezar. Es terreno complicado..."
    mc "That's... illegal. And I wouldn't even know where to start. It's complicated territory..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2783
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_87443324:

    # fred "Somos clones ilegales de personas vivas, [mc]. Ya estamos en terreno complicado."
    fred "We're illegal clones of living people, [mc]. We're already in complicated territory."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2784
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6cb0ef94:

    # aar "No tenemos identidades reconocidas. No existimos para el mundo oficial."
    aar "We don't have recognized identities. We don't exist to the official world."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2785
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_b6aa904a:

    # gav "No podemos coger un vuelo comercial. No podemos abrir una cuenta bancaria. No podemos existir fuera de estas paredes sin ser fantasmas."
    gav "We can't take a commercial flight. We can't open a bank account. We can't exist outside these walls without being ghosts."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2786
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_70bd8a87:

    # dam "O criminales. Aunque no hayamos hecho nada."
    dam "Or criminals. Even if we haven't done anything."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2789
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_fac812b0:

    # ama "Tienen razón, [mc]. Nuestra situación legal es... peculiar."
    ama "They're right, [mc]. Our legal situation is... peculiar."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2791
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_5aa4184e:

    # ama "Tienen razón, [mc]. Su situación legal es... peculiar."
    ama "They're right, [mc]. Their legal situation is... peculiar."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2792
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_964a076b:

    # ama "Sin esa documentación, la promesa de poder abandonar la empresa sería una promesa vacía."
    ama "Without that documentation, the promise of being able to leave the company would be an empty promise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2793
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e07341a8:

    # mc "Lo sé. Y es un problema real que necesita una solución real."
    mc "I know. And it's a real problem that needs a real solution."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2794
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_c41e143f:

    # mc "Documentación alternativa no es algo que pueda aprobar ahora mismo. Hay un coste logístico importante. Y hay riesgos legales para NTR."
    mc "Alternative documentation isn't something I can approve right now. There's a significant logistical cost. And there are legal risks for NTR."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2796
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_fbbc292e:

    # fred "¿Más riesgos que los que corremos nosotros cada día en el campo?"
    fred "More risks than the ones we take every day in the field?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2797
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e0b8fd70:

    # mc "No. Tienes razón, [fred]."
    mc "No. You're right, [fred]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2798
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_1ac0ae7d:

    # mc "Voy a estudiar cuánto costaría y cómo hacerlo de la forma más segura posible."
    mc "I'm going to look into how much it would cost and how to do it as safely as possible."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2799
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a7f7fa71:

    # mc "Para vosotros y para la empresa. No os digo que no. Os digo que necesito pensar."
    mc "For you guys and for the company. I'm not saying no. I'm saying I need to think about it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2800
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_1a935044:

    # mc "Supongo que alguno de los gobiernos con los que hemos trabajado podría ayudar, pero..."
    mc "I guess one of the governments we've worked with could help, but..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2802
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_bc4cee13:

    # aar "Es más de lo que esperábamos."
    aar "It's more than we expected."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2803
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_92be3381:

    # gav "Con eso me vale."
    gav "That works for me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2804
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_896fb231:

    # dam "Yo quiero un nombre guay. Algo como... Dan Steel. Dan está muerto. Me puedo quedar con su nombre."
    dam "I want a cool name. Something like... Dan Steel. Dan is dead. I can take his name."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2806
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_d1d35694:

    # carl "[dam], por el amor de..."
    carl "[dam], for the love of..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2807
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_687be014:

    # dam "¡Es para el pasaporte! ¡Hay que pensarlo con tiempo!"
    dam "It's for the passport! We have to think about it ahead of time!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2808
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_c3c3efcd:

    # fred "A veces me pregunto cómo ha sobrevivido tantas misiones."
    fred "Sometimes I wonder how he's survived so many missions."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2809
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_ba4c8276:

    # dam "Carisma. Puro y simple."
    dam "Charisma. Pure and simple."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2811
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_60ee7b62:

    # "La tensión inicial se ha disipado. La sala tiene ahora un ambiente más cálido. Como si confiaran en ti."
    "The initial tension has dissipated. The room now has a warmer atmosphere. As if they trust you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2812
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_132a95ae:

    # "No por lo que les ha contado [aar] en los últimos días, sino por lo que han escuchado salir de tu boca."
    "Not because of what [aar] has told them over the last few days, but because of what they've heard come out of your mouth."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2813
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_2b614ac8:

    # "Miras a cada uno de los presentes antes de hablar."
    "You look at everyone present before speaking."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2814
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_0087789a:

    # mc "Bien. Creo que, si no tenéis más peticiones, hemos cubierto todo lo que había sobre la mesa."
    mc "Alright. I think, if you have no further requests, we've covered everything on the table."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2815
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_17b74da1:

    # mc "Quiero que sepáis que esta no es la última reunión. Es la primera."
    mc "I want you to know that this isn't the last meeting. It's the first."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2816
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6331ccac:

    # ama "[mc] tiene pensado establecer un canal directo para que podáis trasladar nuevas peticiones."
    ama "[mc] plans to establish a direct channel so you can submit new requests."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2817
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_3a850659:

    # aar "Eso... nunca había existido antes."
    aar "That... has never existed before."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2818
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_b3fbfa36:

    # mc "Pues existe ahora. Y quiero que lo uséis."
    mc "Well, it exists now. And I want you to use it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2819
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_d78b839c:

    # fred "¿Cuándo es la próxima reunión?"
    fred "When is the next meeting?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2820
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_3422f581:

    # mc "En unas semanas. Necesito tiempo para avanzar en los temas pendientes."
    mc "In a few weeks. I need time to make progress on the pending issues."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2821
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_efafc640:

    # mc "No quiero convocaros hasta tener algo concreto que ofreceros. Avances en lo que habéis pedido hoy."
    mc "I don't want to call a meeting until I have something concrete to offer you. Progress on what you asked for today."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2822
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a359479c:

    # gav "Nos parece bien."
    gav "Sounds good to us."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2823
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_7fb9b9c6:

    # carl "Tomaré nota de los acuerdos alcanzados y los pendientes de resolución."
    carl "I'll take note of the agreements reached and the issues pending resolution."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2824
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_8e87bc32:

    # dam "Y yo tomaré nota de los nombres guais por si hay pasaportes."
    dam "And I'll take note of the cool names in case there are passports."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2826
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_c9821169_1:

    # aar "[dam]..."
    aar "[dam]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2827
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e81182d9:

    # dam "*Risa* ¡Lo hago por el equipo!"
    dam "*Laugh* I'm doing it for the team!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2828
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e5663045:

    # "Algunos no pueden ocultar sus sonrisas bajo los aspavientos que produce la última tontería de [dam]."
    "Some can't hide their smiles beneath the fuss caused by [dam]'s latest nonsense."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2829
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_32202f04:

    # "Crees que es la primera vez que esa sala escucha las risas de clones."
    "You think it's the first time that room has heard clones laughing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2830
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e660ffee:

    # mc "Una cosa más antes de que os vayáis."
    mc "One more thing before you leave."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2832
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a51d42fd:

    # "Te pones de pie. Todos te miran por un momento antes de que empieces a hablar. Sabes que tienes su atención."
    "You stand up. Everyone looks at you for a moment before you start speaking. You know you have their attention."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2833
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_9dcc6b4d:

    # mc "Sé lo que habéis vivido aquí. Lo que os hicieron. Lo que os negaron. Nunca podré entender del todo por lo que pasasteis."
    mc "I know what you've been through here. What they did to you. What they denied you. Though I'll never fully understand what you went through."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2834
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_e4d2717b:

    # mc "Pero no puedo cambiar el pasado. Lo único que puedo hacer es asegurarme de que el futuro sea diferente."
    mc "But I can't change the past. All I can do is make sure the future is different."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2835
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_0a023c18:

    # mc "No como favor. Como obligación. Esta empresa os lo debe. Yo os lo debo."
    mc "Not as a favor. As an obligation. This company owes it to you. I owe it to you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2837
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_2c06cb3d:

    # "Nadie habla por un momento, mientras vuelves a sentarte. Se miran entre ellos antes de reaccionar."
    "No one speaks for a moment as you sit back down. They look at each other before reacting."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2838
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_c6f6798b:

    # "Pese a todo lo que se ha dicho en la reunión, aún hay sorpresa en sus voces cuando empiezan a hablar."
    "Despite everything that's been said in the meeting, there's still surprise in their voices when they start speaking."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2839
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_c07c1cd5:

    # fred "Es la primera vez que alguien en ese cargo dice algo así."
    fred "It's the first time someone in that position has said something like that."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2840
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_68bc852a:

    # carl "O que alguien en ese cargo se digna a escucharnos."
    carl "Or that someone in that position even bothers to listen to us."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2841
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_bf1248f6:

    # gav "Y lo dice en serio. Eso se nota."
    gav "And he means it. You can tell."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2842
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_9c08ca87:

    # aar "Gracias, [mc]. De parte de todos. También de los que no están aquí."
    aar "Thank you, [mc]. On behalf of everyone. Including those who aren't here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2843
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_6a1067c2:

    # ama "Nos vemos en unas semanas, entonces."
    ama "See you in a few weeks, then."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2845
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_51527a49:

    # carl "Creo que esta reunión ha terminado. Deberíamos dejar a [mc], [ama] y [aar] para que discutan lo que hemos hablado aquí."
    carl "I think this meeting is over. We should leave [mc], [ama], and [aar] to discuss what we've talked about here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2847
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_45cd0cb2:

    # aar "Voy a empezar a preparar toda lo documentación necesaria para que tomes las decisiones teniendo toda la información."
    aar "I'm going to start preparing all the necessary documentation so you can make decisions having all the information."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2848
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_1f861dbf:

    # mc "Toda la información {b}relevante{/b}, [aar]. No necesito saber cuánta espuma de afeitar vamos a ahorrar porque ahora se puedan dejar barba."
    mc "All the {b}relevant{/b} information, [aar]. I don't need to know how much shaving cream we're going to save because they can grow a beard now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2850
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_7e991351:

    # aar "*Risa* ¿Soy demasiado minucioso en mis informes?"
    aar "*Laugh* Am I too thorough in my reports?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2851
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_ebaf1abf:

    # mc "*Risa* Yo no diría eso. No sé qué palabra se podría usar para 'tres grados de magnitud por encima de demasiado minucioso'."
    mc "*Laugh* I wouldn't say that. I don't know what word could be used for 'three orders of magnitude above too thorough'."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2852
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_69379918:

    # aar "*Risa* Vale. Nada de espuma de afeitar ni de tiempos que ahorraremos en la peluquería."
    aar "*Laugh* Okay. No shaving cream or time we'll save at the barbershop."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2854
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_2714547c:

    # "La reunión se disuelve lentamente. Los clones salen hablando entre ellos."
    "The meeting slowly dissolves. The clones leave talking among themselves."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2855
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_cd518edd:

    # "Por primera vez, hay algo parecido a la esperanza en el cuartel general de NTR. Al menos entre los clones."
    "For the first time, there's something resembling hope at NTR headquarters. At least among the clones."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2856
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_7e82245b:

    # dam "Yo ya estoy pensando en mis patillas. Quizás sean mejor que una barba..."
    dam "I'm already thinking about my sideburns. Maybe they're better than a beard..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2857
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_a7101ebe:

    # gav "[dam], para ya."
    gav "[dam], stop it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2858
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_24012bf9:

    # dam "¡Son un símbolo de libertad!"
    dam "They're a symbol of freedom!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2860
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_b391b72f:

    # mc "[ama]..."
    mc "[ama]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2861
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_45b012e8:

    # ama "¿Sí?"
    ama "Yes?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2862
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_3bd14d0a:

    # mc "¿Crees que lo haremos bien?"
    mc "Do you think we'll do well?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2864
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_ae2832b2:

    # ama "Creo que ya lo estás haciendo bien."
    ama "I think you're already doing well."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2865
translate english c31s006_cloneMeeting_28818800:

    # "Asientes, pensativo. Hay mucho trabajo por delante. Pero hoy, al menos, alguien escuchó a las personas que más han sufrido en NTR."
    "You nod, thoughtful. There's a lot of work ahead. But today, at least, someone listened to the people who have suffered the most at NTR."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4233
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_5bc3d28a:

    # "El resto del día pasa volando."
    "The rest of the day flies by."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4234
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_31873a0c:

    # "Si la sala de reuniones era opresiva, tu despacho no es mucho mejor. Parece sacado de una película de los 70."
    "If the meeting room was oppressive, your office isn't much better. It looks like it's straight out of a 70s movie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4235
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_ceae195a:

    # "[car] te da el Manual del Empleado. Es un libro enorme con un montón de conceptos obsoletos."
    "[car] gives you the Employee Handbook. It's a huge book with a bunch of outdated concepts."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4236
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_7ae54631:

    # "No hay ni una sola mención a los clones en él. Está pensado para el personal de los departamentos que no se dedican a las operaciones."
    "There isn't a single mention of clones in it. It's meant for staff in non-operations departments."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4237
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_bbb50372:

    # "Lo dejas en un lugar prominente de tu escritorio. Otra cosa para tu lista de tareas pendientes."
    "You leave it in a prominent place on your desk. Another thing for your to-do list."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4239
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_4bce495a:

    # "Tienes una reunión con el jefe del departamento de informática, [geo]."
    "You have a meeting with the head of the IT department, [geo]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4240
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_81a7ccbb:

    # "Parece un buen tipo, aunque tiene un sentido del humor un poco raro, especialmente en cuanto a elección de vestuario."
    "He seems like a good guy, although he has a bit of a weird sense of humor, especially regarding his wardrobe choices."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4241
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_84a9636e:

    # "La aplicación de gestión de la empresa parece bastante operativa, aunque ves posibles áreas de mejora."
    "The company's management application seems quite operational, although you see possible areas for improvement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4242
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_b3e74f2e:

    # "Crees que, más adelante, pondrás a [geo] en contacto con Jamaal."
    "You think that, later on, you'll put [geo] in touch with Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4243
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_d187b752:

    # "Si tu informático favorito fue capaz de hackear la base de datos de NTR, se debería incrementar la seguridad."
    "If your favorite IT guy was able to hack NTR's database, tech security should be increased."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4244
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_1a02dcb5:

    # "Deja una carpeta con el manual de los sistemas informáticos encima de tu mesa. También te manda la versión electrónica por email."
    "He leaves a folder with the IT systems manual on your desk. He also sends you the electronic version by email."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4247
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_f5af9d6f:

    # "Recibes tres visitas de [vin] a lo largo del día."
    "You receive three visits from [vin] throughout the day."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4248
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_285df287:

    # "Quiere detalles minuciosos de los informes que le has pedido."
    "He wants meticulous details about the reports you requested."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4249
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_015e3769:

    # "La única pregunta de interés para ti es si quieres los informes sobre la 'Contabilidad Real' o sobre la 'Contabilidad Creativa'."
    "The only question of interest to you is whether you want the reports on 'Real Accounting' or 'Creative Accounting'."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4250
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_4cb0d9d4:

    # "Crees que vas a odiar a [vin] y sus diminutas manos."
    "You think you're going to hate [vin] and his tiny hands."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4251
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_5c08256c:

    # "Después de su última visita, no sabes cuántos cafés te ha traído [car]."
    "After his last visit, you've lost track of how many coffees [car] has brought you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4254
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_b95aee08:

    # "Al final de la tarde, [aar] se presenta en tu despacho. No has salido de él desde la hora de comer."
    "Late in the afternoon, [aar] shows up at your office. You haven't left it since lunchtime."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4255
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_fb3be0c9:

    # mc "¿Puedo ayudarte en algo, [aar]?"
    mc "Can I help you with anything, [aar]?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4256
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_6729bbf0:

    # aar "Venía a hablar de Daniels."
    aar "I came to talk about Daniels."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4257
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_1afe9f90:

    # mc "Dime."
    mc "Tell me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4261
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_e230c02e:

    # aar "Dijiste que querías formar parte de la decisión que se tomara."
    aar "You said you wanted to be part of whatever decision was made."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4263
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_e6eb5187:

    # aar "Sé que dijiste que dejabas la decisión que se tomara en nuestras manos."
    aar "I know you said you were leaving whatever decision was made in our hands."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4264
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_30809b45:

    # mc "¿Es necesario hacer esto en mi primer día aquí, [aar]? Aún me estoy poniendo al día con mil cosas..."
    mc "Is it necessary to do this on my first day here, [aar]? I'm still catching up on a thousand things..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4266
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_9fb22617:

    # aar "Creo que será mejor actuar lo antes posible... No he conseguido saber si aún tiene partidarios en la empresa y..."
    aar "I think it'll be better to act as soon as possible... I haven't been able to find out if he still has supporters in the company and..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4267
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_9632c43c:

    # mc "Y yo pienso que no podemos hacer nada hasta que [eva] esté aquí."
    mc "And I think we can't do anything until [eva] is here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4268
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_f8fd0e7f:

    # mc "No es algo que se pueda hacer por videoconferencia con alguien como ella."
    mc "It's not something that can be done over a video call with someone like her."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4270
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_adbfb54e:

    # aar "¿Qué quieres decir con 'alguien como ella'?"
    aar "What do you mean by 'someone like her'?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4271
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_7f8f069c:

    # mc "[eva] es impulsiva y emocional. Va a querer estar aquí cuando se tome la decisión."
    mc "[eva] is impulsive and emotional. She's going to want to be here when the decision is made."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4273
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_a1af67e0:

    # aar "¡Uff! Por un momento me habías asustado."
    aar "Phew! You scared me for a second."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4274
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_322d2ec8:

    # aar "Empezaba a pensar que habíais cambiado a [eva] tanto como a [ama]."
    aar "I was starting to think you guys had changed [eva] as much as [ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4275
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_1bfaba52:

    # mc "Quizás un poco más que a ella."
    mc "Maybe a bit more than her."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4276
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_3dc0f085:

    # mc "¿La has notado muy cambiada?"
    mc "Have you noticed she's changed a lot?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4278
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_267ff005:

    # aar "Lo de ayer en el hangar... Fue una sorpresa."
    aar "Yesterday in the hangar... That was a surprise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4279
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_b74dda34:

    # aar "Pero hoy he tenido una reunión larguísima con ella y... Es diferente."
    aar "But today I had a really long meeting with her and... She's different."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4280
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_615fa532:

    # mc "¿En qué lo has notado?"
    mc "What did you notice?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4282
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_4cd641e2:

    # aar "Es más... asertiva. Más segura de sí misma."
    aar "She's more... assertive. More self-confident."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4283
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_445aac14:

    # aar "Antes de dejarla con tu familia hubiera aceptado mis órdenes sin rechistar. Ahora..."
    aar "Before leaving her with your family, she would have accepted my orders without question. But now..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4284
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_351a34ca:

    # "No vas a corregirle para decirle que ahora también es la familia de [ama]."
    "You're not going to correct him to say that it's also [ama]'s family now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4285
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_2b486b52:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Has intentado darle órdenes? Eres valiente."
    mc "*Laugh* Did you try to give her orders? You're even more brave than you look."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4286
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_fc7f2958:

    # mc "Ya no está bajo tu mando. Tú eres el jefe del Departamento de Operaciones. Ella es la jefa de Seguridad."
    mc "She's no longer under your command. You're the head of the Operations Department. She's the head of Security."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4288
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_faefc4a8:

    # aar "Lo sé, lo sé. Pero esperaba... No sé... Supongo que son viejas costumbres."
    aar "I know, I know. But I expected... I don't know... I guess it's old habits."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4289
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_e0a2d44b:

    # mc "Todo el mundo cambia, [aar]. Algunos más rápidos que otros."
    mc "Everyone changes, [aar]. Some faster than others."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4290
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_935b12ed:

    # mc "Y volviendo al tema de Daniels... ¿Dónde está ahora mismo?"
    mc "And getting back to Daniels... Where is he right now?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4292
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_224198b2:

    # aar "En una celda, aislado. Vigilado por dos operativos en todo momento."
    aar "In a cell, isolated. Guarded by two operatives at all times."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4293
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_7cea5e69:

    # mc "¿Son de fiar?"
    mc "Are they trustworthy?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4294
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_1f31b4f0:

    # aar "Hacen turnos de 8 horas, con lo que son seis operativos implicados en su vigilancia."
    aar "They do 8-hour shifts, which means there are six operatives involved in his surveillance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4295
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_7d163951:

    # aar "Creo que sí, que son de fiar. Pero..."
    aar "I think so, they are trustworthy. But..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4296
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_ad3deade:

    # mc "Tenemos que confiar en nuestros propios hombres, [aar]."
    mc "We have to trust our own men, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4297
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_68b5d643:

    # mc "Si crees que podemos confiar en ellos, podemos aplazar la decisión hasta que [eva] llegue."
    mc "If you think we can trust them, we can postpone the decision until [eva] arrives."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4299
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_4b956114:

    # aar "Me sorprendes... Los... 'normales' no soléis confiar tanto en los clones."
    aar "You surprise me... You... 'normals'... don't usually trust clones this much."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4301
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_040859a5:

    # mc "He vivido con [ama] y [eva] durante tres semanas."
    mc "I've lived with [ama] and [eva] for three weeks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4303
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_e0030a5d:

    # mc "He vivido con [eri], [emm] y [dap] toda mi vida."
    mc "I've lived with [eri], [emm], and [dap] my whole life."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4304
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_3feae8d5:

    # mc "Les confiaría mi vida sin dudarlo. Me da lo mismo si son clones o... 'normales'."
    mc "I'd trust them with my life without hesitation. I don't care if they're clones or... 'normals'."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4305
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_20211331:

    # mc "Creo que voy a odiar esa palabra."
    mc "I think I'm going to hate that word."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4306
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_2aebb2ac:

    # mc "Son igual de personas que yo o que [mael]. Se confía en las personas por cómo son. No por cómo nacieron."
    mc "They're just as human as me or [mael]. You trust people for who they are. Not for how they were born."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4308
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_56db95f1:

    # aar "Lo vuelvo a repetir. Me sorprendes."
    aar "I'll say it again. You surprise me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4309
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_c7ee3827:

    # mc "Prepárate para más sorpresas con los Marks, [aar]."
    mc "Get ready for more surprises with the Marks, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4311
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_5c27be9e:

    # aar "Sobre eso..."
    aar "About that..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4312
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_3b916da8:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa?"
    mc "What's up?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4313
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_82cb7a38:

    # aar "¿Podrías decirle a [bet] que dejara de abrazarme cada vez que me ve?"
    aar "Could you tell [bet] to stop hugging me every time she sees me?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4314
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_e7a4ddae:

    # mc "*Risa* Eres un iluso si crees que vas a conseguir eso."
    mc "*Laugh* You're delusional if you think that's gonna happen."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4315
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_b1e73e56:

    # mc "Ha encontrado un nuevo sobrino-nieto. Buena suerte con que deje de abrazarte."
    mc "She's found a new great-nephew. Good luck getting her to stop hugging you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4317
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_719b1d35:

    # aar "Tenía que intentarlo..."
    aar "I had to try..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4318
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_9aeb76ed:

    # mc "Es una batalla perdida, [aar]. Pero puedes intentar decírselo tú mismo."
    mc "It's a losing battle, [aar]. But you can try telling her yourself."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4320
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_474f4ce4:

    # aar "¿Qué? ¡No! ¡Esa mujer me da miedo! Estoy seguro de que me trataría como a un niño que dice una tontería si lo intento."
    aar "What? No! That woman scares me! I'm sure she'd treat me like a kid saying nonsense if I tried."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4321
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_14833ab2:

    # mc "*Risa* Seguramente es lo que haría."
    mc "*Laugh* That's probably exactly what she'd do."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4322
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_2ce522b5:

    # mc "Pero tienes razón. Debajo de ese aspecto de anciana afable, Tía [bet] es muy dura y puede dar miedo."
    mc "But you're right. Beneath that sweet old lady exterior, Aunt [bet] is really tough and can be scary."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4323
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_7e5a79df:

    # mc "Y tiene un sexto sentido para detectar cosas."
    mc "And she has a sixth sense for picking up on things."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4325
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_26a131b5:

    # aar "¿En plan 'en ocasiones veo muertos'?"
    aar "Sixth sense like in 'I see dead people'?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4326
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_c976430b:

    # mc "*Risa* No, pero detecta cuando alguien guarda un secreto."
    mc "*Laugh* No, but she can tell when someone is keeping a secret."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4327
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_ef9ea1d7:

    # mc "Si descubre que le tienes miedo, estás perdido."
    mc "If she finds out you're afraid of her, you're a goner."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4329
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_b3729bea:

    # aar "*Risa* Mi nivel de miedo se ha incrementado un par de niveles ahora mismo."
    aar "*Laugh* My fear level went up a couple of notches just now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4330
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_8edf7e93:

    # aar "¿Te veo mañana?"
    aar "See you tomorrow?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4331
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_1035461a:

    # mc "Sí, por supuesto."
    mc "Yeah, of course."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4333
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_e91e60c1:

    # "Media hora después de que [aar] se haya ido..."
    "Half an hour after [aar] left..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4334
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4335
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_2a46e597:

    # car "*A través de la puerta* ¿Puedo pasar, Señor?"
    car "*Through the door* May I come in, Sir?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4336
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_75e013e9:

    # mc "Adelante, [car]."
    mc "Come in, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4338
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_0e603514:

    # car "Venía a decirle que me voy a casa."
    car "I came to tell you that I'm going home."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4339
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_db660419:

    # mc "Perfecto, [car], y gracias. Nos vemos el lunes."
    mc "Perfect, [car], and thank you. See you on Monday."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4341
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_b6221dd6:

    # car "¿El lunes? ¿No va a venir mañana?"
    car "Monday? Aren't you coming in tomorrow?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4342
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_bfc9ec9e:

    # mc "Es sábado... ¿Trabajas los sábados?"
    mc "It's Saturday... Do you work on Saturdays?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4344
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_83d0ff1c:

    # car "Casi todo el personal trabaja los sábados, Señor. La Compañía está abierta los 365 días del año."
    car "Almost all the staff works on Saturdays, Sir. The Company is open 365 days a year."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4345
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_5ad60fc8:

    # mc "¿Cuántos días libres tienes a la semana?"
    mc "How many days off do you get a week?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4346
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_312573f0:

    # car "Los domingos y los lunes. El domingo conocerá a [lar], la chica que me sustituye cuando tengo el día libre."
    car "Sundays and Mondays. On Sunday you'll meet [lar], the girl who covers for me when I have my days off."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4347
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_24d33c21:

    # car "Bueno, eso si usted viene a trabajar el domingo... Era el día libre del Sr. Daniels."
    car "Well, that's if you come to work on Sunday... It was Mr. Daniels' day off."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4348
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_f02e70cd:

    # mc "Sí, vendré. Al menos este domingo. Es la operación de [gav] y quiero estar aquí."
    mc "Yes, I'll come. At least this Sunday. It's [gav]'s surgery, and I want to be here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4350
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_48081ed2:

    # car "Es usted... diferente."
    car "You are... different."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4351
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_9267f44a:

    # mc "Si te refieres a diferente de Daniels, me lo tomaré como un cumplido."
    mc "If you mean different from Daniels, I'll take that as a compliment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4353
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_f95f1c9e:

    # car "La Srta. [ama] me ha dicho que le está esperando en el aparcamiento."
    car "Ms. [ama] told me she is waiting for you in the parking lot."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4355
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_8b0ed010:

    # "Tras eso, desaparece sin decirte nada más."
    "After that, she disappears without saying anything else."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4357
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_442334d0:

    # "Al llegar a casa, cenas con [bet] y [ama]."
    "When you get home, you have dinner with [bet] and [ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4358
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_bfdd6feb:

    # "Alguien se ha ocupado de enviar cátering a la casa, que llega 20 minutos después que vosotros."
    "Someone took care of sending catering to the house, which arrives 20 minutes after you do."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4359
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_8b9dbb6e:

    # "Son un acierto con vuestros platos favoritos, aunque [bet] se queja del tamaño de la pizza."
    "They hit the mark with your favorite dishes, although [bet] complains about the size of the pizza."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4360
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_73dd2286:

    # "Nadie se queja porque los postres sean demasiado abundantes."
    "No one complains about the desserts being too plentiful."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4361
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_3ea72f07:

    # "Le tienes que dar las gracias a [car]."
    "You have to thank [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4362
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_3b458c9c:

    # "Os explicáis cómo ha ido vuestro primer y agotador día en NTR."
    "You tell each other how your first and exhausting day at NTR went."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4363
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_1b388b6e:

    # "Hay risas y comentarios sorprendidos. Ha sido menos duro para [ama] de lo que ella creía."
    "There are laughs and surprised comments. It was less tough for [ama] than she thought."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4365
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_e4eddf89:

    # "Vuelves a caer agotado en la cama."
    "You fall into bed exhausted once again."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4366
translate english c31s006_DanielsFate_f7b1ca57:

    # "[ama] vuelve a dormir en tu cama. Para ella también ha sido un día largo."
    "[ama] goes back to sleep in your bed. It's been a long day for her too."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4372
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_d6d5fd1a:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 40 – SÁBADO{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 40 – SATURDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4374
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_aea2d136:

    # "Tu segunda mañana como CEO sigue el mismo patrón que la tarde del primero."
    "Your second morning as CEO follows the same pattern as the afternoon of the first."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4375
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_163c1808:

    # "Alguna visita que deja alguna carpeta sobre tu mesa."
    "The occasional visitor leaving a folder on your desk."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4376
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_64ffe962:

    # "Si no hay visitas, es [car] quién te entrega alguna carpeta nueva."
    "If there are no visitors, it's [car] who hands you a new folder."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4378
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_bafbf60f:

    # "Después de la última carpeta antes de la hora de la comida..."
    "After the last folder before lunchtime..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4379
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_5c69a606:

    # mc "[car], un momento, por favor."
    mc "[car], one moment, please."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4380
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_7a61fa95:

    # car "¿Sí, Señor?"
    car "Yes, Sir?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4381
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_87c206c0:

    # mc "¿Hay alguna razón por la que me estáis trayendo toda la documentación en papel?"
    mc "Is there any reason why you're bringing me all the documentation on paper?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4382
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_2d96cacb:

    # mc "El único email que he recibido con documentación ha sido de [geo]."
    mc "The only email I've received with documentation was from [geo]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4384
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_12e83ca4:

    # car "Al Sr. Daniels le gustaba la documentación en papel. Por eso tiene tantos archivadores aquí."
    car "Mr. Daniels liked printed documentation. That's why he has so many filing cabinets here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4385
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_465d1089:

    # mc "Yo me siento... enterrado bajo todas estas carpetas y dosieres."
    mc "I feel... buried under all these folders and dossiers."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4387
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_0979b03b:

    # car "Entonces... ¿no hace falta que le imprima los emails ni los documentos adjuntos?"
    car "So... I don't need to print out your emails or attachments anymore?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4388
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_3ca00806:

    # mc "Creo que puedes reenviarme directamente lo que pienses que debo leer."
    mc "I think you can just forward me whatever you think I should read."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4389
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_9d943355:

    # mc "Y ¿imprimir un email? Nunca, por favor. Me será más fácil encontrarlos en el portátil que en los archivadores."
    mc "And printing an email? Never, please. It'll be easier for me to find them on my laptop than in the filing cabinets."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4391
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_272c00ba:

    # car "De acuerdo, Señor."
    car "Understood, Sir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4392
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_bd7d9df9:

    # mc "[mc]."
    mc "[mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4393
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_154a2f8b:

    # car "A este paso no iba a poder verle por encima de las carpetas."
    car "At this rate, I wouldn't be able to see you over the folders."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4394
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_f1c6d19f:

    # car "Le haré saber a [lar] que no debe imprimirle los mensajes."
    car "I'll let [lar] know not to print your messages."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4395
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_da378e55:

    # mc "Gracias, [car]."
    mc "Thanks, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4398
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_0c2f92fb:

    # "Unos minutos después, [ama] entra sin llamar con una bolsa en la mano."
    "A few minutes later, [ama] walks in without knocking, holding a bag."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4399
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_729887b3:

    # ama "Necesito salir de aquí."
    ama "I need to get out of here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4400
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_5d36d0c4:

    # mc "¿Qué pasa? Me habías dicho que me enseñarías las instalaciones de entrenamiento hoy."
    mc "What's up? You told me you'd show me the training facilities today."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4401
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_b38e7d1d:

    # mc "Pero he tenido un día... complicado."
    mc "But I've had a... complicated day."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4403
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_8c64f585:

    # ama "Hoy va a ser imposible."
    ama "Today is going to be impossible."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4404
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_22da587c:

    # ama "Se corrió la voz de que íbamos a crear un equipo de vigilancia para Newport."
    ama "Word got out that we were going to create a surveillance team for Newport."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4405
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_cabb2e9e:

    # ama "Tengo más de 90 solicitudes para unirse. ¡Y tengo que entrevistarlos a todos!"
    ama "I have over 90 applications to join. And I have to interview them all!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4406
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_0c1a63ae:

    # mc "No sé cómo se ha podido filtrar. No lo hemos hecho público aún."
    mc "I don't know how it could have leaked. We haven't made it public yet."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4408
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_bfa06431:

    # ama "[dam]. Su solicitud estaba la primera. Te dije que tendríamos que atropellarlo."
    ama "[dam]. His application was the first one. I told you we'd have to run him over."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4409
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_877bd78e:

    # mc "*Risa* Ayer tuve ganas de hacerlo. Coger el No-Tanque y pasarle por encima."
    mc "*Laugh* I felt like doing that yesterday. Taking the Not-Tank and running him over."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4411
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_7086b554:

    # ama "*Risa* IFV. Si vas a dirigir esto, tienes que aprender los nombres de los vehículos y de los dispositivos."
    ama "*Laugh* IFV. If you're going to run this, you have to learn the names of the vehicles and devices."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4412
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_41d5fd3d:

    # mc "En algún sitio entre estas carpetas hay un inventario de todo lo que tenemos. Con fotos para tontos como yo."
    mc "Somewhere among these folders is an inventory of everything we have. With pictures for dummies like me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4413
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_89ff149b:

    # mc "Alguien ha pensado que era buena idea enviármelo."
    mc "Someone thought it was a good idea to send it to me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4415
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_fe3cc708:

    # ama "*Risa* [aar]. Y a él no lo puedes atropellar."
    ama "*Laugh* [aar]. And you can't run him over."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4416
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_53e3513d:

    # mc "*Risa* Es lo malo de que también sea accionista."
    mc "*Laugh* That's the downside of him also being a shareholder."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4417
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_a961595d:

    # mc "Pero me has dicho que querías salir de aquí. ¿Has acabado las entrevistas?"
    mc "But you told me you wanted to get out of here. Are you done with the interviews?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4419
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_cf83b6aa:

    # ama "No, pero tengo una hora y media libre para comer. Quiero enseñarte algo en el campo de entrenamiento."
    ama "No, but I have an hour and a half free for lunch. I want to show you something at the training ground."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4420
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_127b916c:

    # ama "No va a ser la visita turística, pero hay algo que quiero que veas."
    ama "It's not going to be a sightseeing tour, but there's something I want you to see."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4421
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_3c59e95c:

    # mc "¿Por eso vas así vestida en vez de con traje?"
    mc "Is that why you're dressed like that instead of wearing a suit?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4423
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_83feee36:

    # ama "Sí, y en la bolsa tienes ropa para que te cambies tú también."
    ama "Yes, and there are clothes in the bag for you to change into as well."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4424
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_09bd4eb0:

    # mc "Voy. ¿Vas avisando a [car] de que voy a salir durante una hora y media?"
    mc "I'm on it. Can you let [car] know that I'll be out for an hour and a half?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4425
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_0a844e08:

    # mc "No tengo nada en la agenda, pero..."
    mc "I don't have anything on my schedule, but..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4426
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_b8895caf:

    # ama "Voy. No tardes."
    ama "I'm on it. Don't take too long."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4427
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_ab9274b5:

    # mc "Cinco minutos. Cinco minutos reales."
    mc "Five minutes. Five actual minutes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4430
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_09f25124:

    # "Tardas cuatro minutos. Y cuatro minutos después, estáis en un todoterreno militar camino al campo de entrenamiento."
    "It takes you four minutes. And four minutes later, you're in a military car on your way to the training camp."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4431
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_11209234:

    # mc "¿Qué me quieres enseñar?"
    mc "What do you want to show me?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4432
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_9aea9237:

    # ama "¿Te acuerdas del día que se rompió tu cama?"
    ama "Do you remember the day your bed broke?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4433
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_c587b003:

    # mc "Sí, el día que Zeus rompió mi cama."
    mc "Yeah, the day Zeus broke my bed."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4435
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_ff7a6680:

    # ama "Te dije que te enseñaría mi posesión más preciada. No puedo esperar más a enseñártela."
    ama "I told you I'd show you my most prized possessions. I can't wait to show it to you anymore."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4436
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_dcb682b5:

    # mc "También me dijiste que esperabas que no te considerara una psicópata."
    mc "You also told me you hoped I wouldn't consider you a psychopath."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4438
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_75a7f326:

    # ama "Bueno, mi posesión más preciada está junto a... otras cosas."
    ama "Well, my most prized possessions are next to... other things."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4440
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_299c84a1:

    # mc "Veamos qué oscuros secretos esconde mi esposa. No voy a dejar de quererte por ello."
    mc "Let's see what dark secrets my wife is hiding. I won't stop loving you because of it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4442
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_d8a39aca:

    # mc "Veamos qué oscuros secretos escondes. No voy a dejar de quererte por ello."
    mc "Let's see what dark secrets you're hiding. I won't stop loving you because of it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4444
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_937ccf9d:

    # ama "*Risa* Eso espero. Tampoco esperes que guarde las orejas cortadas de todas las personas que he matado."
    ama "*Laugh* I hope so. Don't expect me to keep the severed ears of everyone I've killed, either."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4445
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_480f108c:

    # "La naturalidad con la que lo dice, ente risas, hace que un escalofrío te recorra la espalda."
    "The casual way she says it, between laughter, sends a shiver down your spine."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4446
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_8d66038f:

    # "Nunca podrás llegar a entender del todo a la rubia mercenaria ni a su hermana pelirroja. Eso te produce cierta tristeza."
    "You will never be able to fully understand the blonde mercenary or her redheaded sister. That makes you feel a bit sad."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4447
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_5a740667:

    # "Decides seguir la conversación como si ella estuviera bromeando."
    "You decide to continue the conversation as if she were joking."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4448
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_e4406e69:

    # mc "*Risa fingida* ¿Al menos unos cuantos dientes?"
    mc "*Fake laugh* At least a few teeth?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4450
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_b982ed32:

    # ama "En eso las películas mienten. Es más difícil de lo que parece sacar un diente. Y lleva tiempo que por norma no tenemos."
    ama "Movies lie about that. It's harder than it looks to pull a tooth. And it takes time that we usually don't have."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4451
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_33ef7237:

    # ama "Además, sería bastante asqueroso tener una colección de dientes."
    ama "Besides, it would be pretty disgusting to have a collection of teeth."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4452
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_acec8169:

    # mc "Estoy totalmente de acuerdo."
    mc "I totally agree."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4453
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_14e552be:

    # "Supones que, si sabe cuánto tiempo lleva sacar un diente... Prefieres no preguntar."
    "You figure that, if she knows how long it takes to pull a tooth... You'd rather not ask."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4455
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_c0ed0383:

    # "Seguís vuestro camino unos minutos más antes de que [ama] pare el todoterreno."
    "You continue on your way for a few more minutes before [ama] stops the car."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4456
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_74cd2940:

    # "No seguís ningún camino o carretera que puedas ver, pero [ama] parece muy segura de hacia dónde conduce."
    "You aren't following any path or road that you can see, but [ama] seems very sure of where she's driving."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4459
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_ce0696f3:

    # "Paráis al lado de una valla de alambre de espino."
    "You stop next to a barbed wire fence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4460
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_b9e2c68b:

    # ama "Aquí estamos. Ya puedes bajar del coche."
    ama "Here we are. You can get out of the car now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4461
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_1de52e47:

    # mc "Esto no es el campo de entrenamiento."
    mc "This isn't the training camp."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4463
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_0c5e41c9:

    # ama "*Risa* ¿Quieres un premio por tus dotes de observación?"
    ama "*Laugh* Do you want a prize for your observation skills?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4464
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_6c2f2ec1:

    # ama "El campo de entrenamiento empieza al otro lado de la valla."
    ama "The training camp starts on the other side of the fence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4465
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_a2ac8600:

    # mc "¿Podemos saltarla?"
    mc "Can we jump it?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4467
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_c134d120:

    # ama "No hará falta. Pasaremos por debajo."
    ama "No need. We'll go under it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4468
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_08aa36f9:

    # mc "Te sigo."
    mc "Lead the way."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4470
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_df1542f1:

    # "Camináis unos ciento cincuenta pasos entre pequeños barrancos creados por cursos de agua de lluvia."
    "You walk about a hundred and fifty steps among small gullies created by rainwater runoff."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4471
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_42ad5c91:

    # "Usáis uno de esos barrancos para pasar por debajo de la verja."
    "You use one of those gullies to pass under the fence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4472
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_32ba3773:

    # "Tan solo necesitáis agacharos. Nada de reptar. Tomas nota mental de que hay que hacer algo con los barrancos."
    "You only need to crouch. No crawling. You make a mental note that something needs to be done about the gullies."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4473
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_d52f7618:

    # "Camináis unos cincuenta pasos más después de atravesar la verja."
    "You walk about fifty more steps after crossing the fence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4476
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_db9b9307:

    # ama "Es aquí."
    ama "Here it is."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4477
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_5f4607c0:

    # mc "¿Aquí? No hay nada."
    mc "Here? But there's nothing here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4478
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_10a95077:

    # mc "Es exactamente igual que lo que había treinta metros atrás. Me parece que he visto esa roca tres veces hoy."
    mc "It's exactly the same as thirty meters back there. I think I've seen that rock three times today."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4480
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_5967a00a:

    # "[ama] te sorprende tirándose al suelo."
    "[ama] surprises you by dropping to the ground."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4481
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_690646ab:

    # ama "Excepto por esta madriguera... Un momento... Casi lo tengo."
    ama "Except for this burrow... Just a moment... I almost have it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4482
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_4ec5b0f7:

    # ama "Ha llovido bastante desde la última vez que estuve aquí y hay más tierra del que esperaba."
    ama "It has rained quite a bit since the last time I was here, and there's more dirt than I expected."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4484
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_7bbd55c5:

    # "Al cabo de un rato, [ama] saca una bolsa impermeable bastante sucia."
    "After a while, [ama] pulls out a pretty dirty waterproof bag."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4485
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_0028cf35:

    # "La intenta limpiar con la mano, sin mucho éxito."
    "She tries to wipe it clean with her hand, without much success."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4486
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_58a4054a:

    # mc "¿Qué hay ahí dentro? No es muy grande."
    mc "What's in there? It's not very big."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4488
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_031b17bd:

    # ama "Mis posesiones más preciadas. Ya te lo he dicho. Siéntate."
    ama "I already told you, my most prized possessions. Sit down."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4489
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_4d4c7852:

    # "La tristeza en sus ojos es suficiente como para que te sientes sin abrir la boca."
    "The sadness in her eyes is enough to make you sit down without opening your mouth."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4490
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_4a29174e:

    # "La bolsa es pequeña. Esperas algo con valor sentimental, pero no puedes imaginar qué es."
    "The bag is small. You expect something with sentimental value, but you can't imagine what it is."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4495
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_ae3e3856:

    # "[ama] saca una polaroid de la bolsa. Se ve a una niña con un equipamiento militar que parece demasiado grande para ella."
    "[ama] takes a faded polaroid out of the bag. It shows a little girl in military gear that looks too big for her."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4496
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_1519bf7e:

    # ama "Te presento a Fiona. Es la única foto que existe de ella."
    ama "Meet Fiona. It's the only existing picture of her."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4497
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_7a085a2a:

    # ama "Es de un entrenamiento una semana antes de que muriera."
    ama "It's from a training session a week before she died."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4499
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_0e5674ee:

    # mc "Me recuerda a [eri] más que a [dap]."
    mc "She reminds me of young [eri] more than young [dap]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4501
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_4f2aeb04:

    # mc "Por alguna razón, me imaginaba una [eva] en miniatura. Supongo que por el nombre que le puso a la muñeca."
    mc "For some reason, I imagined a miniature [eva]. I guess because of the name she gave the doll."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4502
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_17129545:

    # mc "Pero me recuerda más a [eri] que a [eva]."
    mc "But she reminds me more of young [eri] than [eva]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4504
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_4a0ca034:

    # ama "Me parece que le hubiera gustado escuchar eso. Era la más empática de todas nosotras."
    ama "I think she would've liked to hear that. She was the most empathetic of all of us."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4505
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_043e1d38:

    # ama "Creo que sí, que se hubiera parecido a [eri] si hubiera tenido la oportunidad."
    ama "I think you are right, she would've been like [eri] if she'd had the chance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4506
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_834e9fe5:

    # mc "Lo siento, [ama]. Siento todo lo que tuvisteis que pasar."
    mc "I'm sorry, [ama]. I'm sorry for everything you guys had to go through."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4507
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_6a5616d7:

    # mc "Siento lo de Fiona. Pero también lo de Clarice, Beatrice o Diana."
    mc "I'm sorry about Fiona. But also about Clarice, Beatrice, and Diana."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4508
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_63223d14:

    # mc "Siento no haber tenido la oportunidad de conocerlas."
    mc "I'm sorry I never got the chance to meet them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4511
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_f7321d28:

    # "Pasáis un rato mirando la foto. Te gustaría abrazar a la mujer que adoras, pero sabes que está enfrascada en sus pensamientos."
    "You spend a while looking at the photo. You'd like to hug the woman you adore, but you know she's deep in thought."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4513
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_a2a37865:

    # "Pasáis un rato mirando la foto. Te gustaría abrazar a la triste mercenaria, pero sabes que está enfrascada en sus pensamientos."
    "You spend a while looking at the photo. You'd like to hug the sad mercenary, but you know she's deep in thought."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4514
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_44855285:

    # "Odias a Daniels por haberte privado de la oportunidad de haber conocido a Diana, Beatrice y Clarice."
    "You hate Daniels for depriving you of the chance to meet Diana, Beatrice, and Clarice."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4515
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_40f021f2:

    # "Odias a Richards, el CEO anterior, porque la muerte de Fiona pasó bajo su mandato."
    "You hate Richards, the CEO before Daniels, because Fiona's death happened under his watch."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4516
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_3007892c:

    # "Pero, sobre todo, compadeces a las chicas. A las vivas y a las muertas. Por lo que pasaron. Por lo que sufrieron."
    "But above all, you pity the girls. The living and the dead. For what they went through. For what they suffered."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4518
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_7f74b570:

    # "También al resto de los clones. Ellos pasaron por lo mismo."
    "And the rest of the clones, too. They went through the same thing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4520
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_ac792836:

    # "También a los clones. Ellos pasaron por lo mismo."
    "And the clones, too. They went through the same thing."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4521
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_c0b79d13:

    # "Ninguno lo merecía."
    "None of them deserved it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4523
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_a8136d8d:

    # mc "¿Estás bien?"
    mc "Are you okay?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4524
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_e5064004:

    # ama "No. Pero tenía ganas de que las conocieras."
    ama "No. But I wanted you to meet them."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4525
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_c6c6b70c:

    # mc "¿Has dicho 'las'?"
    mc "Did you say 'them'?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4530
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_fef26734:

    # ama "Estas son las otras chicas. Bueno, somos..."
    ama "These are the other girls. Well, we are..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4531
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_be330c67:

    # ama "Diana, yo, Beatrice, [eva], y Clarice."
    ama "Diana, me, Beatrice, [eva], and Clarice."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4532
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_3d2bf7e0:

    # mc "Sois tan diferentes entre vosotras... Y se me hace raro verte castaña."
    mc "You're all so different from each other... And it's weird seeing you as a brunette."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4534
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_8b7fa035:

    # ama "Intentábamos mantener la individualidad tiñéndonos el pelo y con diferentes maquillajes."
    ama "We tried to maintain our individuality by dyeing our hair and wearing different makeup."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4535
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_7329578b:

    # ama "Nosotras lo teníamos permitido, al contrario que el resto de los clones."
    ama "We were allowed to do that, unlike the rest of the clones."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4536
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_26f78c73:

    # ama "Diana era la más guapa de nosotras. Sus especialidades eran... la seducción y el asesinato."
    ama "Diana was the prettiest of us. Her specialties were... seduction and assassination."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4537
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_f98baf20:

    # ama "A Beatrice siempre le gustó ser la más fuerte. Se especializó en armamento pesado y en logística."
    ama "Beatrice always liked being the strongest. She specialized in heavy weaponry and logistics."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4538
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_e409203c:

    # ama "Clarice era la más frágil de todas. Estuvo enferma cuando éramos niñas y... Bueno, era la más pequeña junto con Fiona."
    ama "Clarice was the most fragile of us all. She was sick when we were kids and... Well, she was the smallest along with Fiona."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4539
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_0f21242b:

    # ama "Era la especialista en comunicaciones. Pero hubiera machacado a cualquiera en un combate."
    ama "She was the communications specialist. But she would have crushed anyone in a fight."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4540
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_9840f65d:

    # ama "Y a [eva] y a mí, ya nos conoces."
    ama "And [eva] and me, you already know us."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4541
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_68830a2a:

    # mc "¿Cuál era vuestra especialidad?"
    mc "What was your specialty?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4543
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_90632b16:

    # ama "La mía era la vigilancia, interrogatorio y espionaje. Me rompí una pierna a los seis años y estuve un mes pegada a los monitores."
    ama "Mine was surveillance, interrogation, and espionage. I broke my leg when I was six and spent a month glued to the monitors."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4544
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_1cd31f0d:

    # ama "La especialidad de [eva] era... es la infiltración y eliminación."
    ama "[eva]'s specialty was... is... infiltration and elimination."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4545
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_9090a1f8:

    # ama "Fiona hubiera sido nuestra francotiradora."
    ama "Fiona would have been our sniper."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4546
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_e178a7a4:

    # ama "Pero no me malinterpretes. Cualquiera de nosotras podía hacer de todo."
    ama "But don't get me wrong. Any of us could do everything."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4548
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_47b70cce:

    # ama "Bueno... quizás de todo menos la parte de la seducción. Eso sólo lo hicieron Diana y Clarice."
    ama "Well... maybe everything except the seduction part. Only Diana and Clarice did that."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4549
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_368fcaef:

    # mc "Me lo contaste."
    mc "You told me."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4551
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_3c2aed6c:

    # ama "Pero sobre el resto, cualquiera de nosotras podía usar un lanzagranadas o equipo de comunicaciones."
    ama "But as for the rest, any of us could use a grenade launcher or comms equipment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4552
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_37eb576e:

    # ama "Y, obviamente, todas podíamos darle una paliza en el campo de tiro con un M4A1 o con una Glock a cualquiera de la base."
    ama "And, obviously, we could all beat anyone on the base at the shooting range with an M4A1 or a Glock."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4553
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_c90cfebc:

    # ama "Y en combate cuerpo a cuerpo podíamos competir con cualquiera."
    ama "And in hand-to-hand combat, we could compete with anyone."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4554
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_1386d5a0:

    # mc "Me suena muy extraño... Especialistas, pero a la vez generalistas."
    mc "Sounds very strange to me... Specialists, but at the same time generalists."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4556
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_5eef60ce:

    # ama "Nunca sabes lo que te vas a encontrar en una misión. Todas teníamos que saber hacer de todo."
    ama "You never know what you're going to encounter on a mission. We all had to know how to do everything."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4557
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_53f9fb7c:

    # ama "Algunos de los otros operativos están más especializados. Los D son muy buenos con las armas pesadas. Son tipos grandes."
    ama "Some of the other operatives are more specialized. The Ds are really good with heavy weapons. They're big guys."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4558
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_30a0ae8c:

    # ama "Pero nunca serán tan buenos como lo era Beatrice."
    ama "But they'll never be as good as Beatrice was."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4559
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_d56b9c53:

    # mc "Lo entiendo."
    mc "I get it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4560
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_2280aea1:

    # mc "Has dicho que esa era la única foto de Fiona. Es extraño, ¿no?"
    mc "You said that was the only photo of Fiona. That's weird, right?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4561
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_37550ed7:

    # mc "Supongo que tampoco hay muchas fotos de todas vosotras juntas."
    mc "I guess there aren't many photos of all of you together either."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4566
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_692c7fce:

    # ama "Esta es la única que hay, que yo sepa."
    ama "This is the only one there is, as far as I know."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4567
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_d7520798:

    # ama "Las fotos están prohibidas en la base, excepto cuando quieren hacer un cartel publicitario. Y entonces llevamos máscaras."
    ama "Photos are forbidden on the base, except when they want to make a promotional poster. And even then we wear masks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4568
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_72786cbc:

    # ama "Nadie quiere una foto con 10 clones de la serie G circulando por internet. Ni una foto de seis niñas de 6 años entrenando."
    ama "Nobody wants a photo of 10 G-series clones circulating on the internet. Or a photo of six 6-year-old girls training."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4569
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_8dabad0f:

    # mc "Lo pillo. Tanto secretismo..."
    mc "I get it. So much secrecy..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4570
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_3c07ff49:

    # mc "Me alegra que me hayas enseñado estas fotos. Me alegra y me pone triste a la vez."
    mc "I'm glad you showed me these photos. It makes me happy and sad at the same time."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4572
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_76b8b592:

    # ama "La foto de Fiona la hizo Arnau, uno de los hermanos de [aar], con una cámara que entró de contrabando."
    ama "Fiona's photo was taken by Arnau, one of [aar]'s brothers, with a smuggled camera."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4573
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_dc702d85:

    # ama "La nuestra la hizo [aar]. Descubrieron la cámara y se la quitaron."
    ama "Ours was taken by [aar]. They found the camera and took it away."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4574
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_f26029ae:

    # ama "Por eso las guardaba aquí. Era mi escondite secreto. Aquí nadie me las quitaría."
    ama "That's why I kept them here. It was my secret hiding spot. No one could take them from me here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4576
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_191509e1:

    # ama "La última vez que estuve aquí no sabía que no volvería a ver a mis hermanas con vida."
    ama "The last time I was here, I didn't know that I'd never see my sisters alive again."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4577
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_47b414f6:

    # ama "Me hubiera gustado que las hubierais conocido. Y que ellas os hubieran conocido a vosotros."
    ama "I wish you guys could have met them. And that they could have met you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4578
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_e8427a0e:

    # "Sabes que está intentando hacerse la fuerte. La [ama] de casa seguramente ya estaría llorando. La vuelta a Aruba la está cambiando."
    "You know she's trying to act tough. The [ama] from back home would probably be crying by now. Coming back to Aruba is changing her."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4579
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_8908deda:

    # mc "No hace falta que vuelvas a esconderlas. Nadie te va a quitar esas fotos nunca."
    mc "You don't need to hide them anymore. No one is ever going to take those photos from you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4580
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_844d759b:

    # mc "Me ocuparé de ello si alguien lo intenta."
    mc "I'll take care of it if anyone tries."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4582
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_550cd2ea:

    # ama "Gracias, [mc]. Aunque supongo que, ahora que soy propietaria de parte de la empresa, nadie se atrevería a hacerlo."
    ama "Thanks, [mc]. Though I guess now that I own part of the company, no one would dare."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4583
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_d91cc20f:

    # mc "Supongo que no."
    mc "I guess not."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4584
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_863c2920:

    # mc "Pero no veo nada por lo que pueda llamarte psicópata. Tener fotos de tus hermanas no lo es."
    mc "But I don't see anything that would make me call you a psychopath. Having photos of your sisters isn't it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4586
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_54748aeb:

    # ama "Hay algo más en la bolsa."
    ama "There's something else in the bag."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4588
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_c60ffa46:

    # "[ama] saca un trozo de metal de la bolsa y lo deja sobre su rodilla. No entiendes qué puede ser."
    "[ama] takes a piece of metal out of the bag and leaves it on her knee. You have no idea what it could be."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4589
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_81df295e:

    # ama "Es una esquirla del artefacto que mató a Fiona."
    ama "It's a piece of shrapnel from the device that killed Fiona."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4590
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_cda67e0f:

    # ama "Cada una de nosotras se quedó un trozo. Yo escondí el mío aquí y no pude recuperarlo cuando tuvimos que irnos."
    ama "Each of us kept a piece. I hid mine here and couldn't get it back when we had to leave."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4591
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_8149625e:

    # mc "¿Qué tiene eso de malo?"
    mc "What's wrong with that?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4593
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_65f7e344:

    # ama "¿No consideras raro que nos quedáramos un trozo de lo que mató a nuestra hermana?"
    ama "Don't you think it's weird that we kept a piece of the thing that killed our sister?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4594
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_44e7274b:

    # mc "No es usual, pero he visto madres que llevan un mechón de pelo de su hijo muerto colgado al cuello y..."
    mc "It's not common, but I've seen mothers wearing a lock of their dead child's hair around their necks and..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4595
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_49ad248f:

    # mc "Espera... Enséñame la foto donde estáis las cinco otra vez."
    mc "Wait... Show me the picture of the five of you again."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4600
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_bd368d65:

    # mc "El corazón que lleva [eva] al cuello siempre... ¿Es su trozo del explosivo?"
    mc "The heart [eva] always wears around her neck... Is that her piece of the explosive?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4602
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_22c2d107:

    # ama "Sí. Es el trozo más grande. El que la mató. Le dio forma de corazón y se hizo un colgante."
    ama "Yes. It's the biggest piece. The one that killed her. She shaped it into a heart and made a pendant out of it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4603
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_4c4fe98d:

    # ama "Por eso lo lleva siempre consigo. Es su forma de que Fiona... vea el mundo que se perdió."
    ama "That's why she always wears it. It's her way of letting Fiona... see the world she missed out on."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4604
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_655658b1:

    # ama "Sé que puede sonar retorcido para cualquiera que no seamos sus hermanas, pero..."
    ama "I know it might sound twisted to anyone other than her sisters, but..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4605
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_03aed379:

    # mc "No es retorcido, [ama]. Es un gesto muy bonito por parte de [eva]."
    mc "It's not twisted, [ama]. It's a very sweet gesture on [eva]'s part."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4607
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_5d8674bc:

    # ama "No le digas que te lo he dicho yo. Ni siquiera que lo has deducido tú."
    ama "Don't tell her I told you. Not even that you figured it out yourself."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4608
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_61af9c86:

    # ama "Seguramente me mataría y después se sentiría muy sola por ser la única viva de las seis."
    ama "She'd probably kill me and then feel very lonely being the only one alive out of the six of us."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4609
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_c77894c6:

    # mc "Eso sería muy típico de [eva]. No te preocupes, no le diré nada."
    mc "That would be very typical of [eva]. Don't worry, I won't say anything."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4610
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_9122b12e:

    # mc "Le pregunté por el corazón y me dijo que me lo contaría algún día. Tengo que darle la oportunidad de hacerlo cuando esté preparada."
    mc "I asked her about the heart and she told me she'd tell me about it someday. I have to give her the chance to do that when she's ready."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4613
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_ae79eb17:

    # "[ama] se levanta después de meter las fotos y el fragmento en la bolsa de nuevo."
    "[ama] stands up after putting the photos and the fragment back into the bag."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4614
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_ef2df167:

    # "No la devuelve a la madriguera, sino que la mete en uno de los bolsillos de sus pantalones."
    "She doesn't put it back in the hiding spot, but instead puts it in one of her pants pockets."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4615
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_168388e6:

    # ama "Y ahora deberíamos irnos. Nuestra hora y media casi ha pasado ya. Aún tengo que entrevistar a varios operativos hoy."
    ama "And now we should get going. Our hour and a half is almost up. I still have to interview several operatives today."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4616
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_396d4bef:

    # ama "Y a [car] no le va a gustar si llegas tarde."
    ama "And [car] won't like it if you're late."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4617
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_9ec71eb9:

    # mc "¿Tenemos tiempo para hacer una cosa?"
    mc "Do we have time to do one thing?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4618
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_e474bb73:

    # ama "Depende. ¿Qué quieres hacer?"
    ama "Depends. What do you want to do?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4620
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_902b3dcc:

    # "Te levantas y la abrazas. No tienes palabras para expresar lo que sientes. Tus brazos alrededor de su cuerpo tendrán que transmitir el mensaje."
    "You stand up and hug her. You have no words to express what you feel. Your arms around her body will have to convey the message."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4622
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_95ec8f3f:

    # "Por primera vez desde que ha sacado la bolsa de la madriguera, [ama] deja sus sentimientos fluir."
    "For the first time since she took the bag out of the hideout, [ama] lets her feelings flow."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4623
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_d5276be1:

    # "Odias hacerla llorar, pero estas lágrimas también forman parte de su proceso de curación."
    "You hate making her cry, but these tears are also part of her healing process."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4624
translate english c31s007_AmaTour_0bb7ae79:

    # "A ninguno de los dos os importa llegar un poco tarde a la siguiente cita de vuestra agenda."
    "Neither of you cares about being a little late to the next appointment on your schedule."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4628
translate english c31s007_surgery_ea02b104:

    # "El resto del día transcurre con lo que parece que es la nueva normalidad."
    "The rest of the day passes with what seems to be the new normal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4629
translate english c31s007_surgery_b69f9398:

    # "Al menos, las carpetas dejan de acumularse encima de tu mesa."
    "At least the folders stop piling up on your desk."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4631
translate english c31s007_surgery_50007757:

    # "Al volver a la Casa del CEO, y tras ducharos, cenáis el cátering que [car] ha encargado."
    "Upon returning to the CEO's House, and after showering, you eat the catering that [car] ordered for dinner."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4632
translate english c31s007_surgery_6f280d90:

    # "Otra vez ha vuelto a acertar con platos que os gustan. Tienes que enterarte de cómo lo hace."
    "Once again she nailed it with dishes you like. You have to find out how she does it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4633
translate english c31s007_surgery_8b9e4664:

    # "[bet] está un poco nerviosa con la operación del día siguiente."
    "[bet] is a little nervous about the next day's surgery."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4634
translate english c31s007_surgery_91b38331:

    # "Se ha pasado los dos días reunida con cirujanos e ingenieros, y ensayando la operación."
    "She has spent the last two days meeting with surgeons and engineers, and rehearsing the surgery."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4635
translate english c31s007_surgery_f357ce29:

    # "Cree que saldrá bien, pero es una operación que no se ha hecho nunca. Hay demasiadas cosas que podrían salir mal."
    "She thinks it'll go well, but it's a surgery that has never been done before. There are too many things that could go wrong."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4637
translate english c31s007_surgery_9117775c:

    # "Esta vez, las dos mujeres deciden dormir contigo."
    "This time, the two women decide to sleep with you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4638
translate english c31s007_surgery_117c5f6b:

    # "Os acostáis pronto. La cirugía de [gav] está planificada para las 10 AM."
    "You go to bed early. [gav]'s surgery is scheduled for 10 AM."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4639
translate english c31s007_surgery_7ea9f7c2:

    # "La cama es lo suficientemente grande para los tres."
    "The bed is big enough for the three of you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4641
translate english c31s007_surgery_66562efc:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 41 – DOMINGO{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 41 – SUNDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4643
translate english c31s007_surgery_6ef2d0b1:

    # "Por la mañana, [bet] apenas toca los croissants recién hechos que [car] envía cada mañana."
    "In the morning, [bet] barely touches the freshly baked croissants that [car] sends every morning."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4644
translate english c31s007_surgery_4cc9ee8e:

    # "Si necesitabas alguna muestra de lo nerviosa que está, eso es más que suficiente."
    "If you needed any sign of how nervous she is, that's more than enough."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4646
translate english c31s007_surgery_35bcb1b1:

    # "Llegas a tu despacho un poco antes de las 8. Se te hace raro no ver a [car] al llegar."
    "You arrive at your office a little before 8. It feels weird not seeing [car] when you arrive."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4647
translate english c31s007_surgery_19ad6719:

    # "Las carpetas han desaparecido de tu mesa y un montón de emails han aparecido en tu bandeja de entrada."
    "The folders have disappeared from your desk and a bunch of emails have appeared in your inbox."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4648
translate english c31s007_surgery_2e8b336a:

    # "Hay un café esperándote, con lo que [lar] seguramente ya está en el edificio."
    "There's a coffee waiting for you, which means [lar] is probably already in the building."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4649
translate english c31s007_surgery_6e2893d5:

    # "Crees que vas a adorar la eficiencia de [car]."
    "You think you're going to love [car]'s efficiency."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4652
translate english c31s007_surgery_f00b0076:

    # "Cuando llevas unos minutos leyendo correos electrónicos..."
    "After a few minutes of reading emails..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4653
translate english c31s007_surgery_26e21393:

    # lar "¡Oops! No sabía que había llegado ya."
    lar "Oops! I didn't know you had arrived already."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4654
translate english c31s007_surgery_293e4618:

    # mc "Buenos días. Supongo que eres [lar]. Soy [mc]. Encantado de conocerte."
    mc "Good morning. I assume you're [lar]. I'm [mc]. Nice to meet you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4656
translate english c31s007_surgery_230e9949:

    # lar "Buenos días, Sr. Marks. Sí, soy [lar], su asistente los domingos y los lunes."
    lar "Good morning, Mr. Marks. Yes, I'm [lar], your assistant on Sundays and Mondays."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4657
translate english c31s007_surgery_5f9e6b36:

    # mc "Encantado de conocerte, [lar]."
    mc "Nice to meet you, [lar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4659
translate english c31s007_surgery_f03da9f8:

    # lar "He archivado todas las carpetas que [car] me indicó. Si las quiere consultar, las tiene en..."
    lar "I've filed all the folders that [car] told me to. If you want to check them, they are in..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4660
translate english c31s007_surgery_892040b7:

    # mc "No hace falta. He visto que [car] me envió correos con la documentación. Dudo que necesite las carpetas."
    mc "No need. I saw that [car] sent me emails with the documentation. I doubt I'll need the folders."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4661
translate english c31s007_surgery_0f24195a:

    # lar "Perfecto, Señor."
    lar "Perfect, sir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4663
translate english c31s007_surgery_70cc744a:

    # lar "Si me necesita estaré ahí fuera."
    lar "If you need me, I'll be right outside."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4664
translate english c31s007_surgery_4e5b80f5:

    # mc "Gracias, [lar]."
    mc "Thank you, [lar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4667
translate english c31s007_surgery_63f6a1b1:

    # "Cuando se acerca la hora de la operación..."
    "As the time for the surgery approaches..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4668
translate english c31s007_surgery_c5caecb7:

    # mc "[lar], voy a ir a las instalaciones médicas. Si sale algo {b}urgente{/b}, avísame, por favor."
    mc "[lar], I'm going to the medical facilities. If anything {b}urgent{/b} comes up, please let me know."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4669
translate english c31s007_surgery_54a5742e:

    # lar "Entiendo, Señor. Solo lo verdaderamente urgente."
    lar "I understand, Sir. Only what's truly urgent."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4670
translate english c31s007_surgery_ac67d23a:

    # mc "Hoy, lo urgente es la cirugía de [gav]. El resto puede esperar a menos que se caiga el cielo sobre nuestras cabezas."
    mc "Today, the urgent thing is [gav]'s surgery. The rest can wait unless the sky falls on our heads."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4672
translate english c31s007_surgery_306f80db:

    # "[aar] ya está allí, junto a un G que no conoces."
    "[aar] is already there, next to a G you haven't met."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4673
translate english c31s007_surgery_6f5648e0:

    # mc "Buenos días, [aar]. Buenos días..."
    mc "Good morning, [aar]. Good morning..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4674
translate english c31s007_surgery_1fa85298:

    # gid "[gid], Señor. Buenos días."
    gid "[gid], Sir. Good morning."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4675
translate english c31s007_surgery_816e2552:

    # aar "Buenos días, [mc]."
    aar "Good morning, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4676
translate english c31s007_surgery_5434f45c:

    # mc "¿Vamos según lo previsto?"
    mc "Is everything going according to plan?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4678
translate english c31s007_surgery_c43223f3:

    # aar "De momento sí. [bet] aún no ha entrado en el quirófano."
    aar "For now, yes. [bet] hasn't entered the operating room yet."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4679
translate english c31s007_surgery_d8e3f095:

    # mc "Me lo imaginaba como en las series de TV."
    mc "I imagined it like in the TV shows."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4680
translate english c31s007_surgery_d3807f28:

    # mc "Creía que podríamos ver cómo se hace la operación en directo, desde un balcón o algo por el estilo."
    mc "I thought we could watch the operation live, from a balcony or something like that."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4681
translate english c31s007_surgery_72f81c55:

    # aar "Nunca hemos necesitado ese tipo de instalación. En ese quirófano se suelen tratar heridas de combate."
    aar "We've never needed that kind of facility. That operating room is usually used to treat combat wounds."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4682
translate english c31s007_surgery_d56b9c53:

    # mc "Lo entiendo."
    mc "I get it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4683
translate english c31s007_surgery_f5935eeb:

    # aar "Uno de los asistentes de [bet] nos traerá noticias de vez en cuando. Si hay algo interesante que contar."
    aar "One of [bet]'s assistants will bring us updates from time to time. If there's anything interesting to report."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4684
translate english c31s007_surgery_8f535801:

    # gid "Con su permiso, voy a retirarme. Mi turno empieza en unos minutos."
    gid "If you'll excuse me, I'm going to take my leave. My shift starts in a few minutes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4685
translate english c31s007_surgery_c7e29479:

    # mc "Por supuesto, [gid]." (multiple=2)
    mc "Of course, [gid]." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4686
translate english c31s007_surgery_c62cdc45:

    # aar "Adelante, [gid]." (multiple=2)
    aar "Go ahead, [gid]." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4687
translate english c31s007_surgery_4a4472e4:

    # "Ninguno de los dos sabéis a quién se dirigía. No importa."
    "Neither of you knows who he was addressing. It doesn't matter."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4689
translate english c31s007_surgery_13e94e4b:

    # aar "¿Cómo está [bet]?"
    aar "How is [bet]?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4690
translate english c31s007_surgery_b3f642c9:

    # mc "Nerviosa. Supongo que es lo que tiene hacer una cirugía única."
    mc "Nervous. I guess that's what comes with performing a unique surgery."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4691
translate english c31s007_surgery_34a1e70a:

    # mc "Yo no sé si podría estar concentrado todo el tiempo en una operación que durara seis horas."
    mc "I don't know if I could stay focused the entire time during a six-hour operation."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4692
translate english c31s007_surgery_b78f8095:

    # aar "Los cirujanos están hechos de otra pasta. Saben lo que un despiste puede representar para sus pacientes."
    aar "Surgeons are cut from a different cloth. They know what a single slip-up can mean for their patients."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4694
translate english c31s007_surgery_2a327b37:

    # "Para tu sorpresa, [car] aparece en la sala de espera. Se queda en un rincón."
    "To your surprise, [car] appears in the waiting room. She sits in a lone chair."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4696
translate english c31s007_surgery_bdeda2e4:

    # mc "[aar], voy a dejarte un momento. quiero hablar con [car]."
    mc "[aar], I'm going to leave you for a moment. I want to talk to [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4697
translate english c31s007_surgery_244012f6:

    # aar "No hay problema."
    aar "No problem."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4699
translate english c31s007_surgery_9d268e96:

    # mc "Buenos días, [car]. No esperaba verte aquí."
    mc "Good morning, [car]. I didn't expect to see you here."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4700
translate english c31s007_surgery_ef4f2a5e:

    # car "He conocido a [gav]... a todos estos chicos... desde que nacieron."
    car "I've known [gav]... all these kids... since they were born."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4701
translate english c31s007_surgery_20dbf9c5:

    # car "Creo que no podría quedarme en casa durante la operación sin subirme por las paredes."
    car "I don't think I could stay home during the surgery without going crazy."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4702
translate english c31s007_surgery_cf9e99c3:

    # car "Yo tampoco esperaba verle aquí, Señor."
    car "I didn't expect to see you here either, Sir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4703
translate english c31s007_surgery_33778031:

    # mc "Te dije que vendría hoy."
    mc "I told you I'd come today."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4705
translate english c31s007_surgery_55552d4e:

    # car "Lo sé. Pero creía que esperaría los resultados en su despacho. Los señores Richards y Daniels..."
    car "I know. But I thought you'd wait for the results in your office. Mr. Richards and Mr. Daniels..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4706
translate english c31s007_surgery_43265ac1:

    # mc "No soy ni Richards ni Daniels, [car]. Quizás mi forma de hacer las cosas no sea tan eficiente, pero..."
    mc "I'm neither Richards nor Daniels, [car]. Maybe my way of doing things isn't as efficient, but..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4707
translate english c31s007_surgery_90d11605:

    # mc "La cirugía de [gav] me importa."
    mc "I care about [gav]'s surgery."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4709
translate english c31s007_surgery_4e81318d:

    # car "Ya le dije que era usted diferente, Señor."
    car "I already told you that you were different, Sir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4710
translate english c31s007_surgery_d04eb723:

    # mc "Y yo te dije que me lo tomaba como un cumplido."
    mc "And I told you I took it as a compliment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4711
translate english c31s007_surgery_d9330084:

    # car "En este caso, lo es."
    car "In this case, it is."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4713
translate english c31s007_surgery_7b9d0210:

    # "[ama] llega junto con [cal] unos minutos antes de que empiece la cirugía."
    "[ama] arrives along with [cal] a few minutes before the surgery starts."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4715
translate english c31s007_surgery_e8de27bb:

    # "El tiempo, más que pasar, repta en los relojes en el momento en que la operación empieza."
    "Time, rather than passing, crawls on the clocks the moment the operation begins."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4716
translate english c31s007_surgery_44e060b7:

    # "Las conversaciones decaen al mismo ritmo."
    "Conversations die down at the same rate."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4718
translate english c31s007_surgery_6933e30b:

    # "No hay nada que ver en esta sala. Y la puerta por la que debería aparecer el asistente que tiene que traer noticias no se abre."
    "There is nothing to see in this room. And the door through which the assistant who is supposed to bring news should appear doesn't open."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4720
translate english c31s007_surgery_24355797:

    # "Te lo tomas como una buena señal. Tienes confianza ciega en [bet] como cirujana."
    "You take it as a good sign. You have blind faith in [bet] as a surgeon."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4722
translate english c31s007_surgery_d058b5bd:

    # "Algunos clones aparecen de vez en cuando. Echan una ojeada a la sala antes de volver a irse."
    "Some clones show up from time to time. They take a peek into the room before leaving again."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4724
translate english c31s007_surgery_18b70d76:

    # "Cada vez que uno de ellos aparece, te da la impresión de ser observado."
    "Every time one of them shows up, you get the feeling you're being watched."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4726
translate english c31s007_surgery_fde3c3ac:

    # "Como si quisieran asegurarse de que el nuevo CEO está en la sala, preocupándose por cómo va la cirugía de uno de los suyos."
    "As if they want to make sure the new CEO is in the room, worrying about how the surgery of one of their own is going."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4728
translate english c31s007_surgery_a5f9d4a0:

    # "[mael] aparece hacia el final de la operación. Él también está interesado en saber cómo va todo."
    "[mael] shows up towards the end of the operation. He is also interested in knowing how everything is going."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4729
translate english c31s007_surgery_2856c1b6:

    # "Aunque quizás sus razones son diferentes de las tuyas."
    "Although perhaps his reasons are different from yours."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4731
translate english c31s007_surgery_8813668f:

    # "Las seis horas llegan y pasan. El maldito asistente no aparece para dar ninguna explicación."
    "Six hours come and go. The damn assistant doesn't show up to give any explanation."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4733
translate english c31s007_surgery_6eef5cfb:

    # "Cuando la séptima hora de la cirugía se está acercando, por fin se abre la puerta que todos lleváis una hora mirando."
    "As the seventh hour of the surgery approaches, the door you've all been staring at for an hour finally opens."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4734
translate english c31s007_surgery_3d6be1e6:

    # ass "La operación ha sido un éxito. Todo ha salido como esperábamos. El paciente está en observación."
    ass "The operation was a success. Everything went as expected. The patient is under observation."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4736
translate english c31s007_surgery_40ac48e0:

    # "Puedes ver las emociones reflejadas en las caras de los presentes."
    "You can see the emotions reflected on the faces of everyone present."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4737
translate english c31s007_surgery_662bdd9c:

    # "Hay alivio, alegría, e incluso alguna mirada calculadora."
    "There is relief, joy, and even a calculating look or two."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4738
translate english c31s007_surgery_eb37aced:

    # "Incluso hay unos ojos inquisitivos que estudian tu reacción."
    "There are even some inquisitive eyes studying your reaction."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4740
translate english c31s007_surgery_7c16b76a:

    # "Todo el mundo va desapareciendo de la sala, dejándote solo con [ama]."
    "Everyone slowly leaves the room, leaving you alone with [ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4742
translate english c31s007_surgery_cb167bc5:

    # ama "¿Vas a quedarte aquí?"
    ama "Are you going to stay here?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4743
translate english c31s007_surgery_4a0e9d80:

    # mc "Sí. Quiero hablar con Tía [bet] y que me explique cómo ha ido todo. Sé que no voy a entender ni la mitad de lo que me diga, pero..."
    mc "Yes. I want to talk to Aunt [bet] and have her explain how everything went. I know I won't understand half of what she tells me, but..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4744
translate english c31s007_surgery_682c1495:

    # ama "Lo entiendo. Yo tengo que ir un momento a mi despacho y volveré en cuanto pueda."
    ama "I understand. I have to go to my office for a moment, but I'll be back as soon as I can."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4745
translate english c31s007_surgery_b44d7909:

    # mc "¿Más entrevistas?"
    mc "More interviews?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4747
translate english c31s007_surgery_b0f46c42:

    # ama "No. Nadie quería hacer una entrevista hoy. Todos estarían pensando en la cirugía."
    ama "No. Nobody wanted to do an interview today. Everyone would be thinking about the surgery."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4748
translate english c31s007_surgery_f25da4af:

    # ama "La mayoría de la gente aprecia a [gav]."
    ama "Most people like [gav]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4749
translate english c31s007_surgery_1d39dbd0:

    # ama "Tengo que comprobar el cambio de turnos de guardia tan solo."
    ama "I just have to check the guard shift changes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4750
translate english c31s007_surgery_1da6a712:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Te veo luego."
    mc "I get it. See you later."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4752
translate english c31s007_surgery_11598801:

    # "Te quedas solo en la sala de espera. No hay nada que ver ni ninguna nueva noticia que recibir."
    "You're left alone in the waiting room. There's nothing to see and no new news."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4753
translate english c31s007_surgery_df85b949:

    # "Tan solo esperar a Tía [bet]. Pasas unos minutos mirando la puerta."
    "Just waiting for Aunt [bet]. You spend a few minutes staring at the door."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4756
translate english c31s007_surgery_d45f3ced:

    # "Ella aparece quince minutos después. El tiempo ha vuelto a moverse a su velocidad habitual."
    "She appears fifteen minutes later. Time has gone back to moving at its usual speed."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4757
translate english c31s007_surgery_2d81eaa5:

    # bet "No esperaba que quedara nadie aquí. Venía a por un café."
    bet "I didn't expect anyone to still be here. I just came for a coffee."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4758
translate english c31s007_surgery_be261e8b:

    # mc "¿Todo bien en la cirugía?"
    mc "Everything okay with the surgery?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4760
translate english c31s007_surgery_c9b11614:

    # bet "Todo perfecto. Incluso mejor que perfecto. El resto de los cirujanos son muy buenos en lo suyo."
    bet "Everything's perfect. Even better than perfect. The rest of the surgeons are very good at what they do."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4761
translate english c31s007_surgery_f27c6efb:

    # bet "El chico se va a recuperar de la operación antes de lo que esperaba."
    bet "The kid is going to recover from the surgery sooner than I expected."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4762
translate english c31s007_surgery_7762f78f:

    # mc "Eso es bueno. ¿Cómo ha ido todo? ¿Cuál será el siguiente paso?"
    mc "That's good. How did everything go? What's the next step?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4764
translate english c31s007_surgery_12e96dec:

    # "Ella te explica cómo ha ido la cirugía. Como imaginabas, no entiendes ni una cuarta parte de lo que te explica."
    "She explains how the surgery went. As you imagined, you don't understand even a quarter of what she's explaining."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4765
translate english c31s007_surgery_5569ce06:

    # bet "Tendremos a [gav] en observación durante unos días. No queremos que se infecte la herida."
    bet "We'll keep [gav] under observation for a few days. We don't want the wound to get infected."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4766
translate english c31s007_surgery_6ff9db01:

    # bet "Con un poco de suerte, podremos encender el brazo en una semana y ver cómo reacciona."
    bet "With a little luck, we'll be able to turn on the arm in a week and see how he reacts."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4767
translate english c31s007_surgery_d3e1e5ee:

    # mc "¿Podré estar cuando lo hagáis?"
    mc "Will I be able to be there when you do it?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4769
translate english c31s007_surgery_d68d4772:

    # bet "No lo había pensado, pero me parece que es una buena idea que estés cuando lo hagamos."
    bet "I hadn't thought about it, but I think it's a good idea for you to be there when we do it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4770
translate english c31s007_surgery_2eddb174:

    # bet "Que seas el último que queda aquí demuestra lo que te importa esto."
    bet "The fact that you're the last one left here shows how much you care about this."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4771
translate english c31s007_surgery_fa39a046:

    # bet "Seguramente alguien está hablando de ello ahora mismo en la base."
    bet "Someone is probably talking about it right now around the base."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4772
translate english c31s007_surgery_43bd1d06:

    # mc "Eso no me importa demasiado ahora mismo."
    mc "I don't really care about that right now."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4773
translate english c31s007_surgery_875b4e55:

    # mc "¿Tú cómo estás?"
    mc "How are you doing?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4775
translate english c31s007_surgery_a860f15f:

    # bet "Agotada. Pero muy contenta. Ha habido un momento en que creía que no lo lograríamos."
    bet "Exhausted. But very happy. There was a moment when I thought we wouldn't make it."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4776
translate english c31s007_surgery_dae02f71:

    # bet "Pero todo ha salido bien al final."
    bet "But everything turned out fine in the end."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4777
translate english c31s007_surgery_b77a74c6:

    # bet "Ahora tengo ganas de darme una ducha. Aún puedo notar el sudor corriéndome por la espalda."
    bet "Now I just want to take a shower. I can still feel the sweat running down my back."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4778
translate english c31s007_surgery_b5bc5456:

    # mc "Entonces no te entretengo más. Te veo luego para ir a casa."
    mc "Then I won't keep you any longer. I'll see you later so we can go home."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4780
translate english c31s007_surgery_3a86df9c:

    # bet "No voy a ir a casa. Quiero quedarme aquí a pasar la noche por si hay alguna complicación."
    bet "I'm not going home. I want to stay here for the night in case there are any complications."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4781
translate english c31s007_surgery_9ff6f9b6:

    # mc "Pero estás agotada..."
    mc "But you're exhausted..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4782
translate english c31s007_surgery_d99a2dda:

    # bet "El resto de los cirujanos están igual de agotados que yo. Pero es mi operación."
    bet "The rest of the surgeons are just as exhausted as I am. But it's my surgery."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4784
translate english c31s007_surgery_59c27817:

    # mc "Gracias por todo, Tía [bet]."
    mc "Thanks for everything, Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4785
translate english c31s007_surgery_dafd98c2:

    # bet "Gracias a ti por darme la oportunidad de ayudar al chico."
    bet "Thank you for giving me the chance to help the boy."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4787
translate english c31s007_surgery_5eedca3f:

    # "Vuelves a tu despacho y le das las noticias a [lar]. Obviamente, ya las sabía."
    "You go back to your office and give the news to [lar]. Obviously, she already knew."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4789
translate english c31s007_surgery_cb4e7a9f:

    # "Te sientas tras tu escritorio y miras al vacío durante un rato."
    "You sit behind your desk and stare at the walls for a while."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4790
translate english c31s007_surgery_a849c7e5:

    # "Ahora empieza la espera."
    "Now the waiting game begins."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4795
translate english c31s007_ama_5e64d07e:

    # "Al cabo de unos 40 minutos..."
    "After about 40 minutes..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4796
translate english c31s007_ama_56411a58:

    # ama "Acabo de hablar con Tía [bet]. Me ha explicado todo lo de la operación."
    ama "I just talked to Aunt [bet]. She explained everything about the surgery."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4797
translate english c31s007_ama_3df02708:

    # ama "Es genial que todo haya ido tan bien."
    ama "It's great that everything went so well."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4798
translate english c31s007_ama_6580b0cb:

    # mc "Desde luego que sí. [gav] se lo merece, y [eva] no merece tener que cargar con esa culpa."
    mc "Absolutely. [gav] deserves it, and [eva] doesn't deserve to carry that guilt."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4799
translate english c31s007_ama_29adea49:

    # ama "[eva] se va a poner muy contenta."
    ama "[eva] is going to be very happy."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4802
translate english c31s007_ama_d527c7c8:

    # ama "Tía [bet] me ha dicho que va a pasar la noche aquí..."
    ama "Aunt [bet] told me she's going to spend the night at the medical facilities..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4803
translate english c31s007_ama_5f57d6d8:

    # ama "¿Te apetece que salgamos a cenar a Oranjestad? Aún no has tenido oportunidad de visitarla..."
    ama "Do you want to go out for dinner in Oranjestad? You haven't had the chance to visit it yet..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4804
translate english c31s007_ama_b68ffdd9:

    # mc "Me encantaría. Y si no es en la ciudad, me da lo mismo si es en la playa, mientras sea contigo."
    mc "I'd love to. And if it's not in the city, I don't care if it's on the beach, as long as it's with you."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4806
translate english c31s007_ama_b28bb679:

    # ama "¡Genial! Dile a [aar] que te lleve a casa. Yo me voy ya. ¡Tengo unas cosas que hacer!"
    ama "Great! Tell [aar] to take you home. I'm leaving now. I have some things to do!"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4808
translate english c31s007_ama_6e734612:

    # "*Blam*"
    "*Blam*"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4809
translate english c31s007_ama_ecc08f69:

    # mcp "(Me lo tomaré como que va a ser nuestra primera cita real.)"
    mcp "(I'll take that as this is going to be our first real date.)"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4810
translate english c31s007_ama_ba089e8c:

    # ama "*A través de la puerta* [lar], ¿sabes si hay una plancha en la casa del CEO?"
    ama "*Through the door* [lar], do you know if there's an iron at the CEO's house?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4812
translate english c31s007_ama_d6744449:

    # "Al llegar a casa..."
    "Upon arriving home..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4813
translate english c31s007_ama_814504cd:

    # mc "¿[ama]?"
    mc "[ama]?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4814
translate english c31s007_ama_7395eff6:

    # ama "*Desde la planta inferior* Estoy acabando de arreglarme. Ve duchándote si quieres."
    ama "*From downstairs* I'm just finishing getting ready. Go take a shower if you want."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4816
translate english c31s007_ama_df6011ca:

    # "Después de la ducha vuelves a la cocina y la sigues encontrando vacía."
    "After your shower, you go back to the kitchen and still find it empty."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4817
translate english c31s007_ama_1d47d51e:

    # "Tan vacía como que no hay cátering hoy. Supones que [ama] ha avisado a [lar]."
    "So empty that there's no catering today. You assume [ama] told [lar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4818
translate english c31s007_ama_814504cd_1:

    # mc "¿[ama]?"
    mc "[ama]?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4819
translate english c31s007_ama_518ce32b:

    # ama "Estoy en la terraza."
    ama "I'm on the terrace."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4825
translate english c31s007_ama_89600869:

    # ama "Nos podemos ir cuando quieras. Hoy conduces tú."
    ama "We can leave whenever you want. You are the one driving today."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4826
translate english c31s007_ama_685bab2d:

    # mc "Estás increíblemente preciosa."
    mc "You look incredibly gorgeous."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4829
translate english c31s007_ama_46b42504:

    # ama "Bueno, te veo en un rato para ir a casa."
    ama "Well, I'll see you in a bit to head home."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4830
translate english c31s007_ama_5e2b3b52:

    # mc "Perfecto, [ama]."
    mc "Perfect, [ama]."

translate english strings:

    # game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:30
    old "Asistente"
    new "Assistant"
